#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:37
msgid ""
"You can add the {productname} endpoints to Keycloak.  Keycloak refers to "
"endpoints as clients."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ {productname} endpoints ໃສ່ Keycloak. Keycloak ເອີ້ນ endpoints ວ່າ clients."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Endpoints as Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມ Endpoints ເປັນ Clients"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:39
msgid "In the Keycloak {webui}, create a new client using these details:"
msgstr "ໃນ Keycloak {webui}, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ client ໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ລາຍລະອຽດດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:40
msgid "In the ``Client type`` field, select ``SAML``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Client type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ``SAML``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:41
msgid ""
"In the ``Client ID`` field, enter the endpoint specified in the server "
"configuration file as ``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Client ID``, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ endpoint ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າເຊີເວີເປັນ ``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:42
msgid "For example, ``https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:43
msgid "In the ``Settings`` tab, fine-tune the client using these details:"
msgstr "ໃນແທັບ ``Settings``, ໃຫ້ປັບແຕ່ງ client ໂດຍໃຊ້ລາຍລະອຽດດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:44
msgid "Toggle the ``Sign assertions`` switch to ``On``."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນສະວິດ ``Sign assertions`` ເປັນ ``On``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:45
msgid "In the ``Signature algorithm`` field, select ``RSA_SHA1``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``Signature algorithm``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ``RSA_SHA1``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:46
msgid "In the ``SAML Signature Key Name`` field, select ``Key ID``."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ ``SAML Signature Key Name``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ``Key ID``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:47
msgid "In the ``Keys`` tab:"
msgstr "ໃນແທັບ ``Keys``:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:48
msgid "Set ``Client signature required`` to ``Off``."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``Client signature required`` ເປັນ ``Off``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:49
msgid ""
"In the ``Advanced`` tab, in the ``Fine Grain SAML Endpoint Configuration`` "
"section, add the two endpoints using these details:"
msgstr "ໃນແທັບ ``Advanced``, ໃນສ່ວນ ``Fine Grain SAML Endpoint Configuration``, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມສອງ endpoints ໂດຍໃຊ້ລາຍລະອຽດດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In both the ``Assertion Consumer Service`` fields, enter the endpoint "
"specified in the server configuration file as "
"``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url``."
msgstr "ໃນທັງສອງຊ່ອງ ``Assertion Consumer Service``, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ endpoint ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າເຊີເວີເປັນ ``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:51
msgid "For example, ``https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/acs``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/acs``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:52
msgid ""
"In both the ``Logout Service`` fields, enter the endpoint specified in the "
"server configuration file as "
"``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url``."
msgstr "ໃນທັງສອງຊ່ອງ ``Logout Service``, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ endpoint ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າເຊີເວີເປັນ ``java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:53
msgid "For example, ``https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/sls``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/sls``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:54
msgid ""
"When you have added the endpoints as clients, you can configure the client "
"scope, and map the users between Keycloak and {productname}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເພີ່ມ endpoints ເປັນ clients ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າ client scope, ແລະ ແຜນຜັງ (map) ຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະຫວ່າງ Keycloak ແລະ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Client Scope and Mappers"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດຄ່າ Client Scope ແລະ Mappers"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:56
msgid ""
"In the Keycloak {webui}, navigate to the menu:Clients[Client scopes] tab and "
"assign ``role_list`` as the default client scope."
msgstr "ໃນ Keycloak {webui}, ໄປທີ່ແທັບເມນູ: Clients[Client scopes] ແລະ ກຳນົດໃຫ້ ``role_list`` ເປັນ default client scope."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Client_scopes[Mappers] tab and add a mapper for user "
"attribute ``uid``, using the default values."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບເມນູ: Client_scopes[Mappers] ແລະ ເພີ່ມ mapper ສຳລັບ attribute ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``uid``, ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (default values)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:58
msgid "This SAML attribute is expected by {productname}."
msgstr "SAML attribute ນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ {productname} ຄາດຫວັງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Client_scopes[Mappers] and click on ``role_list`` "
"mapper. Set ``Single Role Attribute`` to ``On``."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Client_scopes[Mappers] ແລະ ຄລິກໃສ່ mapper ``role_list``. ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``Single Role Attribute`` ເປັນ ``On``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:60
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Users[Admin] section and create an administrative user."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ສ່ວນເມນູ: Users[Admin] ແລະ ສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ (administrative user)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:61
msgid "This user does not need to match the {productname} administrative user."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກົງກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:62
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Users[Role mappings] tab, add an attribute named "
"``uid`` with a value that matches the username of the {productname} "
"administrative user."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບເມນູ: Users[Role mappings], ເພີ່ມ attribute ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ ``uid`` ພ້ອມກັບຄ່າທີ່ກົງກັບຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Users[Credentials] tab, and set the same password as "
"used by the {productname} administrative user."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບເມນູ: Users[Credentials], ແລະ ຕັ້ງລະຫັດຜ່ານດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ໃຊ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid " Save your changes."
msgstr " ບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:65
msgid ""
"When you have completed the configuration, you can test that the "
"installation is working as expected.  Restart the {productname} Server to "
"pick up your changes, and navigate to the {productname} {webui}.  If your "
"installation is working correctly, you are redirected to the Keycloak SSO "
"page, where you can authenticate successfully."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສຳເລັດການກຳນົດຄ່າແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດທົດສອບວ່າການຕິດຕັ້ງເຮັດວຽກຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ໃຫ້ Restart {productname} Server ເພື່ອໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ {productname} {webui}. ຖ້າການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານຖືກຕ້ອງ, ທ່ານຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງ (redirect) ໄປຫາໜ້າ Keycloak SSO, ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໄດ້ຢ່າງສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication With Single Sign-On (SSO)"
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ Single Sign-On (SSO)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} supports single sign-on (SSO) by implementing the Security "
"Assertion Markup Language (SAML){nbsp}2 protocol."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບ single sign-on (SSO) ໂດຍການໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ Security Assertion Markup Language (SAML){nbsp}2."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Single sign-on is an authentication process that allows a user to access "
"multiple applications with one set of credentials.  SAML is an XML-based "
"standard for exchanging authentication and authorization data.  A SAML "
"identity service provider (IdP) provides authentication and authorization "
"services to service providers (SP), such as {productname}.  {productname} "
"exposes three endpoints which must be enabled for single sign-on."
msgstr "Single sign-on ແມ່ນຂະບວນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຫຼາຍຢ່າງດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າໃຊ້ພຽງຊຸດດຽວ. SAML ແມ່ນມາດຕະຖານທີ່ອີງໃສ່ XML ສຳລັບການແລກປ່ຽນຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ແລະ ການອະນຸຍາດ. ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SAML (IdP) ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ແລະ ການອະນຸຍາດແກ່ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ (SP), ເຊັ່ນ {productname}. {productname} ເປີດເຜີຍສາມ endpoints ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບ single sign-on."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:4
msgid "SSO in {productname} supports:"
msgstr "SSO ໃນ {productname} ຮອງຮັບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:5
msgid "Log in with SSO."
msgstr "ລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ດ້ວຍ SSO."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Log out with service provider-initiated single logout (SLO), and Identity "
"service provider single logout service (SLS)."
msgstr "ອອກຈາກລະບົບດ້ວຍ service provider-initiated single logout (SLO), ແລະ Identity service provider single logout service (SLS)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:7
msgid "Assertion and nameId encryption."
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ Assertion ແລະ nameId."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:8
msgid "Assertion signatures."
msgstr "ລາຍເຊັນ Assertion."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:9
msgid "Message signatures with AuthNRequest, LogoutRequest, and LogoutResponses."
msgstr "ລາຍເຊັນຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍ AuthNRequest, LogoutRequest, ແລະ LogoutResponses."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:10
msgid "Enable an Assertion consumer service endpoint."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ Assertion consumer service endpoint."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:11
msgid "Enable a single logout service endpoint."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ single logout service endpoint."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:12
msgid "Publish the SP metadata (which can be signed)."
msgstr "ເຜີຍແຜ່ SP metadata (ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຊັນໄດ້)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:13
msgid "SSO in {productname} does not support:"
msgstr "SSO ໃນ {productname} ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:14
msgid "Product choosing and implementation for the identity service provider (IdP)."
msgstr "ການເລືອກຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ (IdP)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:15
msgid ""
"SAML support for other products (check with the respective product "
"documentation)."
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບ SAML ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນອື່ນໆ (ກວດສອບກັບເອກະສານຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນໆ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For an example implementation of SSO, see "
"xref:administration:auth-methods-sso-example.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ SSO, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:auth-methods-sso-example.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:17
msgid ""
"If you change from the default authentication method to single sign-on, the "
"new SSO credentials apply only to the {webui}.  Client tools such as "
"``mgr-sync`` or ``spacecmd`` continue to work with the default "
"authentication method only."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານປ່ຽນຈາກວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄປເປັນ single sign-on, ຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າໃຊ້ SSO ໃໝ່ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບ {webui} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເຄື່ອງມືໄຄລແອນ ເຊັ່ນ ``mgr-sync`` ຫຼື ``spacecmd`` ຈະຍັງຄົງເຮັດວຽກກັບວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:18
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "ເງື່ອນໄຂເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Before you begin, you need to have configured an external identity service "
"provider with these parameters.  Check your IdP documentation for "
"instructions."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໄດ້ກຳນົດຄ່າຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນພາຍນອກດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້. ກວດສອບເອກະສານ IdP ຂອງທ່ານສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The mapping between the IdP user and the {productname} user is specified in "
"a SAML:Attribute.  The SAML:Attribute must be configured in the IdP and must "
"be passed to {productname} in the SAML authentication.  The attribute must "
"be named ``uid`` and must contain the {productname} user mapped to it after "
"login.  The {productname} must be created before you activate single "
"sign-on."
msgstr "ການແຜນຜັງ (mapping) ລະຫວ່າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ IdP ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ {productname} ແມ່ນຖືກລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ SAML:Attribute. SAML:Attribute ຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າໃນ IdP ແລະ ຕ້ອງຖືກສົ່ງໄປໃຫ້ {productname} ໃນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SAML. attribute ຕ້ອງມີຊື່ວ່າ ``uid`` ແລະ ຕ້ອງປະກອບມີຜູ້ໃຊ້ {productname} ທີ່ຖືກ map ໃສ່ມັນຫຼັງຈາກເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ {productname} ຕ້ອງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານ single sign-on."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:21
msgid "You need these endpoints:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ endpoints ເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Assertion consumer service (or ACS): an endpoint to accept SAML messages to "
"establish a session into the Service Provider."
msgstr "Assertion consumer service (ຫຼື ACS): endpoint ສຳລັບຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ SAML ເພື່ອສ້າງ session ເຂົ້າໃນ Service Provider."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The endpoint for ACS in {productname} is: "
"https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/acs"
msgstr "endpoint ສຳລັບ ACS ໃນ {productname} ແມ່ນ: https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/acs"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Single logout service (or SLS): an endpoint to initiate a logout request "
"from the IdP."
msgstr "Single logout service (ຫຼື SLS): endpoint ສຳລັບເລີ່ມການຮ້ອງຂໍອອກຈາກລະບົບຈາກ IdP."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:25
msgid ""
"The endpoint for SLS in {productname} is: "
"https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/sls"
msgstr "endpoint ສຳລັບ SLS ໃນ {productname} ແມ່ນ: https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/sls"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:26
msgid "Metadata: an endpoint to retrieve {productname} metadata for SAML."
msgstr "Metadata: endpoint ສຳລັບດຶງເອົາ {productname} metadata ສຳລັບ SAML."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The endpoint for metadata in {productname} is: "
"https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/metadata"
msgstr "endpoint ສຳລັບ metadata ໃນ {productname} ແມ່ນ: https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/metadata"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:28
msgid ""
"After the authentication with the IdP using the user ``orgadmin`` is "
"successful, you are logged in to {productname} as the ``orgadmin`` user, "
"provided that the ``orgadmin`` user exists in {productname}."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບ IdP ໂດຍໃຊ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``orgadmin`` ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະຖືກເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {productname} ໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``orgadmin``, ໂດຍມີເງື່ອນໄຂວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``orgadmin`` ຕ້ອງມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable SSO"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ SSO"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Using SSO is mutually exclusive with other types of authentication: it is "
"either enabled or disabled.  SSO is disabled by default."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ SSO ແມ່ນເປັນເອກະລາດຈາກການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນປະເພດອື່ນ: ມັນສາມາດເປັນໄດ້ທັງເປີດໃຊ້ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້. SSO ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ໄວ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:31
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:4
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-delclients.adoc:2
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Use [literal]``mgrctl term`` before running steps inside the server "
"container."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ [literal]``mgrctl term`` ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນຂັ້ນຕອນຕ່າງໆພາຍໃນຄອນເທນເນີເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling SSO"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ SSO"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:33
msgid "If your users do not yet exist in {productname}, create them first."
msgstr "ຖ້າຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname}, ໃຫ້ສ້າງພວກເຂົາກ່ອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:34
msgid "Edit [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` and add this line at the end of the file:"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມແຖວນີ້ໃສ່ທ້າຍໄຟລ໌:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Find the parameters you want to customize in "
"[path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf``."
msgstr "ຊອກຫາພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປັບແຕ່ງໃນ [path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Insert the parameters you want to customize into [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"and prefix them with [literal]``java.sso``.  For example, in "
"[path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf`` find:"
msgstr "ໃສ່ພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປັບແຕ່ງລົງໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລະ ໃສ່ຄຳນຳໜ້າດ້ວຍ [literal]``java.sso``. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ໃນ [path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf`` ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
msgstr "onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:39
msgid ""
"To customize it, create the corresponding option in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` by prefixing the option name with ``java.sso.``:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງມັນ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງຕົວເລືອກທີ່ກົງກັນໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ໂດຍການໃສ່ຄຳນຳໜ້າຊື່ຕົວເລືອກດ້ວຍ ``java.sso.``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
msgstr "java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:41
msgid ""
"To find all the occurrences you need to change, search in the file for the "
"placeholders [literal]``YOUR-PRODUCT`` and [literal]``YOUR-IDP-ENTITY``.  "
"Every parameter comes with a brief explanation of what it is meant for."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຊອກຫາບ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດ, ໃຫ້ຄົ້ນຫາໃນໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບຕົວແທນ (placeholders) [literal]``YOUR-PRODUCT`` ແລະ [literal]``YOUR-IDP-ENTITY``. ແຕ່ລະພາຣາມິເຕີຈະມາພ້ອມກັບຄຳອະທິບາຍສັ້ນໆກ່ຽວກັບຈຸດປະສົງຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:42
msgid "Restart the spacewalk service to pick up the changes:"
msgstr "Restart ບໍລິການ spacewalk ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:44
msgid ""
"When you visit the {productname} URL, you are redirected to the IdP for SSO "
"where you are requested to authenticate.  Upon successful authentication, "
"you are redirected to the {productname} {webui}, logged in as the "
"authenticated user.  If you encounter problems with logging in using SSO, "
"check the {productname} logs for more information."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າເຖິງ URL ຂອງ {productname}, ທ່ານຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ IdP ສຳລັບ SSO ເຊິ່ງທ່ານຈະຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ. ເມື່ອຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳເລັດ, ທ່ານຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງກັບໄປຫາ {productname} {webui}, ໂດຍເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ. ຖ້າທ່ານພົບກັບບັນຫາໃນການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໂດຍໃຊ້ SSO, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບບັນທຶກ (logs) ຂອງ {productname} ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication Methods"
msgstr "ວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} supports several different authentication methods.  This "
"section discusses pluggable authentication modules (PAM) and single sign-on "
"(SSO)."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ. ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະເວົ້າກ່ຽວກັບ pluggable authentication modules (PAM) ແລະ single sign-on (SSO)."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Database Backup Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This guide describes how to manage online database backups for the "
"{productname} server using [command]``mgradm``.  The backup system is based "
"on {postgresql} continuous archiving Write-Ahead Logging (WAL)."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ອະທິບາຍວິທີການຈັດການການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນແບບອອນລາຍສຳລັບ {productname} server ໂດຍໃຊ້ [command]``mgradm``. ລະບົບການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແມ່ນອີງໃສ່ {postgresql} continuous archiving Write-Ahead Logging (WAL)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To ensure the system can be fully recovered, perform regular backups of both "
"the database and other system volumes."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າລະບົບສາມາດກູ້ຄືນໄດ້ຢ່າງເຕັມຮູບແບບ, ໃຫ້ເຮັດການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທັງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ system volumes ອື່ນໆຢ່າງສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Regularly copy your backup volumes and WAL files to an external storage "
"device or an off-site location for disaster recovery."
msgstr "ຄັດລອກ backup volumes ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ WAL ຂອງທ່ານໄປໄວ້ໃນອຸປະກອນຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກ ຫຼື ສະຖານທີ່ອື່ນເປັນປະຈຳເພື່ອການກູ້ຄືນຈາກໄພພິບັດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Continuous archiving reduces the risk of data loss by constantly backing up "
"the transaction logs (WAL) to a dedicated volume."
msgstr "Continuous archiving ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມສ່ຽງຂອງການສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ transaction logs (WAL) ໄປຍັງ volume ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໂດຍສະເພາະຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The backup system utilizes a dedicated Podman volume named "
"[literal]``var-pgsql-walbackup`` to store:"
msgstr "ລະບົບສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໃຊ້ Podman volume ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໂດຍສະເພາະທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ [literal]``var-pgsql-walbackup`` ເພື່ອຈັດເກັບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:8
msgid "A base backup (a full snapshot of the database)."
msgstr "Base backup (snapshot ຖານຂໍ້ມູນແບບເຕັມ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:9
msgid "WAL segments (incremental changes since the last base backup)."
msgstr "WAL segments (ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ base backup ຄັ້ງຫຼ້າສຸດ)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Point-in-time recovery is currently not supported by [command]``mgradm`` and "
"requires a manual workflow."
msgstr "ການກູ້ຄືນແບບ Point-in-time ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໂດຍ [command]``mgradm`` ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Only full recovery is supported by [command]``mgradm`` tool.  The restore "
"procedure will restore everything from the backup location."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະການກູ້ຄືນແບບເຕັມຮູບແບບໂດຍເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgradm``. ຂັ້ນຕອນການກູ້ຄືນຈະກູ້ຄືນທຸກຢ່າງຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:13
msgid "[command]``mgradm`` tool installed on the host."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgradm`` ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນ host."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:14
msgid "{productname} server running in a Podman environment."
msgstr "{productname} server ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ Podman."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enabling backups"
msgstr "ການເປີດໃຊ້ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:16
msgid "To enable continuous archiving, run the following command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ continuous archiving, ໃຫ້ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db enable\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup db enable\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:18
msgid "This command:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:19
msgid "Verifies that the backup is not already enabled."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Configures {postgresql} ([path]``postgresql.conf``) to enable "
"[option]``archive_mode`` and sets the [option]``archive_command``."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {postgresql} ([path]``postgresql.conf``) ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ [option]``archive_mode`` ແລະ ກຳນົດ [option]``archive_command``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Configures the [literal]``var-pgsql-walbackup`` volume for the database "
"service."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [literal]``var-pgsql-walbackup`` volume ສຳລັບບໍລິການຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:22
msgid "Restarts the database service to apply changes."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບໍລິການຖານຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:23
msgid "Performs an initial base backup inside the container."
msgstr "ເຮັດ base backup ຄັ້ງທຳອິດພາຍໃນ container."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:24
msgid ""
"If the backup is already configured but you need to re-initialize it, use "
"the [option]``--force`` flag."
msgstr "ຫາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ແລ້ວ ແຕ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ flag [option]``--force``."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checking backup status"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບສະຖານະການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:26
msgid "You can verify the current state of the database backup system at any time:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງລະບົບສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db status\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup db status\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:28
msgid "The command will report one of the following statuses:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງຈະລາຍງານສະຖານະໜຶ່ງໃນດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "*enabled*: Backup is correctly configured and active.\n"
msgstr "*enabled*: ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "*disabled*: Continuous archiving is explicitly turned off.\n"
msgstr "*disabled*: Continuous archiving ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*misconfigured*: There is a discrepancy between the configuration and the "
"runtime state (for example, missing volume, incorrect archive command).\n"
msgstr "*misconfigured*: ມີຄວາມບໍ່ສອດຄ່ອງລະຫວ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ສະຖານະການເຮັດວຽກ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: volume ຫາຍໄປ, ຄຳສັ່ງ archive ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ).\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maintaining backups (rebasing)"
msgstr "ການບຳລຸງຮັກສາການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ (rebasing)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Over time, the number of WAL segments can grow significantly, consuming disk "
"space and increasing restoration time.  It is recommended to periodically "
"\"rebase\" the backup by creating a new base backup and starting a new WAL "
"chain."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເວລາຜ່ານໄປ, ຈຳນວນຂອງ WAL segments ສາມາດເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເປືອງພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ ແລະ ເພີ່ມເວລາໃນການກູ້ຄືນ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຮັດການ \"rebase\" ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນເປັນໄລຍະໂດຍການສ້າງ base backup ໃໝ່ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ WAL chain ໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db rebase\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup db rebase\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:35
msgid ""
"This command creates a fresh full snapshot of the database without requiring "
"a service restart."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ສ້າງ snapshot ຖານຂໍ້ມູນແບບເຕັມອັນໃໝ່ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບໍລິການໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Regularly rebase your database backups using command [command]``mgradm "
"backup db rebase`` to minimize the time required for restore operations."
msgstr "ເຮັດການ rebase ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານເປັນປະຈຳໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup db rebase`` ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນເວລາທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການກູ້ຄືນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restoring from backup"
msgstr "ການກູ້ຄືນຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Restoring from a backup is a *destructive operation* that replaces the "
"current database data with the content of the backup."
msgstr "ການກູ້ຄືນຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແມ່ນ *ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ມີຜົນກະທົບ* ເຊິ່ງຈະແທນທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນປັດຈຸບັນດ້ວຍເນື້ອຫາຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db restore\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup db restore\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:40
msgid "The restoration process:"
msgstr "ຂະບວນການກູ້ຄືນຈະ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:41
msgid "Stops the database service."
msgstr "ຢຸດບໍລິການຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:42
msgid "Clears the current database data directory."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນໃນ directory ຖານຂໍ້ມູນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:43
msgid "Extracts the base backup from the backup volume."
msgstr "ແຕກໄຟລ໌ base backup ຈາກ backup volume."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:44
msgid "Configures {postgresql} for recovery."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {postgresql} ສຳລັບການກູ້ຄືນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:45
msgid "Starts the database service."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບໍລິການຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:46
msgid "Replays the WAL segments to bring the database to the latest possible state."
msgstr "ຣັນ WAL segments ຄືນໃໝ່ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະທີ່ໃໝ່ທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:47
msgid ""
"The command will wait until the database has fully recovered and is ready to "
"accept connections."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງຈະລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າຖານຂໍ້ມູນຈະກູ້ຄືນສຳເລັດ ແລະ ພ້ອມທີ່ຈະຮັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Ensure you have a recent base backup and all necessary WAL segments in the "
"[literal]``var-pgsql-walbackup`` volume before performing a restore."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີ base backup ທີ່ໃໝ່ຫຼ້າສຸດ ແລະ WAL segments ທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດໃນ [literal]``var-pgsql-walbackup`` volume ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເຮັດການກູ້ຄືນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disabling backups"
msgstr "ການປິດໃຊ້ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:50
msgid "To turn off continuous archiving:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປິດ continuous archiving:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db disable\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup db disable\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:52
msgid ""
"By default, this command disables archiving in the configuration and "
"restarts the database but preserves the backup volume."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະປິດການ archiving ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຖານຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ ແຕ່ຈະຍັງຮັກສາ backup volume ໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:53
msgid "To also remove the backup volume and all stored backups, use:"
msgstr "ຫາກຕ້ອງການລຶບ backup volume ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນສຳຮອງທັງໝົດທີ່ເກັບໄວ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db disable --purge-volume\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup db disable --purge-volume\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:55
msgid ""
"Regularly test your restore procedures to verify data integrity and ensure "
"you are prepared for a recovery."
msgstr "ທົດສອບຂັ້ນຕອນການກູ້ຄືນຂອງທ່ານເປັນປະຈຳເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຮັບປະກັນວ່າທ່ານພ້ອມສຳລັບການກູ້ຄືນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "External documentation"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືພາຍນອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:57
msgid ""
"For more information on {postgresql}, see "
"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/{postgresql-version}/continuous-archiving.html[{postgresql} "
"{postgresql-version}: Continuous Archiving and Point-in-Time Recovery "
"(PITR)]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {postgresql}, ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://www.postgresql.org/docs/{postgresql-version}/continuous-archiving.html[{postgresql} {postgresql-version}: Continuous Archiving and Point-in-Time Recovery (PITR)]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backup and Restore"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ການກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This chapter contains information on the files you need to back up.  With "
"the built-in backup and restore solution ([command]``mgradm backup``) you "
"create {productname} backups.  Information about restoring from your backups "
"in the case of a system failure completes this chapter."
msgstr "ບົດນີ້ປະກອບມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ. ດ້ວຍໂຊລູຊັນການສຳຮອງ ແລະ ກູ້ຄືນທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ ([command]``mgradm backup``) ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ {productname} ໄດ້. ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການກູ້ຄືນຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ລະບົບຜິດພາດຈະສະຫຼຸບຢູ່ໃນບົດນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Because {productname} relies on a database as well as the installed program "
"and configurations, it is important to back up all components of your "
"installation.  Back up your {productname} installation regularly to prevent "
"data loss and enable quick recovery."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກ {productname} ອີງໃສ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນລວມທັງໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່າງໆ, ມັນຈຶ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທຸກພາກສ່ວນຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ໃຫ້ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານເປັນປະຈຳເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ກູ້ຄືນໄດ້ໄວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Regardless of the backup method you use, you must have available at least "
"three times the amount of space your current installation uses.  Running out "
"of space can result in backups failing, so check this often."
msgstr "ບໍ່ວ່າທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ວິທີການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບໃດ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງຢ່າງໜ້ອຍສາມເທົ່າຂອງປະລິມານພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານໃຊ້ຢູ່. ຖ້າພື້ນທີ່ເຕັມອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄວນກວດສອບເລື່ອງນີ້ເລື້ອຍໆ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Back up {productname}"
msgstr "ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The most comprehensive method for backing up your {productname} installation "
"is to use [command]``mgradm backup create`` command.  This can save you time "
"in administering your backup, and can be faster to reinstall and "
"re-synchronize in the case of failure.  However, this method requires "
"significant disk space and could take a long time to perform the backup."
msgstr "ວິທີການທີ່ຄອບຄຸມທີ່ສຸດໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານແມ່ນການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup create``. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍປະຢັດເວລາຂອງທ່ານໃນການຈັດການການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ແລະ ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ ແລະ re-synchronize ໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເກີດຄວາມຜິດພາດ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ວິທີນີ້ຕ້ອງການພື້ນທີ່ດິດຫຼາຍ ແລະ ອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:7
msgid ""
"[command]``mgradm backup create`` command performs backup to a directory.  "
"This directory can be both local or mounted remote storage."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup create`` ຈະສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນລົງໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ. ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນັ້ນສາມາດເປັນໄດ້ທັງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ ຫຼື ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໄລຍະໄກທີ່ຖືກເມາທ໌ (mounted remote storage) ໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:8
msgid ""
"[command]``mgradm backup create`` command allows various customizations of "
"the content of the backup.  For all available options, see [command]``mgradm "
"backup create --help``."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup create`` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງເນື້ອຫາຂອງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ. ສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup create --help``."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Full backup of {productname}"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ {productname} ແບບເຕັມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:10
msgid ""
"A full backup of the {productname} consists of backing up the following "
"components:"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບເຕັມຂອງ {productname} ປະກອບດ້ວຍການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນອົງປະກອບດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:11
msgid "{productname} volumes"
msgstr "{productname} volumes"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:12
msgid "database volumes"
msgstr "database volumes"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:13
msgid "podman network configuration"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍ podman"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:14
msgid "podman secrets"
msgstr "podman secrets"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:15
msgid "{productname} systemd services"
msgstr "{productname} systemd services"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:16
msgid "{productname} container images"
msgstr "{productname} container images"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The {productname} service is automatically stopped for the time it takes to "
"create a full backup.  The downtime can be significant.  After backup is "
"done, service is automatically restarted."
msgstr "ບໍລິການ {productname} ຈະຖືກຢຸດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນລະຫວ່າງການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບເຕັມ. ໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ລະບົບຢຸດເຮັດວຽກອາດຈະດົນສົມຄວນ. ຫຼັງຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນສຳເລັດ, ບໍລິການຈະຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating full backup with [command]``mgradm backup create``"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບເຕັມດ້ວຍ [command]``mgradm backup create``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:19
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:27
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:31
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:39
msgid "On the container host, as root, create backup with:"
msgstr "ໃນ host ຄອນເທນເນີ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create $path\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:21
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:29
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:33
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:41
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:56
msgid "Replace [literal]``$path`` by the path to the backup location."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ [literal]``$path`` ດ້ວຍເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຳຮອງ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Partial backup of {productname}"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ {productname} ບາງສ່ວນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:23
msgid ""
"[command]``mgradm backup create`` tool allows creating partial backups.  It "
"is possible to skip individual or all volumes, skip database backup and "
"images."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgradm backup create`` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຂ້າມບາງ volume ຫຼື ທັງໝົດ, ຂ້າມການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຮູບພາບ (images) ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Particularly when database backup is skipped, backup is created without "
"stopping {productname} services and can act as a one phase in two phase "
"backup procedure."
msgstr "ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອຂ້າມການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຢຸດບໍລິການ {productname} ແລະ ສາມາດເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນເຟດໜຶ່ງໃນຂະບວນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນແບບສອງເຟດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Partial backups are only considering a part of the data, and do not take "
"potential dependencies with other parts which may not have been backed up in "
"consideration.  Therefore they cannot guarantee backup/restore consistency."
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນຈະພິຈາລະນາແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຄຳນຶງເຖິງການຂຶ້ນຕໍ່ກັນ (dependencies) ທີ່ອາດມີກັບພາກສ່ວນອື່ນໆທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ພວກມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບປະກັນຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງຂອງການສຳຮອງ/ກູ້ຄືນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating partial backup by skipping database backup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນໂດຍການຂ້າມການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --skipdatabase $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --skipdatabase $path\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating partial backup by skipping a volume"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນໂດຍການຂ້າມ volume"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes $volumes $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes $volumes $path\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Replace [literal]``$volumes`` by the name of the volume name to be excluded "
"from the backup, or by a comma separated list of volumes to be excluded."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ [literal]``$volumes`` ດ້ວຍຊື່ຂອງ volume ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ຫຼື ດ້ວຍລາຍຊື່ຂອງ volume ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຍົກເວັ້ນໂດຍແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:35
msgid "Use [literal]``all`` to skip all volumes, except database volumes."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ [literal]``all`` ເພື່ອຂ້າມທຸກ volume, ຍົກເວັ້ນ volume ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backing up extra volumes"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ extra volumes"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:37
msgid ""
"[command]``mgradm backup`` command uses internal list of {productname} "
"volumes.  If additional volumes were configured during the installation, or "
"additional volumes should be added to the backup, they need to be specified "
"using [command]``--extravolumes $volumes``."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm backup`` ໃຊ້ລາຍຊື່ພາຍໃນຂອງ volumes {productname}. ຖ້າມີການກຳນົດຄ່າ volume ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມ volume ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ພວກມັນຕ້ອງຖືກລະບຸໂດຍໃຊ້ [command]``--extravolumes $volumes``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating backup with additional custom volume"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນພ້ອມກັບ custom volume ເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --extravolumes $volume $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --extravolumes $volume $path\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Replace [literal]``$volumes`` by the name of the volume name to be included "
"in the backup. or by a comma separated list of volumes to be included."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ [literal]``$volumes`` ດ້ວຍຊື່ຂອງ volume ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຮວມເຂົ້າໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ຫຼື ດ້ວຍລາຍຊື່ຂອງ volume ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຮວມເຂົ້າໂດຍແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform a manual database backup"
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Performing a manual database backup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການດຳເນີນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:45
msgid "Allocate permanent storage space for your backup."
msgstr "ຈັດສັນພື້ນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖາວອນສຳລັບການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:46
msgid "At the command prompt of the {productname} container host, as root, use:"
msgstr "ທີ່ command prompt ຂອງ host ຄອນເທນເນີ {productname}, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes all --skipconfig --skipimages $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes all --skipconfig --skipimages $path\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restore {productname} from the existing backup"
msgstr "ກູ້ຄືນ {productname} ຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:49
msgid ""
"Restoring {productname} from the existing backup will enumerate backup for "
"volumes, images and configuration to restore. Unlike in backup create "
"scenario, restore operation is not using an internal volume list, but "
"automatically detect every volume or image present in the backup."
msgstr "ການກູ້ຄືນ {productname} ຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະໄລ່ລຽງລາຍຊື່ volumes, images ແລະ ການກຳນົດຄ່າຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນເພື່ອມາການກູ້ຄືນ. ເຊິ່ງແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຕອນສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ການກູ້ຄືນຈະບໍ່ໃຊ້ລາຍຊື່ volume ພາຍໃນ, ແຕ່ຈະກວດພົບທຸກ volume ຫຼື image ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:50
msgid ""
"After the list of items to restore is gathered, presence and integrity check "
"is performed. Presence check ensures backup restore will not accidentally "
"overwrite existing volumes, image or configurations. Integrity check is done "
"by computing backup items checksums."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກລວບລວມລາຍການທີ່ຈະກູ້ຄືນແລ້ວ, ຈະມີການກວດສອບການມີຢູ່ (presence check) ແລະ ຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງສົມບູນ (integrity check). ການກວດສອບການມີຢູ່ຈະຮັບປະກັນວ່າການກູ້ຄືນຈະບໍ່ໄປຂຽນທັບ volumes, image ຫຼື ການກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່ໂດຍບັງເອີນ. ການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງສົມບູນແມ່ນເຮັດໂດຍການຄຳນວນ checksums ຂອງລາຍການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:51
msgid "After both checks are successful, actual backup restore is performed."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກທັງສອງການກວດສອບສຳເລັດ, ການກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຈິງຈະຖືກດຳເນີນການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:52
msgid ""
"{productname} services are not automatically started after backup restore is "
"finished."
msgstr "ບໍລິການ {productname} ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກການກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Restoring from an existing backup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກູ້ຄືນຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:54
msgid "On the container host, as root, re-deploy the {productname} Server with:"
msgstr "ໃນ host ຄອນເທນເນີ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ re-deploy {productname} Server ດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm stop\n"
"mgradm backup restore $path\n"
"mgradm start\n"
msgstr ""
"mgradm stop\n"
"mgradm backup restore $path\n"
"mgradm start\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Verification of the backup can be a time-consuming operation. If backup "
"integrity is ensured by other means, verification can be skipped by using "
"[command]``--skipverify`` option."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ. ຫາກຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນດ້ວຍວິທີອື່ນແລ້ວ, ສາມາດຂ້າມການກວດສອບໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ [command]``--skipverify``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:58
msgid ""
"If for some reason it is needed to skip restoring a volume present in the "
"backup, [command]``--skipvolumes $volumes`` option can be used."
msgstr "ຖ້າມີເຫດຜົນບາງຢ່າງທີ່ຕ້ອງການຂ້າມການກູ້ຄືນ volume ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ [command]``--skipvolumes $volumes`` ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended steps after restoring a backup"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ແນະນຳຫຼັງຈາກການກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Recommended steps after {productname} restore"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ແນະນຳຫຼັງຈາກການກູ້ຄືນ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Re-synchronize your {productname} repositories using either the "
"{productname} {webui}, or with the [command]``mgr-sync`` tool at the command "
"prompt in the container.  You can choose to re-register your product, or "
"skip the registration and SSL certificate generation sections."
msgstr "Re-synchronize ຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (repositories) ຂອງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui}, ຫຼື ດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgr-sync`` ທີ່ command prompt ໃນຄອນເທນເນີ. ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກລົງທະບຽນຜະລິດຕະພັນຂອງທ່ານໃໝ່, ຫຼື ຂ້າມສ່ວນການລົງທະບຽນ ແລະ ການສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:62
msgid ""
"On the container host, check whether you need to restore "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/``.  "
"If "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/`` "
"was not in your backup, you need to restore it.  If the source repository is "
"available, you can restore "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/`u "
"with a complete channel synchronization:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ container host, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກູ້ຄືນ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/`` ຫຼືບໍ່. ຫາກ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/`` ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກູ້ຄືນມັນ. ຫາກ source repository ຍັງມີຢູ່, ທ່ານສາມາດກູ້ຄືນ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/`` ໄດ້ດ້ວຍການຊິງຄ໌ຊ່ອງທາງ (channel synchronization) ແບບເຕັມຮູບແບບ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync refresh --refresh-channels\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync refresh --refresh-channels\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Schedule the re-creation of search indexes next time the "
"[command]``rhn-search`` service is started."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາການສ້າງ search indexes ໃໝ່ໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ບໍລິການ [command]``rhn-search`` ຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:65
msgid ""
"This command produces only debug messages, it does not produce error "
"messages."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງແຕ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ debug ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ມັນຈະບໍ່ສ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:66
msgid "On the container host, enter:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ container host, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-search cleanindex\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-search cleanindex\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel Management)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:2
msgid "Channels are a method of grouping software packages."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ (Channels) ແມ່ນວິທີການໃນການຈັດກຸ່ມແພັກເກດຊອບແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In {productname}, channels are grouped into base and child channels, with "
"base channels grouped by operating system type, version, and architecture, "
"and child channels being compatible with their related base channel.  When a "
"client has been assigned to a base channel, it is only possible for that "
"system to install the related child channels.  Organizing channels in this "
"way ensures that only compatible packages are installed on each system."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, ຊ່ອງທາງຈະຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (base) ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (child), ໂດຍຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຈະຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມຕາມປະເພດລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ເວີຊັນ ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ, ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍຈະຕ້ອງເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ເມື່ອໄຄລແອນຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໃດໜຶ່ງແລ້ວ, ລະບົບນັ້ນຈະສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ສະເພາະຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ການຈັດລະບຽບຊ່ອງທາງໃນລັກສະນະນີ້ຊ່ວຍຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະມີສະເພາະແພັກເກດທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນແຕ່ລະລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Software channels use repositories to provide packages.  The channels mirror "
"the repositories in {productname}, and the package names and other data are "
"stored in the {productname} database.  You can have any number of "
"repositories associated with a channel.  The software from those "
"repositories can then be installed on clients by subscribing the client to "
"the appropriate channel."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວໃຊ້ຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (repositories) ເພື່ອສະໜອງແພັກເກດ. ຊ່ອງທາງຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ mirror ຂອງຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃນ {productname}, ແລະ ຊື່ແພັກເກດລວມທັງຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ {productname}. ທ່ານສາມາດມີຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຈຳນວນເທົ່າໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງໃດໜຶ່ງ. ຈາກນັ້ນຊອບແວຈາກຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນສາມາດຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນໄຄລແອນໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຫ້ໄຄລແອນນັ້ນສະໝັກ (subscribe) ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Clients can only be assigned to one base channel.  The client can then "
"install or update packages from the repositories associated with that base "
"channel and any of its child channels."
msgstr "ໄຄລແອນສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໄດ້ພຽງອັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຈາກນັ້ນໄຄລແອນຈະສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເດດແພັກເກດຈາກຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກນັ້ນ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍໃດໆຂອງມັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{productname} provides a number of vendor channels, which provide you "
"everything you need to run {productname}.  {productname} Administrators and "
"Channel Administrators have channel management authority, which gives them "
"the ability to create and manage their own custom channels.  If you want to "
"use your own packages in your environment, you can create custom channels.  "
"Custom channels can be used as a base channel, or you can associate them "
"with a vendor base channel."
msgstr "{productname} ມີຊ່ອງທາງຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor channels) ຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງ ເຊິ່ງສະໜອງທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພື່ອຣັນ {productname}. ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ແລະ ຜູ້ດູແລຊ່ອງທາງມີອຳນາດໃນການຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາສາມາດສ້າງ ແລະ ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ (custom channels) ໄດ້. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ແພັກເກດຂອງທ່ານເອງໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໄດ້. ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກໄດ້, ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດເຊື່ອມໂຍງພວກມັນກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more on creating custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Administration"
msgstr "ການດູແລຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel Administration)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:9
msgid ""
"By default, any user can subscribe channels to a system.  You can implement "
"restrictions on the channel using the {webui}."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທຸກຄົນສາມາດສະໝັກຊ່ອງທາງໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດໃນຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Restricting Subscriber Access to a Channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງການສະໝັກຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Channel List], and "
"select the channel to edit."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Channel List], ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Locate the [guimenu]``Per-User Subscription Restrictions`` section and check "
"[guimenu]``Only selected users within your organization may subscribe to "
"this channel``.  Click btn:[Update] to save the changes."
msgstr "ຊອກຫາສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Per-User Subscription Restrictions`` ແລະ ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ [guimenu]``Only selected users within your organization may subscribe to this channel``. ຄລິກ btn:[Update] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Subscribers`` tab and select or deselect users as "
"required."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Subscribers`` ແລະ ເລືອກ ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delete Channels"
msgstr "ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງ (Delete Channels)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:15
msgid "You can delete vendor software channels from the command prompt."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດໄດ້ຈາກ command prompt."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting Vendor Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:17
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, list the "
"available vendor channels, and make a note of the channel you want to "
"delete:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງຜູ້ຜະລິດທີ່ມີຢູ່, ແລະ ຈົດຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລຶບໄວ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync list channels\n"
msgstr "mgr-sync list channels\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:19
msgid "Delete the channel:"
msgstr "ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-remove-channel -c <channel-name>\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-remove-channel -c <channel-name>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:21
msgid ""
"For more information about deleting channels manually, see "
"xref:administration:removing-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:removing-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For information about deleting custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Confidential Computing"
msgstr "Confidential Computing"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{CoCo} is a technology which allows protection of data in use by using "
"hardware-based Trusted Execution Environment (TEE), the type of environments "
"that provide increased level of security for data integrity, data "
"confidentiality, and code integrity."
msgstr "{CoCo} ແມ່ນເຕັກໂນໂລຊີທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃນການປົກປ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ hardware-based Trusted Execution Environment (TEE), ເຊິ່ງເປັນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ໃຫ້ລະດັບຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບຄວາມສົມບູນຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ຄວາມລັບຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຄວາມສົມບູນຂອງໂຄ້ດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "{CoCo} with {productname}"
msgstr "{CoCo} ກັບ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The trustworthiness of the TEE is checked with the attestation process.  "
"{productname} can be used as an attestation server for the systems "
"registered to it.  It generates a report page for the systems which run in "
"this mode.  These systems need to be attested and checked on regular base.  "
"The history of the past checks is also stored and available per request."
msgstr "ຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືຂອງ TEE ຈະຖືກກວດສອບດ້ວຍຂະບວນການ attestation. {productname} ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນເຊີເວີ attestation ສຳລັບລະບົບຕ່າງໆທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບມັນ. ມັນຈະສ້າງໜ້າລາຍງານສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ຣັນໃນໂໝດນີ້. ລະບົບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນ (attested) ແລະ ກວດສອບເປັນປະຈຳ. ປະຫວັດການກວດສອບໃນອະດີດຍັງຖືກເກັບໄວ້ ແລະ ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ຕາມການຮ້ອງຂໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:5
msgid ""
"{CoCo} Attestation depends on the used hardware and environment where the "
"attested systems are running on."
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນ {CoCo} (Attestation) ຂຶ້ນກັບຮາດແວທີ່ໃຊ້ ແລະ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຢືນຢັນນັ້ນຣັນຢູ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:6
msgid "{CoCo} Attestation is only available on x86_64 architecture."
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນ {CoCo} (Attestation) ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ x86_64 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:7
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:14
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:134
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການ (Requirements)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:8
msgid "{CoCo} can be set up in an environment with the following characteristics:"
msgstr "{CoCo} ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Attested system (virtual machine) is SLES15 SP6 and bootstrapped to "
"{productname}"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຢືນຢັນ (virtual machine) ແມ່ນ SLES15 SP6 ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບການ bootstrap ເຂົ້າກັບ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Hardware must have [literal]``AMD EPYC Milan CPU`` or [literal]``AMD EPYC "
"Genoa CPU``"
msgstr "ຮາດແວຕ້ອງມີ [literal]``AMD EPYC Milan CPU`` ຫຼື [literal]``AMD EPYC Genoa CPU``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:11
msgid "BIOS must be configured to allow {CoCo} attestation"
msgstr "BIOS ຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີການຢືນຢັນ {CoCo}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Host OS and the virtualization software (KVM and libvirt) must support "
"{CoCo}."
msgstr "Host OS ແລະ ຊອບແວ virtualization (KVM ແລະ libvirt) ຕ້ອງຮອງຮັບ {CoCo}."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:13
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:269
#, no-wrap
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ (Limitations)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:14
msgid "SLES15 SP6 has {CoCo} attestation as technology preview."
msgstr "SLES15 SP6 ມີການຢືນຢັນ {CoCo} ເປັນ technology preview."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:15
msgid "{productname} has {CoCo} attestation as technology preview."
msgstr "{productname} ມີການຢືນຢັນ {CoCo} ເປັນ technology preview."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Secure boot is attested.  However, currently KVM secure boot and SNP Guest "
"are not working together."
msgstr "Secure boot ໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ KVM secure boot ແລະ SNP Guest ຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use {CoCo} in {productname}"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ {CoCo} ໃນ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For the exact steps for setting up and configuring {CoCo} on your host, "
"refer to the OS Vendor documentation."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການກຳນົດຄ່າ {CoCo} ທີ່ແນ່ນອນໃນ host ຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ OS."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Enabling Attestation Container During the {productname} "
"Installation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ Attestation Container ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The attestation container is enabled during the installation of "
"{productname} with [literal]``mgradm install podman``."
msgstr "Attestation container ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ດ້ວຍ [literal]``mgradm install podman``."

#. I need full path to this file.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:21
msgid "Add the following to file [literal]``mgradm.yaml``."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ [literal]``mgradm.yaml``."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"coco:\n"
"    replicas: 1\n"
msgstr ""
"coco:\n"
"    replicas: 1\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Enabling Attestation Container After the {productname} "
"Installation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ Attestation Container ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:24
msgid ""
"To enable the attestation container after the installation, use the command "
"line parameter [literal]``mgradm``."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ attestation container ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ command line parameter [literal]``mgradm``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:25
msgid "Run the command"
msgstr "ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 1\n"
msgstr "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 1\n"

#.  (PLACEHOLDER): In the future instead of number 1, it should be possible to allow more then one container replica.
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Disabling Attestation Container After the {productname} "
"Installation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປິດໃຊ້ງານ Attestation Container ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:28
msgid "To disable the already enabled attestation container, run the command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ attestation container ທີ່ເປີດໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 0\n"
msgstr "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 0\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling Attestation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ Attestation"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:31
msgid ""
"For the selected system, go to tab menu:Audit[Confidential Computing > "
"Settings]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ເລືອກ, ໄປທີ່ແທັບເມນູ: Audit[Confidential Computing > Settings]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:32
msgid "Enable the attestation by selecting the toggle button."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການຢືນຢັນໂດຍການເລືອກປຸ່ມ toggle."

#. . (PLACEHOLDER) Enable the automatic attestaion at reboot by selecting the toggle button [literal]``Execution``.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:33
msgid ""
"In the field [literal]``Environment Type`` select the correct option from "
"the drop-down list."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [literal]``Environment Type`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຈາກ drop-down list."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:34
msgid "Click button btn:[Save] to save the changes."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Scheduling New Attestation"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດເວລາການຢືນຢັນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:36
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:42
msgid ""
"For the selected system, go to tab menu:Audit[Confidential Computing > List "
"Attestations]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ເລືອກ, ໄປທີ່ແທັບເມນູ: Audit[Confidential Computing > List Attestations]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:37
msgid "Click btn:[Schedule Attestation].  The new form opens."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Schedule Attestation]. ແບບຟອມໃໝ່ຈະເປີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:38
msgid ""
"In the field [literal]``Earliest`` select the time of running the "
"attestation."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [literal]``Earliest`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກເວລາທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການຢັ້ງຢືນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:39
msgid ""
"If needed, add the newly created attestation to the action chain by "
"selecting [literal]``Add to`` option."
msgstr "ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມການຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນຕ່ອງໂສ້ການດຳເນີນການ ໂດຍການເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ [literal]``Add to``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Click button btn:[Schedule] to save and schedule the new attestation "
"execution."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Schedule] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກ ແລະ ກຳນົດເວລາການດຳເນີນການຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Viewing Attestation Reports from System Details"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເບິ່ງລາຍງານການຢັ້ງຢືນຈາກລາຍລະອຽດຂອງລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:43
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:50
msgid "Find and select the report you want to view."
msgstr "ຊອກຫາ ແລະ ເລືອກລາຍງານທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເບິ່ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:44
msgid ""
"After clicking the selected attestation report tab [literal]``Overview`` "
"will open."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຄລິກແທັບລາຍງານການຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້, ຫນ້າ [literal]``Overview`` ຈະເປີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:45
msgid "Move to the next tab [literal]``SEV-SNP``."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບຖັດໄປ [literal]``SEV-SNP``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:46
msgid "Finally, move to the next tab [literal]``Secure Boot``."
msgstr "ສຸດທ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແທັບຖັດໄປ [literal]``Secure Boot``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Viewing Attestation Reports from Audit"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເບິ່ງລາຍງານການຢັ້ງຢືນຈາກການກວດສອບ (Audit)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:48
msgid "From the navigation bar, select menu:Audit[Confidential Computing]."
msgstr "ຈາກແຖບນຳທາງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ menu:Audit[Confidential Computing]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:49
msgid "The list of all attestations will be shown in the main panel."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ການຢັ້ງຢືນທັງໝົດຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນແຜງຫຼັກ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Report Statuses"
msgstr "ສະຖານະຂອງລາຍງານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:52
msgid "Attestation reports can have one of the following statuses:"
msgstr "ລາຍງານການຢັ້ງຢືນສາມາດມີສະຖານະໃດໜຶ່ງດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pending"
msgstr "ຄ້າງດຳເນີນການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:54
msgid ""
"This is the default status of the scheduled attestation.  The report is "
"still not available, either because the process has not yet started or "
"completed."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນສະຖານະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງການຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້. ລາຍງານຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ, ເນື່ອງຈາກຂະບວນການຍັງບໍ່ທັນເລີ່ມ ຫຼື ຍັງບໍ່ທັນສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Successful"
msgstr "ສຳເລັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:56
msgid ""
"When the scheduled attestation creates a report which can be viewed, the "
"status of the process is [literal]``Successful``."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ສ້າງລາຍງານທີ່ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້, ສະຖານະຂອງຂະບວນການຈະເປັນ [literal]``Successful``."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Failed"
msgstr "ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:58
msgid ""
"When the scheduled fails and does not create a report as a result, the "
"status of the process is [literal]``Failed``."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງລາຍງານໄດ້, ສະຖານະຂອງຂະບວນການຈະເປັນ [literal]``Failed``."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Related Topics"
msgstr "ຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:60
msgid ""
"For more information about {CoCo}, see "
"https://www.fortanix.com/platform/confidential-computing-manager/what-is-confidential-computing[here]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {CoCo}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້[ທີ່ນີ້] https://www.fortanix.com/platform/confidential-computing-manager/what-is-confidential-computing."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content Lifecycle Management Examples"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains some common examples of how you can use content "
"lifecycle management.  Use these examples to build your own personalized "
"implementation."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບມີບາງຕົວຢ່າງທົ່ວໄປກ່ຽວກັບວິທີທີ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ. ໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງການນຳໃຊ້ທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບຕົວເຈົ້າເອງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating a Project for a Monthly Patch Cycle"
msgstr "ການສ້າງໂຄງການສຳລັບຮອບວຽນການແພັດປະຈຳເດືອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:4
msgid "An example project for a monthly patch cycle consists of:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງໂຄງການສຳລັບຮອບວຽນການແພັດປະຈຳເດືອນປະກອບມີ:"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating a `By Date` filter"
msgstr "ການສ້າງຕົວຕອງ `ຕາມວັນທີ`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:6
msgid "Adding the filter to the project"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງເຂົ້າໃນໂຄງການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:7
msgid "Applying the filter to a new project build"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງກັບການສ້າງ (Build) ໂຄງການໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:8
msgid "Excluding a patch from the project"
msgstr "ການຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດອອກຈາກໂຄງການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:9
msgid "Including a patch in the project"
msgstr "ການລວມເອົາແພັດເຂົ້າໃນໂຄງການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The ``By Date`` filter excludes all patches released after a specified "
"date.  This filter is useful for your content lifecycle projects that follow "
"a monthly patch cycle."
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງ ``ຕາມວັນທີ`` ຈະຍົກເວັ້ນທຸກໆແພັດທີ່ຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາຫຼັງຈາກວັນທີທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຕົວຕອງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາຂອງເຈົ້າທີ່ດຳເນີນຕາມຮອບວຽນການແພັດປະຈຳເດືອນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating the ``By Date`` filter"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຕົວຕອງ ``ຕາມວັນທີ``"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:13
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:38
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:53
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] "
"and click btn:[Create Filter]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Filter]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:14
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:90
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filter Name`` field, type a name for your filter."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບຕົວຕອງຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:15
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``Exclude patches by date``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``Exclude patches by date``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filter Type`` field, select [guimenu]``Patch (Issue "
"date)``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Patch (Issue date)``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, [guimenu]``later or equal`` is "
"autoselected."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ຕົວເລືອກ [guimenu]``later or equal`` ຈະຖືກເລືອກໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:18
msgid "Select the date and time."
msgstr "ເລືອກວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:19
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:25
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:45
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:62
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:150
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:146
msgid "Click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add a filter to the project"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງເຂົ້າໃນໂຄງການ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding a filter to a project"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງເຂົ້າໃນໂຄງການ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] "
"and select a project from the list."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] ແລະ ເລືອກໂຄງການຈາກລາຍຊື່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:23
msgid "Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters] link to see all available filters"
msgstr "ຄລິກລິ້ງ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວຕອງທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:24
msgid "Select the new [guimenu]``Exclude patches by date`` filter."
msgstr "ເລືອກຕົວຕອງໃໝ່ [guimenu]``Exclude patches by date``."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apply a filter to a new project build"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງກັບການສ້າງໂຄງການໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The new filter is added to your filter list, but it still needs to be "
"applied to the project.  To apply the filter you need to build the first "
"environment."
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງໃໝ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍຊື່ຕົວຕອງຂອງເຈົ້າແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ມັນຍັງຕ້ອງໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບໂຄງການ. ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ (Build) ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທຳອິດ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Using the filter"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:29
msgid "Click btn:[Build] to build the first environment."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Build] ເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທຳອິດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:30
msgid "OPTIONAL: Add a message."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:31
msgid "You can use messages to help track the build history."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການຕິດຕາມປະຫວັດການສ້າງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Check that the filter has worked correctly by using the new channels on a "
"test server."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າຕົວຕອງເຮັດວຽກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍການໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງ (Channels) ໃໝ່ໃນເຊີບເວີທົດສອບ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:33
msgid "Click btn:[Promote] to move the content to the next environment."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Promote] ເພື່ອຍ້າຍເນື້ອຫາໄປຍັງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຖັດໄປ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:34
msgid ""
"The build takes longer if you have a large number of filters, or they are "
"very complex."
msgstr "ການສ້າງຈະໃຊ້ເວລາດົນຂຶ້ນຖ້າເຈົ້າມີຕົວຕອງຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ຕົວຕອງນັ້ນມີຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exclude a patch from the project"
msgstr "ຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດອອກຈາກໂຄງການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Tests may help you discover issues.  When an issue is found, exclude the "
"problem patch released before the `by date` filter."
msgstr "ການທົດສອບອາດຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າພົບຫາບັນຫາ. ເມື່ອພົບບັນຫາ, ໃຫ້ຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດທີ່ມີບັນຫາເຊິ່ງຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາກ່ອນຕົວຕອງ `ຕາມວັນທີ`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Excluding a patch"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:39
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filter Name`` field, enter a name for the filter."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Name``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ສຳລັບຕົວຕອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:40
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``Exclude openjdk patch``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``Exclude openjdk patch``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:41
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:56
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filter Type`` field, select [guimenu]``Patch (Advisory "
"Name)``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Patch (Advisory Name)``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:42
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:57
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, select [guimenu]``equals``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``equals``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:43
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Advisory Name`` field, type a name for the advisory."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Advisory Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຂອງ Advisory."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:44
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``SUSE-15-2019-1807``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``SUSE-15-2019-1807``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:46
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:99
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:140
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:165
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:83
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:101
msgid "Navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] and select your project."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] ແລະ ເລືອກໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters] link, select [guimenu]``Exclude openjdk "
"patch``, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ຄລິກລິ້ງ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Exclude openjdk patch``, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:48
msgid ""
"When you rebuild the project with the btn:[Build] button, the new filter is "
"used together with the [guimenu]``by date`` filter we added before."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງໂຄງການໃໝ່ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມ btn:[Build], ຕົວຕອງໃໝ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບຕົວຕອງ [guimenu]``ຕາມວັນທີ`` ທີ່ເຮົາໄດ້ເພີ່ມໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Include a patch in the project"
msgstr "ລວມເອົາແພັດເຂົ້າໃນໂຄງການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In this example, you have received a security alert.  An important security "
"patch was released several days after the first of the month you are "
"currently working on.  The name of the new patch is ``SUSE-15-2019-2071``.  "
"You need to include this new patch into your environment."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ເຈົ້າໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຄວາມປອດໄພ. ແພັດຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ສຳຄັນຖືກປ່ອຍອອກມາສອງສາມມື້ຫຼັງຈາກຕົ້ນເດືອນທີ່ເຈົ້າກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່. ຊື່ຂອງແພັດໃໝ່ແມ່ນ ``SUSE-15-2019-2071``. ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລວມເອົາແພັດໃໝ່ນີ້ເຂົ້າໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:51
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Allow`` filters rule overrides the exclude function of the "
"[guimenu]``Deny`` filter rule.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ກົດເກນຕົວຕອງ [guimenu]``Allow`` ຈະທັບຊ້ອນ (Override) ຟັງຊັນການຍົກເວັ້ນຂອງກົດເກນຕົວຕອງ [guimenu]``Deny``. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Including a patch in a project"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລວມເອົາແພັດເຂົ້າໃນໂຄງການ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:54
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filter Name`` field, type a name for the filter."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບຕົວຕອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:55
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``Include kernel security fix``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``Include kernel security fix``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:58
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Advisory Name`` field, type "
"[guimenu]``SUSE-15-2019-2071``, and check [guimenu]``Allow``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Advisory Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [guimenu]``SUSE-15-2019-2071``, ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກ [guimenu]``Allow``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:59
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:98
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to store the filter."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກຕົວຕອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] and select your project from "
"the list."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] ແລະ ເລືອກໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າຈາກລາຍຊື່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], and select [guimenu]``Include kernel "
"security patch``."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], ແລະ ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Include kernel security patch``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:63
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:114
msgid "Click btn:[Build] to rebuild the environment."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Build] ເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update an existing monthly patch cycle"
msgstr "ອັບເດດຮອບວຽນການແພັດປະຈຳເດືອນທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:65
msgid ""
"When a monthly patch cycle is complete, you can update the patch cycle for "
"the next month."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຮອບວຽນການແພັດປະຈຳເດືອນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດອັບເດດຮອບວຽນການແພັດສຳລັບເດືອນຖັດໄປ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating a monthly patch cycle"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບເດດຮອບວຽນການແພັດປະຈຳເດືອນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:67
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``by date`` field, change the date of the filter to the next "
"month."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``by date``, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນວັນທີຂອງຕົວຕອງເປັນເດືອນຖັດໄປ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:68
msgid "Alternatively, create a new filter and change the assignment to the project."
msgstr "ຫຼືອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງແມ່ນ ສ້າງຕົວຕອງໃໝ່ ແລະ ປ່ຽນການກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບໂຄງການ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:69
msgid ""
"Check if the exclude filter for ``SUSE-15-2019-1807`` can be detached from "
"the project."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າຕົວຕອງຍົກເວັ້ນສຳລັບ ``SUSE-15-2019-1807`` ສາມາດຖອນອອກຈາກໂຄງການໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:70
msgid "There may be a new patch available to fix this issue."
msgstr "ອາດຈະມີແພັດໃໝ່ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:71
msgid "Detach the ``allow`` filter you added previously."
msgstr "ຖອນຕົວຕອງ ``allow`` ທີ່ເຈົ້າໄດ້ເພີ່ມໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ອອກ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:72
msgid "The patch is included by default."
msgstr "ແພັດຈະຖືກລວມເອົາໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:73
msgid ""
"Rebuild the project to create a new environment with patches for the next "
"month."
msgstr "ສ້າງໂຄງການໃໝ່ເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ທີ່ມີແພັດສຳລັບເດືອນຖັດໄປ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enhance a project with live patching"
msgstr "ປັບປຸງໂຄງການດ້ວຍການແພັດແບບສົດ (Live Patching)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:75
msgid ""
"This section covers setting up filters to create environments for live "
"patching."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຕອງເພື່ອສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສຳລັບການແພັດແບບສົດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:76
msgid ""
"When you are preparing to use live patching, there are some important "
"considerations:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າກຽມຕົວທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ການແພັດແບບສົດ, ມີບາງຂໍ້ຄວນຄຳນຶງທີ່ສຳຄັນ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:77
msgid "Only ever use one kernel version on your systems."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄີເນິນ (Kernel) ພຽງເວີຊັນດຽວໃນລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າສະເໝີ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:78
msgid "The live patching packages are installed with a specific kernel."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດການແພັດແບບສົດຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງກັບເຄີເນິນສະເພາະຕົວໃດໜຶ່ງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:79
msgid "Live patching updates are shipped as one patch."
msgstr "ການອັບເດດການແພັດແບບສົດຈະຖືກສົ່ງມາໃນຮູບແບບແພັດດຽວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:80
msgid ""
"Each kernel patch that begins a new series of live patching kernels displays "
"the ``required reboot`` flag."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະແພັດເຄີເນິນທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຊີຣີໃໝ່ຂອງເຄີເນິນການແພັດແບບສົດຈະສະແດງເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ``required reboot`` (ຕ້ອງຣີບູດ)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:81
msgid ""
"These kernel patches come with live patching tools.  When you have installed "
"them, you need to reboot the system at least once before the next year."
msgstr "ແພັດເຄີເນິນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມາພ້ອມກັບເຄື່ອງມືການແພັດແບບສົດ. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຣີບູດລະບົບຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງກ່ອນປີໜ້າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:82
msgid "Only install live patch updates that match the installed kernel version."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງສະເພາະການອັບເດດແພັດແບບສົດທີ່ກົງກັບເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:83
msgid "Live patches are provided as stand-alone patches."
msgstr "ແພັດແບບສົດຈະຖືກສະໜອງໃຫ້ໃນຮູບແບບແພັດທີ່ເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍຕົວມັນເອງ (Stand-alone)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:84
msgid ""
"You must exclude all regular kernel patches with higher kernel version than "
"the currently installed one."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຍົກເວັ້ນແພັດເຄີເນິນປົກກະຕິທັງໝົດທີ່ມີເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນສູງກວ່າເວີຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exclude packages with a higher kernel version"
msgstr "ຍົກເວັ້ນແພັກເກດທີ່ມີເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນສູງກວ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:86
msgid ""
"In this example you update your systems with the ``SUSE-15-2019-1244`` "
"patch.  This patch contains ``kernel-default-4.12.14-150.17.1-x86_64``."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ເຈົ້າອັບເດດລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າດ້ວຍແພັດ ``SUSE-15-2019-1244``. ແພັດນີ້ປະກອບມີ ``kernel-default-4.12.14-150.17.1-x86_64``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:87
msgid ""
"You need to exclude all patches which contain a higher version of "
"[package]``kernel-default`` and [package]``kernel-default-base``."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຍົກເວັ້ນທຸກໆແພັດທີ່ປະກອບມີເວີຊັນທີ່ສູງກວ່າຂອງ [package]``kernel-default`` ແລະ [package]``kernel-default-base``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Excluding packages with a higher kernel version"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍົກເວັ້ນແພັກເກດທີ່ມີເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນສູງກວ່າ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:89
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:76
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:94
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters], "
"and click btn:[Create Filter]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Filter]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:91
msgid "For example, [systemitem]``Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:92
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filter Type`` field, select [guimenu]``Patch (Contains "
"Package)``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Patch (Contains Package)``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:93
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, select [guimenu]``version greater than``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``version greater than``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:94
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Package Name`` field, type [systemitem]``kernel-default``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Package Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``kernel-default``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:95
msgid "Leave the [guimenu]``Epoch`` field empty."
msgstr "ປະຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Epoch`` ໄວ້ໃຫ້ວ່າງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:96
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Version`` field, type [systemitem]``4.12.14``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Version``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``4.12.14``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:97
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Release`` field, type [systemitem]``150.17.1``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Release``, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``150.17.1``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:100
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:23
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:84
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:102
msgid "Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:101
msgid ""
"Select [guimenu]``Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1``, and click "
"btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1``, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:102
msgid ""
"You need to repeat this procedure for the [package]``kernel-default-base`` "
"package."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດຊ້ຳຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ສຳລັບແພັກເກດ [package]``kernel-default-base``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:103
msgid ""
"When you click btn:[Build], a new environment is created.  The new "
"environment contains all the kernel patches up to the version you installed."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຄລິກ btn:[Build], ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ນີ້ຈະປະກອບມີທຸກໆແພັດເຄີເນິນຈົນເຖິງເວີຊັນທີ່ເຈົ້າຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:104
msgid ""
"All kernel patches with higher kernel versions are removed.  Live patching "
"kernels remain available as long as they are not the first in a series."
msgstr "ແພັດເຄີເນິນທັງໝົດທີ່ມີເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນສູງກວ່າຈະຖືກຖອນອອກ. ເຄີເນິນການແພັດແບບສົດຈະຍັງຄົງມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ຕາບໃດທີ່ພວກມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນຕົວທຳອິດໃນຊີຣີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:105
msgid ""
"This procedure can be automated using a filter template.  For more "
"information on how to apply a live patching filter template, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc#filter-templates[]."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງ (Filter template). ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີນຳໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງການແພັດແບບສົດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc#filter-templates[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "Switch to a new kernel version for live patching"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນໃໝ່ສຳລັບການແພັດແບບສົດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:107
msgid ""
"Live patching for a specific kernel version is only available for one year.  "
"After one year you must update the kernel on your systems.  Execute these "
"environment changes:"
msgstr "ການແພັດແບບສົດສຳລັບເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ໜຶ່ງປີເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫຼັງຈາກໜຶ່ງປີ ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງອັບເດດເຄີເນິນໃນລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າ. ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການປ່ຽນແປງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Switch to a new kernel version"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນໃໝ່"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:109
msgid "Decide which kernel version to upgrade to."
msgstr "ຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າຈະອັບເກຣດເປັນເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນໃດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:110
msgid "For example: `4.12.14-150.32.1`"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: `4.12.14-150.32.1`"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:111
msgid "Create a new kernel version Filter."
msgstr "ສ້າງຕົວຕອງເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:112
msgid "Detach all previous Live Patching filters associated with the old kernel."
msgstr "ຖອນຕົວຕອງການແພັດແບບສົດກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ທັງໝົດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເຄີເນິນເກົ່າອອກ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:113
msgid "Attach the new kernel version filter."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງຕົວຕອງເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:115
msgid ""
"Once the build is complete, you must immediately re-attach the two filters "
"which:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອການສ້າງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງຕົວຕອງສອງອັນຄືນໃໝ່ທັນທີ ເຊິ່ງຈະ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:116
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:72
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:90
msgid "Deny patches that contain ``reboot_suggested`` keyword"
msgstr "ປະຕິເສດ (Deny) ແພັດທີ່ມີຄຳສຳຄັນ ``reboot_suggested``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:117
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:73
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:91
msgid ""
"Deny patches that contain a package which provides the name "
"``installhint(reboot-needed)``"
msgstr "ປະຕິເສດແພັດທີ່ມີແພັກເກດເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ຊື່ ``installhint(reboot-needed)``"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:118
msgid ""
"The new environment contains all kernel patches up to the new kernel version "
"you selected.  You need to reboot systems after they have performed the "
"upgrade.  The new kernel remains valid for one year.  All packages installed "
"during the year match the current live patching kernel filter."
msgstr "ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃໝ່ປະກອບມີທຸກໆແພັດເຄີເນິນຈົນເຖິງເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນໃໝ່ທີ່ເຈົ້າເລືອກ. ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຣີບູດລະບົບຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ພວກມັນໄດ້ດຳເນີນການອັບເກຣດແລ້ວ. ເຄີເນິນໃໝ່ຈະຍັງຄົງໃຊ້ໄດ້ເປັນເວລາໜຶ່ງປີ. ທຸກໆແພັກເກດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະຫວ່າງປີຈະກົງກັບຕົວຕອງເຄີເນິນການແພັດແບບສົດໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:119
#, no-wrap
msgid "AppStream filters"
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງ AppStream"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:120
msgid ""
"In a content lifecycle management project, you can use the AppStream filter "
"to transform modular repositories into regular repositories.  It does this "
"by keeping the packages in the repository and stripping away the module "
"metadata.  The resulting repository can be used in {productname} in the same "
"way as a regular repository."
msgstr "ໃນໂຄງການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ AppStream ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວແບບໂມດູລາ (Modular repositories) ໃຫ້ເປັນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວແບບປົກກະຕິ. ມັນເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການຮັກສາແພັກເກດໄວ້ໃນຄັງເກັບ ແລະ ຖອນຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາ (Metadata) ຂອງໂມດູລາອອກ. ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໃນ {productname} ໄດ້ໃນຮູບແບບດຽວກັນກັບຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:121
msgid "AppStream repositories are natively supported throughout the {webui}."
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ AppStream ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນໂດຍກົງຜ່ານ {webui}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:122
msgid ""
"Since {productname} 5.0, AppStream repositories are natively supported "
"throughout the {webui}."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງແຕ່ {productname} 5.0 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ AppStream ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນໂດຍກົງຜ່ານ {webui}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:123
msgid ""
"Therefore, this process is not mandatory to work with AppStream "
"repositories."
msgstr "ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຂະບວນການນີ້ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ບັງຄັບໃນການເຮັດວຽກກັບຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ AppStream."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:124
msgid ""
"The AppStream filter selects a single module stream to be included in the "
"target repository.  You can add multiple filters to select multiple module "
"streams."
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງ AppStream ຈະເລືອກສາຍທານໂມດູລາ (Module stream) ດຽວເພື່ອລວມເຂົ້າໃນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປາຍທາງ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງໄດ້ຫຼາຍອັນເພື່ອເລືອກສາຍທານໂມດູລາຫຼາຍອັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:125
msgid ""
"If you do not use an AppStream filter in your CLM project, the module "
"metadata in the modular sources remains intact, and the target repositories "
"contain the same module metadata.  As long as at least one AppStream filter "
"is enabled in the CLM project, all target repositories are transformed into "
"regular repositories."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ AppStream ໃນໂຄງການ CLM ຂອງເຈົ້າ, ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາຂອງໂມດູລາໃນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໂມດູລາຈະຍັງຄົງຄືເກົ່າ, ແລະ ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປາຍທາງຈະມີຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາຂອງໂມດູລາແບບດຽວກັນ. ຕາບໃດທີ່ມີການເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ AppStream ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນໃນໂຄງການ CLM, ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປາຍທາງທັງໝົດຈະຖືກປ່ຽນໃຫ້ເປັນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:126
msgid ""
"In some cases, you might wish to build regular repositories without having "
"to include packages from any module.  To do so, add an AppStream filter "
"using the matcher [parameter]``none (disable modularity)``.  This will "
"disable all the modules in the target repository.  This is especially useful "
"for {rhel}{nbsp}9 clients, where the default versions of most modules are "
"already included in the AppStream repository as regular packages."
msgstr "ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການສ້າງຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປົກກະຕິໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງລວມເອົາແພັກເກດຈາກໂມດູລາໃດໆ. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງ AppStream ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຈັບຄູ່ (Matcher) [parameter]``none (disable modularity)``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປິດການນຳໃຊ້ໂມດູລາທັງໝົດໃນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປາຍທາງ. ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເປັນພິເສດສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ {rhel}{nbsp}9, ເຊິ່ງເວີຊັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໂມດູລາສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນຖືກລວມຢູ່ໃນຄັງເກັບ AppStream ໃນຮູບແບບແພັກເກດປົກກະຕິຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:127
msgid ""
"To use the AppStream filter, you need a CLM project with a modular "
"repository such as ``{rhel} AppStreams``.  Ensure that you included the "
"module you need as a source before you begin."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ AppStream, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີໂຄງການ CLM ທີ່ມີຄັງເກັບຊອບແວແບບໂມດູລາ ເຊັ່ນ ``{rhel} AppStreams``. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າໄດ້ລວມເອົາໂມດູລາທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເປັນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ອນທີ່ເຈົ້າຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:128
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Using AppStream filters"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ AppStream"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:129
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:144
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:158
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to your {rhel}{nbsp}8 or 9 CLM "
"project."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ໂຄງການ CLM {rhel}{nbsp}8 ຫຼື 9 ຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:130
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:145
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:159
msgid "Ensure that you have included the AppStream channels for your project."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າໄດ້ລວມເອົາຊ່ອງທາງ AppStream ສຳລັບໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:131
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:146
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:160
msgid "Click btn:[Create Filter] and use these parameters:"
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Filter] ແລະ ໃຊ້ຄ່າກຳນົດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:132
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:147
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:161
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filter Name`` field, type a name for the new filter."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບຕົວຕອງໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:133
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:148
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:162
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filter Type`` field, select [parameter]``Module "
"(Stream)``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Filter Type``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [parameter]``Module (Stream)``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:134
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:149
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, select [parameter]``equals``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [parameter]``equals``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:135
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Module Name`` field, type a module name."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Module Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ໂມດູລາ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:136
msgid "For example, [parameter]``postgresql``."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [parameter]``postgresql``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:137
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Stream`` field, type the name of the desired stream."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Stream``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ຂອງສາຍທານ (Stream) ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:138
msgid ""
"For example, [parameter]``10``.  If you leave this field blank, the default "
"stream for the module is selected."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: [parameter]``10``. ຖ້າເຈົ້າປະຫ້ອງນີ້ໄວ້ໃຫ້ວ່າງ, ສາຍທານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບໂມດູລາຈະຖືກເລືອກ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:139
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:164
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to create the new filter."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຕອງໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:141
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:166
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], select your new AppStream filter, and "
"click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], ເລືອກຕົວຕອງ AppStream ໃໝ່ຂອງເຈົ້າ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:142
msgid ""
"You can use the browse function in the ``Create/Edit Filter`` form to select "
"a module from a list of available module streams for a modular channel."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນການຄົ້ນຫາ (Browse) ໃນແບບຟອມ ``Create/Edit Filter`` ເພື່ອເລືອກໂມດູລາຈາກລາຍຊື່ສາຍທານໂມດູລາທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງແບບໂມດູລາ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:143
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Browsing available module streams"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຄົ້ນຫາສາຍທານໂມດູລາທີ່ມີໃຫ້"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:150
msgid "Click ``Browse available modules`` to see all modular channels."
msgstr "ຄລິກ ``Browse available modules`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຊ່ອງທາງແບບໂມດູລາທັງໝົດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:151
msgid "Select a channel to browse the modules and streams:"
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາໂມດູລາ ແລະ ສາຍທານ:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:152
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Module Name`` field, start typing a module name to search, "
"or select from the list."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Module Name``, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມພິມຊື່ໂມດູລາເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາ ຫຼື ເລືອກຈາກລາຍຊື່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:153
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Stream`` field, start typing a stream name to search, or "
"select from the list."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Stream``, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມພິມຊື່ສາຍທານເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາ ຫຼື ເລືອກຈາກລາຍຊື່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:154
msgid ""
"Channel selection is only for browsing modules.  The selected channel is not "
"be saved with the filter, and does not affect the CLM process in any way."
msgstr "ການເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງແມ່ນເພື່ອການຄົ້ນຫາໂມດູລາເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເລືອກຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ກັບຕົວຕອງ, ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບໃດໆຕໍ່ຂະບວນການ CLM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:155
msgid ""
"You can create additional AppStream filters for any other module stream to "
"be included in the target repository.  Any module streams that the selected "
"stream depends on is automatically included."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງຕົວຕອງ AppStream ເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບສາຍທານໂມດູລາອື່ນໆເພື່ອລວມເຂົ້າໃນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປາຍທາງ. ສາຍທານໂມດູລາໃດໆທີ່ສາຍທານທີ່ເລືອກນັ້ນຕ້ອງການ (Dependency) ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:156
msgid ""
"Be careful not to specify conflicting, incompatible, or missing module "
"streams.  For example, selecting two streams from the same module is "
"invalid."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ລະມັດລະວັງບໍ່ໃຫ້ກຳນົດສາຍທານໂມດູລາທີ່ຂັດແຍ້ງກັນ, ເຂົ້າກັນບໍ່ໄດ້ ຫຼື ຫາຍໄປ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການເລືອກສອງສາຍທານຈາກໂມດູລາດຽວກັນແມ່ນບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:157
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Disabling modularity"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປິດການນຳໃຊ້ໂມດູລາ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:163
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Matcher`` field, select [parameter]``none (disable "
"modularity)``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Matcher``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [parameter]``none (disable modularity)``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:167
msgid ""
"This will effectively remove the module metadata from the target repository, "
"excluding any package that belongs to a module."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖອນຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເດຕາຂອງໂມດູລາອອກຈາກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປາຍທາງຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິຜົນ, ໂດຍຈະຍົກເວັ້ນທຸກໆແພັກເກດທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບໂມດູລາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:168
msgid ""
"When you build your CLM project using the btn:[Build] button in the {webui}, "
"the target repository is a regular repository without any modules, that "
"contains packages from the selected module streams."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງໂຄງການ CLM ຂອງເຈົ້າໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ btn:[Build] ໃນ {webui}, ຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປາຍທາງຈະເປັນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປົກກະຕິທີ່ບໍ່ມີໂມດູລາໃດໆ, ເຊິ່ງປະກອບມີແພັກເກດຈາກສາຍທານໂມດູລາທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:169
msgid ""
"Disabling modularity altogether in {rhel}{nbsp}8 projects might result in a "
"faulty environment as some modules are essential for healthy operation in "
"{rhel}{nbsp}8."
msgstr "ການປິດການນຳໃຊ້ໂມດູລາທັງໝົດໃນໂຄງການ {rhel}{nbsp}8 ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຜິດພາດໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ເນື່ອງຈາກບາງໂມດູລາແມ່ນມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ປົກກະຕິໃນ {rhel}{nbsp}8."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content Lifecycle Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Content lifecycle management allows you to customize and test packages "
"before updating production clients.  This is especially useful if you need "
"to apply updates during a limited maintenance window."
msgstr "ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງ ແລະ ທົດສອບແພັກເກດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະອັບເດດລູກຂ່າຍໃນລະບົບໃຊ້ງານຈິງ (Production). ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເປັນພິເສດຖ້າເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງນຳໃຊ້ການອັບເດດໃນລະຫວ່າງໄລຍະເວລາການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (Maintenance window) ທີ່ຈຳກັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Content lifecycle management allows you to select software channels as "
"sources, adjust them as required for your environment, and thoroughly test "
"them before installing onto your production clients."
msgstr "ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວເປັນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ, ປັບແຕ່ງພວກມັນຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງເຈົ້າ, ແລະ ທົດສອບພວກມັນຢ່າງລະອຽດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງໃສ່ລູກຂ່າຍໃນລະບົບໃຊ້ງານຈິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:4
msgid ""
"While you cannot directly modify vendor channels, you can clone them and "
"then modify the clones by adding or removing packages and custom patches.  "
"You can assign these cloned channels to test clients to ensure they work as "
"expected."
msgstr "ເຖິງວ່າເຈົ້າຈະບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ (Vendor channels) ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ, ແຕ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດສຳເນົາ (Clone) ພວກມັນ ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນປ່ຽນແປງສຳເນົານັ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຖອນແພັກເກດ ແລະ ແພັດທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງເອງ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຮັດສຳເນົາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍທົດສອບເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພວກມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:5
msgid ""
"By default, cloned vendor channels match the original vendor channel and "
"automatically select the dependencies.  You can disable the automatic "
"selection for cloned channels by adding the following option in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດທີ່ເຮັດສຳເນົາຈະກົງກັບຊ່ອງທາງເດີມ ແລະ ຈະເລືອກສິ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງການ (Dependencies) ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປິດການເລືອກອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຮັດສຳເນົາໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.cloned_channel_auto_selection = false\n"
msgstr "java.cloned_channel_auto_selection = false\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Then, when all tests pass, you can promote the cloned channels to production "
"servers."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນ, ເມື່ອການທົດສອບທັງໝົດຜ່ານແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລື່ອນລະດັບ (Promote) ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຮັດສຳເນົານັ້ນໄປຍັງເຊີບເວີໃນລະບົບໃຊ້ງານຈິງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:8
msgid ""
"This is achieved through a series of environments that your software "
"channels can move through on their lifecycle.  Most environment lifecycles "
"include at least test and production environments, but you can have as many "
"environments as you require."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ສຳເລັດໄດ້ໂດຍຜ່ານຊຸດຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຂອງເຈົ້າສາມາດເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍຜ່ານວົງຈອນຊີວິດຂອງພວກມັນ. ວົງຈອນຊີວິດຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະປະກອບມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທົດສອບ ແລະ ລະບົບໃຊ້ງານຈິງ, ແຕ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດມີສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໄດ້ຫຼາຍເທົ່າທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This section covers the basic content lifecycle procedures, and the filters "
"available.  For more specific examples, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc[]."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາຂັ້ນຕອນພື້ນຖານຂອງວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ ແລະ ຕົວຕອງທີ່ມີໃຫ້. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a content lifecycle project"
msgstr "ການສ້າງໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:11
msgid ""
"To set up a content lifecycle, you need to begin with a project.  The "
"project defines the software channel sources, the filters used to find "
"packages, and the build environments."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍໂຄງການ. ໂຄງການຈະກຳນົດແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ, ຕົວຕອງທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຊອກຫາແພັກເກດ, ແລະ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນການສ້າງ (Build environments)."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a content lifecycle project"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and click btn:[Create Project]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Project]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:14
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Label`` field, enter a label for your project."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Label``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນປ້າຍຊື່ (Label) ສຳລັບໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:15
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:28
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Label`` field only accepts lowercase letters, numbers, "
"periods, hyphens, and underscores."
msgstr "ຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Label`` ຮັບຮອງເອົາສະເພາະຕົວອັກສອນພາສາອັງກິດໂຕພິມນ້ອຍ, ຕົວເລກ, ຈຸດ (.), ເຄື່ອງໝາຍລົບ (-), ແລະ ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂີດກ້ອງ (_) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:16
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Name`` field, enter a descriptive name for your project."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Name``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ທີ່ອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Click the btn:[Create] button to create your project and return to the "
"project page."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອສ້າງໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າ ແລະ ກັບຄືນໄປຍັງໜ້າໂຄງການ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:18
msgid "Click btn:[Attach/Detach Sources]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Sources]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Sources`` dialog, select the source type, and select a "
"base channel for your project."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ [guimenu]``Sources``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກປະເພດແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ, ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (Base channel) ສຳລັບໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The available child channels for the selected base channel are displayed, "
"including information on whether the channel is mandatory or recommended."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍ (Child channels) ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ເລືອກຈະຖືກສະແດງຂຶ້ນ, ລວມທັງຂໍ້ມູນວ່າຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ບັງຄັບ ຫຼື ແນະນຳ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Check the child channels you require, and click btn:[Save] to return to the "
"project page."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຍ່ອຍທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອກັບຄືນໄປຍັງໜ້າໂຄງການ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:22
msgid "The software channels you selected should now be showing."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ເຈົ້າເລືອກຄວນຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນໃນເວລານີ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filters`` dialog, select the filters you want to attach to "
"the project."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ [guimenu]``Filters``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຕົວຕອງທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງເຂົ້າກັບໂຄງການ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:25
msgid "To create a new filter, click btn:[Create new Filter]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຕອງໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Create new Filter]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:26
msgid "Click btn:[Add Environment]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Add Environment]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle`` dialog, give the first environment "
"a name, a label, and a description, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຊື່, ປ້າຍຊື່, ແລະ ຄຳອະທິບາຍໃຫ້ກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທຳອິດ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Continue creating environments until you have all the environments for your "
"lifecycle completed."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການສ້າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຕໍ່ໄປຈົນກວ່າເຈົ້າຈະມີທຸກສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສຳລັບວົງຈອນຊີວິດຂອງເຈົ້າຄົບຖ້ວນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:30
msgid ""
"You can select the order of the environments in the lifecycle by selecting "
"an environment in the [guimenu]``Insert before`` field when you create it."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກລຳດັບຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນວົງຈອນຊີວິດໄດ້ໂດຍການເລືອກສະພາບແວດລ້ອມໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Insert before`` ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງມັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter types"
msgstr "ປະເພດຕົວຕອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:32
msgid ""
"{productname} allows you to create various types of filters to control the "
"content used for building the project.  Filters allow you to select which "
"packages are included or excluded from the build.  For example, you could "
"exclude all kernel packages, or include only specific releases of some "
"packages."
msgstr "{productname} ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສ້າງຕົວຕອງປະເພດຕ່າງໆເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມເນື້ອຫາທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງໂຄງການ. ຕົວຕອງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເລືອກວ່າແພັກເກດໃດຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ຍົກເວັ້ນອອກຈາກການສ້າງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເຈົ້າສາມາດຍົກເວັ້ນທຸກແພັກເກດເຄີເນິນ, ຫຼື ລວມເອົາສະເພາະການປ່ອຍ (Releases) ທີ່ແນ່ນອນຂອງບາງແພັກເກດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:33
msgid "The supported filters are:"
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:34
msgid "package filtering"
msgstr "ການຕອງແພັກເກດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:35
msgid "by name"
msgstr "ຕາມຊື່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:36
msgid "by name, epoch, version, release, and architecture"
msgstr "ຕາມຊື່, epoch, ເວີຊັນ, release, ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ (Architecture)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:37
msgid "by provided name"
msgstr "ຕາມຊື່ທີ່ລະບຸ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:38
msgid "patch filtering"
msgstr "ການຕອງແພັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:39
msgid "by advisory name"
msgstr "ຕາມຊື່ Advisory"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:40
msgid "by advisory type"
msgstr "ຕາມປະເພດ Advisory"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:41
msgid "by synopsis"
msgstr "ຕາມບົດສະຫຼຸບ (Synopsis)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:42
msgid "by keyword"
msgstr "ຕາມຄຳສຳຄັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:43
msgid "by date"
msgstr "ຕາມວັນທີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:44
msgid "by affected package"
msgstr "ຕາມແພັກເກດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:45
msgid "module"
msgstr "ໂມດູລາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:46
msgid "by stream"
msgstr "ຕາມສາຍທານ (Stream)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:47
msgid "Package dependencies are not resolved during content filtering."
msgstr "ສິ່ງທີ່ແພັກເກດຕ້ອງການ (Dependencies) ຈະບໍ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕອງເນື້ອຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:48
msgid ""
"There are multiple matchers you can use with the filter.  Which ones are "
"available depends on the filter type you choose."
msgstr "ມີຕົວຈັບຄູ່ (Matchers) ຫຼາຍອັນທີ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບຕົວຕອງ. ຕົວໃດທີ່ຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ນັ້ນແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຕົວຕອງທີ່ເຈົ້າເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:49
msgid "The available matchers are:"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັບຄູ່ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:50
msgid "contains"
msgstr "ປະກອບມີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:51
msgid "matches (must take the form of a regular expression)"
msgstr "ກົງກັບ (ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ Regular expression)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:52
msgid "equals"
msgstr "ເທົ່າກັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:53
msgid "greater"
msgstr "ຫຼາຍກວ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:54
msgid "greater or equal"
msgstr "ຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:55
msgid "lower or equal"
msgstr "ນ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:56
msgid "lower"
msgstr "ນ້ອຍກວ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:57
msgid "later or equal"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter ``rule`` parameter"
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີ ``rule`` ຂອງຕົວຕອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Each filter has a ``rule`` parameter that can be set to either ``Allow`` or "
"``Deny``.  The filters are processed like this:"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຕົວຕອງຈະມີຄ່າກຳນົດ ``rule`` ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ ``Allow`` (ອະນຸຍາດ) ຫຼື ``Deny`` (ປະຕິເສດ). ຕົວຕອງຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:60
msgid ""
"If a package or patch satisfies a ``Deny`` filter, it is excluded from the "
"result."
msgstr "ຖ້າແພັກເກດ ຫຼື ແພັດໃດໜຶ່ງກົງກັບຕົວຕອງ ``Deny``, ມັນຈະຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນອອກຈາກຜົນລັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:61
msgid ""
"If a package or patch satisfies an ``Allow`` filter, it is included in the "
"result (even if it was excluded by a ``Deny`` filter). ``Allow`` filters for "
"packages only operate on package filters and ``Allow`` filters for patches "
"only operate on patch filters. This means with a package filter you cannot "
"add packages back in that were filtered out through patch filters or vice "
"versa for patches that where filtered out through package filters."
msgstr "ຖ້າແພັກເກດ ຫຼື ແພັດໃດໜຶ່ງກົງກັບຕົວຕອງ ``Allow``, ມັນຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນຜົນລັບ (ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນຈະຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນໂດຍຕົວຕອງ ``Deny`` ກໍຕາມ). ຕົວຕອງ ``Allow`` ສຳລັບແພັກເກດຈະເຮັດວຽກສະເພາະກັບຕົວຕອງແພັກເກດເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ຕົວຕອງ ``Allow`` ສຳລັບແພັດຈະເຮັດວຽກສະເພາະກັບຕົວຕອງແພັດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງແພັກເກດເພື່ອເອົາແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກຄັດອອກໂດຍຕົວຕອງແພັດກັບຄືນມາໄດ້, ຫຼື ໃນທາງກັບກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:62
msgid ""
"This behavior is useful when you want to exclude large number of packages or "
"patches using a general ``Deny`` filter and \"cherry-pick\" specific "
"packages or patches with specific ``Allow`` filters."
msgstr "ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຍົກເວັ້ນແພັກເກດ ຫຼື ແພັດຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໂດຍການໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງ ``Deny`` ແບບທົ່ວໄປ ແລະ \"ເລືອກເອົາສະເພາະ\" (Cherry-pick) ແພັກເກດ ຫຼື ແພັດທີ່ແນ່ນອນດ້ວຍຕົວຕອງ ``Allow`` ສະເພາະ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Content filters are global in your organization and can be shared between "
"projects."
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງເນື້ອຫາແມ່ນມີຜົນບັງຄັບໃຊ້ທົ່ວທັງອົງກອນຂອງເຈົ້າ ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນລະຫວ່າງໂຄງການຕ່າງໆໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:64
msgid ""
"If your project already contains built sources, when you add an environment "
"it is automatically populated with the existing content.  Content is drawn "
"from the previous environment of the cycle if it had one.  If there is no "
"previous environment, it is left empty until the project sources are built "
"again."
msgstr "ຖ້າໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າມີແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສ້າງແລ້ວ, ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເພີ່ມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ມັນຈະຖືກຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍເນື້ອຫາທີ່ມີຢູ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເນື້ອຫາຈະຖືກດຶງມາຈາກສະພາບແວດລ້ອມກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໃນວົງຈອນຖ້າມີ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີສະພາບແວດລ້ອມກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້, ມັນຈະຖືກປະໄວ້ໃຫ້ວ່າງຈົນກວ່າແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງໂຄງການຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter templates"
msgstr "ແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງ (Filter templates)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:66
msgid ""
"To help with creating filters for some common scenarios, {productname} "
"offers filter templates.  When applied, these templates help creating a set "
"of filters in advance, tailored for a specific use case."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການສ້າງຕົວຕອງສຳລັບບາງສະຖານະການທົ່ວໄປ, {productname} ໄດ້ສະໜອງແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງໃຫ້. ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້, ແມ່ແບບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍສ້າງຊຸດຕົວຕອງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ເຊິ່ງຖືກປັບແຕ່ງມາໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບການນຳໃຊ້ສະເພາະຕົວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:67
msgid "This section describes available templates and their usages."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບແມ່ແບບທີ່ມີໃຫ້ ແລະ ການນຳໃຊ້ຂອງພວກມັນ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live patching based on a {suse} product"
msgstr "Live patching ຕາມຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:69
msgid ""
"In a project that contains live patching, regular future kernel packages "
"must be excluded so that only live patch packages are offered as updates to "
"clients. On the other hand, already installed regular kernel packages must "
"still be included to keep system integrity."
msgstr "ໃນໂຄງການທີ່ປະກອບມີການແພັດແບບສົດ, ແພັກເກດເຄີເນິນປົກກະຕິໃນອະນາຄົດຕ້ອງຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະເພາະແພັກເກດການແພັດແບບສົດເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກສະເໜີໃຫ້ເປັນການອັບເດດແກ່ລູກຂ່າຍ. ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ແພັກເກດເຄີເນິນປົກກະຕິທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ແລ້ວຕ້ອງຍັງຄົງຖືກລວມເອົາໄວ້ເພື່ອຮັກສາຄວາມສົມບູນຂອງລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:70
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:88
msgid ""
"When applied, this template creates three filters required to achieve this "
"behavior:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້, ແມ່ແບບນີ້ຈະສ້າງຕົວຕອງສາມອັນທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ພຶດຕິກຳດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:71
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:89
msgid ""
"Allow patches that contain ``kernel-default`` package equal to a base kernel "
"version"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດ (Allow) ແພັດທີ່ປະກອບມີແພັກເກດ ``kernel-default`` ທີ່ເທົ່າກັບເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນຫຼັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:74
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:92
msgid ""
"For more information on how to set up a live patching project, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#exclude-higher-kernel-version[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການການແພັດແບບສົດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#exclude-higher-kernel-version[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:75
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:93
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:112
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying the template"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:77
msgid ""
"In the dialog, click btn:[Use a template]. The inputs will change "
"accordingly."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Use a template]. ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕ້ອງປ້ອນຈະປ່ຽນແປງໄປຕາມນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:78
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Prefix`` field, type a name prefix. This value will be "
"prepended to the name of every individual filter created by the template. If "
"the template is being applied in the context of a project, this field will "
"be prefilled with the project label."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Prefix``, ໃຫ້ພິມຄຳນຳໜ້າຊື່ (Prefix). ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃສ່ຂ້າງໜ້າຊື່ຂອງແຕ່ລະຕົວຕອງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍແມ່ແບບ. ຖ້າແມ່ແບບຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງໂຄງການ, ຫ້ອງນີ້ຈະຖືກຕື່ມດ້ວຍປ້າຍຊື່ໂຄງການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:79
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Template`` field, select [guimenu]``Live patching based on "
"a SUSE product``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Template``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Live patching based on a SUSE product``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:80
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Product`` field, select the product you wish to set up "
"live patching for."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Product``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າການແພັດແບບສົດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:81
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Kernel`` field, select a kernel version from the list of "
"versions available in the selected product. The filter to deny the later "
"regular kernel patches will be based on this version."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Kernel``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນຈາກລາຍຊື່ເວີຊັນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃນຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ເລືອກ. ຕົວຕອງທີ່ຈະປະຕິເສດແພັດເຄີເນິນປົກກະຕິໃນພາຍຫຼັງແມ່ນຈະອີງຕາມເວີຊັນນີ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:82
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:100
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:119
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to create the filters."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save] ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຕອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:85
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:103
msgid ""
"Select the three filters that have the specified prefix, and click "
"btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ເລືອກຕົວຕອງທັງສາມອັນທີ່ມີຄຳນຳໜ້າທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live patching based on a system"
msgstr "Live patching ຕາມລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:87
msgid ""
"When you want to set up a live patching project based on a kernel version "
"installed in a specific registered system, you can use the \"live patching "
"based on a system\" template."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການການແພັດແບບສົດໂດຍອີງຕາມເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບທີ່ລົງທະບຽນສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບ \"live patching based on a system\" ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:95
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:115
msgid ""
"In the dialog, click btn:[Use a template].  The inputs will change "
"accordingly."
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Use a template]. ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕ້ອງປ້ອນຈະປ່ຽນແປງໄປຕາມນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:96
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:116
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Prefix`` field, type a name prefix.  This value will be "
"prepended to the name of every filter created by the template.  If the "
"template is being applied in the context of a project, this field will be "
"prefilled with the project label."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Prefix``, ໃຫ້ພິມຄຳນຳໜ້າຊື່. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃສ່ຂ້າງໜ້າຊື່ຂອງທຸກໆຕົວຕອງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍແມ່ແບບ. ຖ້າແມ່ແບບຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງໂຄງການ, ຫ້ອງນີ້ຈະຖືກຕື່ມດ້ວຍປ້າຍຊື່ໂຄງການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:97
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Template`` field, select [guimenu]``Live patching based on "
"a specific system``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Template``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Live patching based on a specific system``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:98
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``System`` field, select a system from the list, or start "
"typing a system name to narrow down the options."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``System``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກລະບົບຈາກລາຍຊື່, ຫຼື ເລີ່ມພິມຊື່ລະບົບເພື່ອຈຳກັດຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ແຄບລົງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:99
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Kernel`` field, select a kernel version from the list of "
"versions installed in the selected system.  The filter to deny the later "
"regular kernel patches will be based on this version."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Kernel``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເວີຊັນເຄີເນິນຈາກລາຍຊື່ເວີຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບທີ່ເລືອກ. ຕົວຕອງທີ່ຈະປະຕິເສດແພັດເຄີເນິນປົກກະຕິໃນພາຍຫຼັງແມ່ນຈະອີງຕາມເວີຊັນນີ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:104
#, no-wrap
msgid "AppStream modules with defaults"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ AppStream ພ້ອມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:105
msgid ""
"When you want to have all the modules available in a modular repository "
"included in your project, you can automatically add them using this filter "
"template."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມີທຸກໂມດູລາທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວແບບໂມດູລາລວມຢູ່ໃນໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມພວກມັນໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍການໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບຕົວຕອງນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:106
msgid ""
"When applied, this template creates an AppStream filter per module and its "
"default stream."
msgstr "ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້, ແມ່ແບບນີ້ຈະສ້າງຕົວຕອງ AppStream ໜຶ່ງອັນຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງໂມດູລາ ແລະ ສາຍທານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:107
msgid ""
"If this process is done from the project's page, the filters are added to "
"the project automatically. Otherwise, the created filters can be listed in "
"menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] and be added to any project as needed."
msgstr "ຖ້າຂະບວນການນີ້ເຮັດຈາກໜ້າຂອງໂຄງການ, ຕົວຕອງຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໂຄງການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຕົວຕອງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນສາມາດຖືກສະແດງລາຍຊື່ໃນ menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] ແລະ ສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໂຄງການໃດໆກໍໄດ້ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:108
msgid ""
"Each individual filter can be edited to select a different module stream, or "
"removed altogether to exclude that module from the target repositories."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຕົວຕອງສາມາດຖືກແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອເລືອກສາຍທານໂມດູລາທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ຫຼື ສາມາດຖອນອອກທັງໝົດເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນໂມດູລານັ້ນອອກຈາກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວປາຍທາງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:109
msgid ""
"Because not all module streams are compatible with each other, changing "
"individual streams may prevent successful resolution of modular "
"dependencies. When this happens, the filters pane in the project details "
"page will show an error describing the problem, and the build button will be "
"disabled until all the module selections are compatible."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກວ່າບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກສາຍທານໂມດູລາຈະເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້, ການປ່ຽນແປງສາຍທານແຕ່ລະອັນອາດຈະຂັດຂວາງການແກ້ໄຂສິ່ງທີ່ໂມດູລາຕ້ອງການ (Modular dependencies). ເມື່ອສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ແຜງຕົວຕອງໃນໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດໂຄງການຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ອະທິບາຍບັນຫາ, ແລະ ປຸ່ມສ້າງ (Build) ຈະຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານຈົນກວ່າການເລືອກໂມດູລາທັງໝົດຈະເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:110
msgid ""
"Since {rhel}{nbsp}9, modules do not have any defined default streams.  "
"Therefore, using this template with {rhel}{nbsp}9 sources will have no "
"effect."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງແຕ່ {rhel}{nbsp}9 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ໂມດູລາບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດສາຍທານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃດໆ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການໃຊ້ແມ່ແບບນີ້ກັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ {rhel}{nbsp}9 ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃດໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:111
msgid ""
"For more information on how to set up AppStream repositories with content "
"lifecycle management, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#appstream-filters[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ AppStream ດ້ວຍການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#appstream-filters[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:113
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and select your project."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], ແລະ ເລືອກໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:114
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Filters`` section, click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], and "
"then click btn:[Create New Filter]."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Filters``, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກ btn:[Create New Filter]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:117
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Template`` field, select [guimenu]``AppStream modules with "
"defaults``."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Template``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [guimenu]``AppStream modules with defaults``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:118
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Channel`` field, select a modular channel to get the "
"modules from. In this dropdown, only the modular channels are displayed."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Channel``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງແບບໂມດູລາເພື່ອດຶງໂມດູລາມາຈາກບ່ອນນັ້ນ. ໃນລາຍຊື່ແບບເລື່ອນລົງນີ້, ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ຊ່ອງທາງແບບໂມດູລາເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກສະແດງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:120
msgid ""
"Scroll to the [guimenu]``Filters`` section to see the newly attached "
"AppStream filters."
msgstr "ເລື່ອນໄປທີ່ສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Filters`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວຕອງ AppStream ທີ່ຫາກໍຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງເຂົ້າໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:121
msgid ""
"You can edit/remove any individual filter to tailor the project to your "
"needs."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດແກ້ໄຂ/ຖອນຕົວຕອງແຕ່ລະອັນອອກໄດ້ ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງໂຄງການໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:122
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a content lifecycle project"
msgstr "ການບິວໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:123
msgid ""
"When you have created your project, defined environments, and attached "
"sources and filters, you can build the project for the first time."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງໂຄງການ, ກຳນົດສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ, ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຕົວຕອງແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງ (Build) ໂຄງການເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:124
msgid ""
"Building applies filters to the attached sources and clones them to the "
"first environment in the project."
msgstr "ການສ້າງຈະນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງກັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ ແລະ ເຮັດສຳເນົາພວກມັນໄປຍັງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທຳອິດໃນໂຄງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:125
msgid ""
"You can use the same vendor channels as sources for multiple content "
"projects.  In this case, {productname} does not create new patch clones for "
"each cloned channel.  Instead, a single patch clone is shared between all of "
"your cloned channels.  This can cause problems if a vendor modifies a patch; "
"for example, if the patch is retracted, or the packages within the patch are "
"changed.  When you build one of the content projects, all the channels that "
"share the cloned patch are synchronized with the original by default, even "
"if the channels are in other environments of your content project, or other "
"content project channels in your organization.  You can change this behavior "
"by turning off automatic patch synchronization in your organization "
"settings.  To manually synchronize the patch later for all channels sharing "
"the patch, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], click the channel "
"you want to synchronize and navigate to the [guimenu]``Sync`` subtab.  Even "
"manual patch synchronization affects all organization channels sharing the "
"patch."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດດຽວກັນເປັນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບຫຼາຍໂຄງການເນື້ອຫາໄດ້. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, {productname} ຈະບໍ່ສ້າງສຳເນົາແພັດໃໝ່ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຮັດສຳເນົາ. ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳເນົາແພັດດຽວຮ່ວມກັນລະຫວ່າງທຸກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຮັດສຳເນົາຂອງເຈົ້າ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາໄດ້ຖ້າຜູ້ຜະລິດມີການແກ້ໄຂແພັດ; ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າແພັດຖືກຖອນຄືນ, ຫຼື ແພັກເກດພາຍໃນແພັດຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງໂຄງການເນື້ອຫາອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງ, ທຸກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳເນົາແພັດຮ່ວມກັນຈະຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນ (Synchronized) ກັບຕົ້ນສະບັບໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຊ່ອງທາງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຢູ່ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມອື່ນໆຂອງໂຄງການເນື້ອຫາຂອງເຈົ້າ, ຫຼື ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງຂອງໂຄງການເນື້ອຫາອື່ນໆໃນອົງກອນຂອງເຈົ້າກໍຕາມ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ່ຽນພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການປິດການຊິງໂຄຣໄນແພັດອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າອົງກອນຂອງເຈົ້າ. ເພື່ອຊິງໂຄຣໄນແພັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນພາຍຫຼັງສຳລັບທຸກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໃຊ້ແພັດຮ່ວມກັນ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Software[Manage > Channels], ຄລິກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``Sync``. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການຊິງໂຄຣໄນແພັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງກໍຍັງມີຜົນຕໍ່ທຸກຊ່ອງທາງໃນອົງກອນທີ່ໃຊ້ແພັດນັ້ນຮ່ວມກັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:126
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Building a content lifecycle project"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການບິວໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:127
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and select the project you want to build."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], ແລະ ເລືອກໂຄງການທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສ້າງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:128
msgid "Make sure you have the environment available before building the project."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າມີສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສ້າງໂຄງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:129
msgid "Review the attached sources and filters, and click btn:[Build]."
msgstr "ກວດສອບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຕົວຕອງທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Build]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:130
msgid "Provide a version message to describe the changes or updates in this build."
msgstr "ລະບຸຂໍ້ຄວາມເວີຊັນເພື່ອອະທິບາຍການປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ການອັບເດດໃນການສ້າງຄັ້ງນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:131
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:138
msgid ""
"You can monitor build progress in the [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle`` "
"section."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງການສ້າງໄດ້ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:132
msgid ""
"After the build is finished, the environment version is increased by one and "
"the built sources, such as software channels, can be assigned to your "
"clients."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການສ້າງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ເວີຊັນຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນໜຶ່ງລະດັບ ແລະ ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ເຊັ່ນ ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ, ຈະສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:133
#, no-wrap
msgid "Promote environments"
msgstr "ການເລື່ອນ (Promote) ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:134
msgid ""
"When the project has been built, the built sources can be sequentially "
"promoted to the environments."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໂຄງການຖືກສ້າງແລ້ວ, ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນສາມາດຖືກເລື່ອນລະດັບໄປຍັງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຕ່າງໆຕາມລຳດັບ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:135
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Promoting environments"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເລື່ອນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:136
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and select the project you want to work with."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], ແລະ ເລືອກໂຄງການທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຮັດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:137
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle`` section, locate the environment to "
"promote to its successor, and click btn:[Promote]."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Environment Lifecycle``, ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ຕ້ອງການເລື່ອນລະດັບໄປຍັງລຳດັບຖັດໄປ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Promote]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assign clients to environments"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດໄຄລແອນໃຫ້ກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:140
msgid ""
"When you build and promote content lifecycle projects, {productname} creates "
"a tree of software channels.  To add clients to the environment, assign the "
"base and child software channels to your client using menu:Software[Software "
"Channels] in the [guimenu]``System Details`` page for the client."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງ ແລະ ເລື່ອນລະດັບໂຄງການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ, {productname} ຈະສ້າງໂຄງສ້າງຕົ້ນໄມ້ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ. ເພື່ອເພີ່ມລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວຫຼັກ ແລະ ຍ່ອຍໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງເຈົ້າໂດຍໃຊ້ menu:Software[Software Channels] ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``System Details`` ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:141
msgid ""
"Newly added cloned channels are not assigned to clients automatically.  If "
"you add or promote sources you need to manually check and update your "
"channel assignments."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຮັດສຳເນົາທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາໃໝ່ຈະບໍ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ເເລື່ອນລະດັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກວດສອບ ແລະ ອັບເດດການກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:142
msgid ""
"Automatic assignment is intended to be added to {productname} in a future "
"version."
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດມີແຜນທີ່ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ {productname} ເວີຊັນໃນອະນາຄົດ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content Staging"
msgstr "ການພັກຂໍ້ມູນເນື້ອຫາ (Content Staging)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Staging is used by clients to download packages in advance, before they are "
"installed.  This allows package installation to begin as soon as it is "
"scheduled, which can reduce the amount of time required for a maintenance "
"window."
msgstr "ການພັກຂໍ້ມູນ (Staging) ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍລູກຂ່າຍເພື່ອດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ກ່ອນທີ່ພວກມັນຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ທັນທີຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຫຼຸດໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຕ້ອງການສຳລັບການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (Maintenance window) ລົງໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable Content Staging"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການພັກຂໍ້ມູນເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can manage content staging across your entire organization.  In the "
"{productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Organizations] to see a list "
"of available organizations.  Click the name of an organization, and check "
"the [guimenu]``Enable Staging Contents`` box to allow clients in this "
"organization to stage package data."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດຈັດການການພັກຂໍ້ມູນເນື້ອຫາໄດ້ທົ່ວທັງອົງກອນຂອງເຈົ້າ. ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Organizations] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ອົງກອນທີ່ມີໃຫ້. ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ອົງກອນ, ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Enable Staging Contents`` ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍໃນອົງກອນນີ້ສາມາດພັກຂໍ້ມູນແພັກເກດໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You must be logged in as the {productname} administrator to create and "
"manage organizations."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃນຖານະຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ເພື່ອສ້າງ ແລະ ຈັດການອົງກອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You can also enable staging at the command prompt by editing "
"[path]``/etc/sysconfig/rhn/up2date``, and adding or editing these lines:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ການພັກຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ທີ່ Command prompt ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ [path]``/etc/sysconfig/rhn/up2date``, ແລະ ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"stagingContent=1\n"
"stagingContentWindow=24\n"
msgstr ""
"stagingContent=1\n"
"stagingContentWindow=24\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The ``stagingContentWindow`` parameter is a time value expressed in hours "
"and determines when downloading starts.  It is the number of hours before "
"the scheduled installation or update time.  In this example, content is "
"downloaded 24 hours before the installation time.  The start time for "
"download depends on the selected contact method for a system."
msgstr "ຄ່າກຳນົດ ``stagingContentWindow`` ແມ່ນຄ່າເວລາທີ່ສະແດງເປັນຊົ່ວໂມງ ແລະ ເປັນຕົວ ກຳນົດວ່າການດາວໂຫຼດຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເມື່ອໃດ. ມັນແມ່ນຈຳນວນຊົ່ວໂມງກ່ອນເວລາການຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເດດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ເນື້ອຫາຈະຖືກດາວໂຫຼດ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງກ່ອນເວລາຕິດຕັ້ງ. ເວລາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການດາວໂຫຼດແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ (Contact method) ທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ສຳລັບລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Next time an action is scheduled, packages are automatically downloaded, but "
"not installed.  At the scheduled time, the staged packages are installed."
msgstr "ໃນຄັ້ງຖັດໄປທີ່ມີການກຳນົດເວລາການດຳເນີນການ, ແພັກເກດຈະຖືກດາວໂຫຼດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແຕ່ຈະຍັງບໍ່ທັນຕິດຕັ້ງ. ເມື່ອຮອດເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້, ແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກພັກໄວ້ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Content Staging"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການພັກຂໍ້ມູນເນື້ອຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:11
msgid "There are two parameters used to configure content staging:"
msgstr "ມີສອງຄ່າກຳນົດທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການພັກຂໍ້ມູນເນື້ອຫາ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:12
msgid ""
"[parameter]``salt_content_staging_advance`` is the advance time for the "
"content staging window to open, in hours."
msgstr "[parameter]``salt_content_staging_advance`` ແມ່ນເວລາລ່ວງໜ້າທີ່ຈະເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງການພັກຂໍ້ມູນເນື້ອຫາ, ຄິດເປັນຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:13
msgid ""
"This is the number of hours before installation starts, that package "
"downloads can begin."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳນວນຊົ່ວໂມງກ່ອນທີ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງການດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກດສາມາດເລີ່ມໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:14
msgid ""
"[parameter]``salt_content_staging_window`` is the duration of the content "
"staging window, in hours."
msgstr "[parameter]``salt_content_staging_window`` ແມ່ນໄລຍະເວລາຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງການພັກຂໍ້ມູນເນື້ອຫາ, ຄິດເປັນຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:15
msgid ""
"This is the amount of time clients have to stage packages before "
"installation begins."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍມີໃນການພັກຂໍ້ມູນແພັກເກດກ່ອນທີ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For example, if [parameter]``salt_content_staging_advance`` is set to six "
"hours, and [parameter]``salt_content_staging_window`` is set to two hours, "
"the staging window opens six hours before the installation time, and remain "
"open for two hours.  No packages are downloaded in the four remaining hours "
"until installation starts."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າ [parameter]``salt_content_staging_advance`` ຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ທີ່ 6 ຊົ່ວໂມງ, ແລະ [parameter]``salt_content_staging_window`` ຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ທີ່ 2 ຊົ່ວໂມງ, ໜ້າຕ່າງການພັກຂໍ້ມູນຈະເປີດ 6 ຊົ່ວໂມງກ່ອນເວລາຕິດຕັ້ງ, ແລະ ຈະເປີດຄ້າງໄວ້ເປັນເວລາ 2 ຊົ່ວໂມງ. ຈະບໍ່ມີການດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກດໃນຊ່ວງ 4 ຊົ່ວໂມງທີ່ເຫຼືອກ່ອນທີ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:17
msgid ""
"If you set the same value for both "
"[parameter]``salt_content_staging_advance`` and "
"[parameter]``salt_content_staging_window`` packages are able to be "
"downloaded until installation begins."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າດຽວກັນໃຫ້ກັບທັງ [parameter]``salt_content_staging_advance`` ແລະ [parameter]``salt_content_staging_window``, ແພັກເກດຕ່າງໆຈະສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ຈົນກວ່າການຕິດຕັ້ງຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Configure the content staging parameters in "
"[path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java.conf``."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີການຈັດກຽມເນື້ອຫາ (content staging) ໃນ [path]``/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java.conf``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:19
msgid "Default values:"
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:20
msgid "[path]``salt_content_staging_advance: 8 hours``"
msgstr "[path]``salt_content_staging_advance: 8 ຊົ່ວໂມງ``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:21
msgid "[path]``salt_content_staging_window: 8 hours``"
msgstr "[path]``salt_content_staging_window: 8 ຊົ່ວໂມງ``"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:22
msgid "Content staging must be enabled for these parameters to work correctly."
msgstr "ການຈັດກຽມເນື້ອຫາ (Content staging) ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເປີດໃຊ້ງານເພື່ອໃຫ້ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom Channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ (Custom Channels)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Custom channels give you the ability to create your own software packages "
"and repositories, which you can use to update your clients.  They also allow "
"you to use software provided by third party vendors in your environment."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງແພັກເກດຊອບແວ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບຂອງທ່ານເອງໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອອັບເດດລູກຂ່າຍ (clients) ຂອງທ່ານ. ພວກມັນຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ຊອບແວທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການພາຍນອກ (third party vendors) ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This section gives more detail on how to create, administer, and delete "
"custom channels.  You must have administrator privileges to be able to "
"create and manage custom channels."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການສ້າງ, ການບໍລິຫານ ແລະ ການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີສິດທິຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ (administrator) ຈຶ່ງຈະສາມາດສ້າງ ແລະ ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating custom channels and repositories"
msgstr "ການສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Before you create a custom channel, determine which base channel you want to "
"associate it with, and which repositories you want to use for content."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດວ່າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອມໂຍງມັນກັບຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ (base channel) ໃດ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຄັງເກັບໃດສຳລັບເນື້ອຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If you have custom software packages that you need to install on your client "
"systems, you can create a custom child channel to manage them.  You need to "
"create the channel in the {productname} {webui} and create a repository for "
"the packages, before assigning the channel to your systems."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານມີແພັກເກດຊອບແວກຳນົດເອງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງໃສ່ລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງລູກ (child channel) ກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອຈັດການພວກມັນໄດ້. ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງໃນ {productname} {webui} ແລະ ສ້າງຄັງເກັບສຳລັບແພັກເກດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ, ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Do not create child channels containing packages that are not compatible "
"with the client system."
msgstr "ຢ່າສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງລູກທີ່ມີແພັກເກດທີ່ບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນກັບລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You can select a vendor channel as the base channel if you want to use "
"packages provided by a vendor.  Alternatively, select ``none`` to make your "
"custom channel a base channel."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ (vendor channel) ເປັນຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານໄດ້ ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ແພັກເກດທີ່ຜູ້ຜະລິດສະໜອງໃຫ້. ຫຼື ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ``none`` ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານກາຍເປັນຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a custom channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and click btn:[Create Channel]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Channel]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:11
msgid ""
"On the [guimenu]``Create Software Channel`` page, give your channel a name "
"(for example, [systemitem]``My Tools SLES 15 SP1 x86_64``) and a label (for "
"example, [systemitem]``my-tools-sles15sp1-x86_64``)."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Create Software Channel``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງທ່ານ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``My Tools SLES 15 SP1 x86_64``) ແລະ ປ້າຍຊື່ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``my-tools-sles15sp1-x86_64``)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:12
msgid "Labels must not contain spaces or uppercase letters."
msgstr "ປ້າຍຊື່ (Labels) ຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີຍະຫວ່າງ ຫຼື ຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Parent Channel`` drop down, choose the relevant base "
"channel (for example, [systemitem]``SLE-Product-SLES15-SP1-Pool for "
"x86_64``)."
msgstr "ໃນລາຍການເລືອກ [guimenu]``Parent Channel``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``SLE-Product-SLES15-SP1-Pool for x86_64``)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:14
msgid "Ensure that you choose the compatible parent channel for your packages."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງແມ່ (parent channel) ທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບແພັກເກດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Architecture`` drop down, choose the appropriate hardware "
"architecture (for example, [systemitem]``x86_64``)."
msgstr "ໃນລາຍການເລືອກ [guimenu]``Architecture``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຮາດແວທີ່ເໝາະສົມ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``x86_64``)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Provide any additional information in the contact details, channel access "
"control, and GPG fields, as required for your environment."
msgstr "ລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນສ່ວນລາຍລະອຽດການຕິດຕໍ່, ການຄວບຄຸມການເຂົ້າເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນ GPG ຕາມທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:17
msgid "Click btn:[Create Channel]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Custom channels sometimes require additional security settings.  Many third "
"party vendors secure packages with GPG.  If you want to use GPG-protected "
"packages in your custom channel, you need to trust the GPG key which has "
"been used to sign the metadata.  You can then check the [guimenu]``Has "
"Signed Metadata?`` check box to match the package metadata against the "
"trusted GPG keys."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງບາງຄັ້ງຕ້ອງການການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມປອດໄພເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ຜູ້ຜະລິດພາຍນອກຫຼາຍລາຍປົກປ້ອງແພັກເກດດ້ວຍ GPG. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ແພັກເກດທີ່ປົກປ້ອງດ້ວຍ GPG ໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຊື່ອໝັ້ນຄີ (key) GPG ທີ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ໃນການເຊັນຊື່ເມຕາເດຕາ (metadata). ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດໝາຍເລືອກທີ່ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Has Signed Metadata?`` ເພື່ອປຽບທຽບເມຕາເດຕາຂອງແພັກເກດກັບຄີ GPG ທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:19
msgid ""
"If remote channels and repositories are signed with GPG keys, you can import "
"and trust these GPG keys.  For example, execute the "
"[command]``spacewalk-repo-sync`` from the command line on the {productname} "
"Server:"
msgstr "ຖ້າຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບໄລຍະໄກຖືກເຊັນຊື່ດ້ວຍຄີ GPG, ທ່ານສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າ ແລະ ເຊື່ອໝັ້ນຄີ GPG ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-repo-sync`` ຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງ (command line) ໃນ {productname} Server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channellabelname> -t yum\n"
msgstr "/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channellabelname> -t yum\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:21
msgid ""
"This command and procedure is for temporary GPG key synchronization only.  "
"For storing the key permantenly, see this section later on."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ ແລະ ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນສຳລັບການປັບຂໍ້ມູນຄີ GPG ຊົ່ວຄາວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສຳລັບການເກັບຮັກສາຄີແບບຖາວອນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງໃນພາກສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:22
msgid ""
"The underlying [command]``zypper`` call will import the key, if it is "
"available.  The {webui} does not offer this feature."
msgstr "ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [command]``zypper`` ພື້ນຖານຈະນຳເຂົ້າຄີ ຫາກມີຄີຢູ່. ສ່ວນ {webui} ແມ່ນບໍ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:23
msgid ""
"This only works when the repository you want to mirror is set up in a "
"special way and provides the \"key\" in the repository next to the "
"signature.  This is the case for all repositories generated by the Open "
"Build Service (OBS).  For other repositories special preparation steps are "
"needed, as described further below."
msgstr "ນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຄັງເກັບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຮັດສຳເນົາ (mirror) ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນຮູບແບບພິເສດ ແລະ ສະໜອງ \"key\" ໃນຄັງເກັບຄຽງຄູ່ກັບລາຍເຊັນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນກໍລະນີສຳລັບຄັງເກັບທັງໝົດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ Open Build Service (OBS). ສຳລັບຄັງເກັບອື່ນໆ, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຂັ້ນຕອນການກຽມພິເສດ, ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:24
msgid ""
"By default, the ``Enable GPG Check`` field is checked when you create a new "
"channel.  If you would like to add custom packages and applications to your "
"channel, make sure you uncheck this field to be able to install unsigned "
"packages.  Disabling the GPG check is a security risk if packages are from "
"an untrusted source."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນ ``Enable GPG Check`` ຈະຖືກໝາຍເລືອກໄວ້ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງໃໝ່. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມແພັກເກດ ແລະ ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນກຳນົດເອງເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຍົກເລີກການໝາຍເລືອກຊ່ອງນີ້ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊັນຊື່ໄດ້. ການປິດການກວດສອບ GPG ແມ່ນມີຄວາມສ່ຽງດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ ຫາກແພັກເກດມາຈາກແຫຼ່ງທີ່ບໍ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:25
msgid ""
"You can only add a repository to the {productname} with the {webui} if it is "
"a valid software repository.  Check in advance that needed repository "
"metadata are available.  Tools such as [command]``createrepo`` and "
"[command]``reprepro`` are useful in this regard.  [command]``mgrpush`` can "
"help with pushing a single RPM into a channel without creating a repository."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບເຂົ້າໃນ {productname} ດ້ວຍ {webui} ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມັນເປັນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບລ່ວງໜ້າວ່າເມຕາເດຕາຂອງຄັງເກັບທີ່ຈຳເປັນນັ້ນມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ເຄື່ອງມືເຊັ່ນ [command]``createrepo`` ແລະ [command]``reprepro`` ແມ່ນມີປະໂຫຍດໃນສ່ວນນີ້. [command]``mgrpush`` ສາມາດຊ່ວຍໃນການດັນ (push) ໄຟລ໌ RPM ດຽວເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງສ້າງຄັງເກັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information on [literal]``createrepo_c`` see "
"[link]``https://manpages.opensuse.org/Leap-15.6/createrepo_c/``"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ [literal]``createrepo_c`` ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ [link]``https://manpages.opensuse.org/Leap-15.6/createrepo_c/``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For more information on [literal]``reprepro`` see "
"[link]``https://manpages.opensuse.org/Leap-15.6/reprepro/``"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ [literal]``reprepro`` ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ [link]``https://manpages.opensuse.org/Leap-15.6/reprepro/``"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding a software repository"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:29
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > "
"Repositories], and click btn:[Create Repository]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Repositories], ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Repository]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:30
msgid ""
"On the [guimenu]``Create Repository`` page, give your repository a label "
"(for example, [systemitem]``my-tools-sles15sp1-x86_64-repo``)."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Create Repository``, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງປ້າຍຊື່ຄັງເກັບຂອງທ່ານ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``my-tools-sles15sp1-x86_64-repo``)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:31
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Repository URL`` field, provide the path to the directory "
"that contains the [path]``repodata`` file (for example, "
"[systemitem]``file:///opt/mytools/``).  You can use any valid addressing "
"protocol in this field."
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Repository URL``, ໃຫ້ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ໄປຫາໂຟນເດີທີ່ມີໄຟລ໌ [path]``repodata`` (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [systemitem]``file:///opt/mytools/``). ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນຊ່ອງນີ້ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:32
msgid "Uncheck the [guimenu]``Has Signed Metadata?`` check box."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການໝາຍເລືອກທີ່ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Has Signed Metadata?``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:33
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Complete the SSL fields if your repository requires client "
"certificate authentication."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງ SSL ຫາກຄັງເກັບຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການການກວດສອບສິດດ້ວຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນລູກຂ່າຍ (client certificate)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:34
msgid "Click btn:[Create Repository]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Repository]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:35
msgid ""
"The above procedure only works if the repository you want to mirror provides "
"the \"key\" in the repository next to the signature.  This is the case for "
"all repositories generated by the OBS, but it is typically not the case for "
"repositories of operating systems that are not offered by the OBS."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຂ້າງເທິງຈະໄດ້ຜົນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຄັງເກັບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຮັດມິເຣີມີການລະບຸ \"ຄີ\" ໄວ້ໃນຄັງເກັບຄຽງຄູ່ກັບລາຍເຊັນ. ເຊິ່ງຈະເປັນແບບນີ້ສຳລັບທຸກຄັງເກັບທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ OBS, ແຕ່ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະບໍ່ເປັນແບບນີ້ສຳລັບຄັງເກັບຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກ OBS."

#.  Not sure how it is possible to import the key into the RPM DB which is used for syncing.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:36
msgid ""
"If the repository you want to use does not have a GPG key you can provide "
"one yourself and import the GPG key into the keyring manually.  If you "
"import the key into the [path]``/var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir`` keyring using "
"the [command]``gpg`` command line tool it would be stored permanently.  The "
"key would also persist if the chroot environment would be cleaned."
msgstr "ຫາກຄັງເກັບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ບໍ່ມີຄີ GPG, ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸຄີດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າຄີ GPG ເຂົ້າໃນ keyring ໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ຫາກທ່ານນຳເຂົ້າຄີເຂົ້າໃນ [path]``/var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir`` keyring ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``gpg``, ມັນຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ແບບຖາວອນ. ຄີດັ່ງກ່າວຈະຍັງຄົງຢູ່ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ chroot ຈະຖືກລຶບລ້າງກໍຕາມ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a software repository with GPG key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຄັງເກັບຊອບແວດ້ວຍຄີ GPG"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:38
msgid "On the container host, the command to import a key into the keyring, is:"
msgstr "ໃນໂຮສຂອງຄອນເທນເນີ, ຄຳສັ່ງສຳລັບນຳເຂົ້າຄີເຂົ້າໃນ keyring ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm gpg add /path/to/gpg.key\n"
msgstr "mgradm gpg add /path/to/gpg.key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:40
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Add Debian non-flat repositories using ``uyuni_suite``, ``uyuni_component``, "
"and ``uyuni_arch`` query parameters."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບ Debian ແບບ non-flat ໂດຍໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີຄຳສັ່ງ ``uyuni_suite``, ``uyuni_component``, ແລະ ``uyuni_arch``."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "``uyuni_suite``"
msgstr "``uyuni_suite``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:43
msgid ""
"is mandatory.  In Debian documentation, this is also known as "
"[literal]``distribution``.  With this parameter you specify the apt source.  "
"Without this parameter the original approach is used.  If the parameter ends "
"with ``/``, the repository is identified as flat."
msgstr "ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນ. ໃນເອກະສານຂອງ Debian, ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ [literal]``distribution``. ດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ ທ່ານຈະລະບຸແຫຼ່ງ apt source. ຫາກບໍ່ມີພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ ຈະໃຊ້ວິທີການແບບເດີມ. ຫາກພາຣາມິເຕີລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ ``/``, ຄັງເກັບຈະຖືກລະບຸວ່າເປັນແບບ flat."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "``uyuni_component``"
msgstr "``uyuni_component``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:45
msgid ""
"is optional.  This parameter can specify only one component.  It is not "
"possible to list the components.  An apt source entry allows to specify "
"multiple components, but for Uyuni it is not possible.  Instead you must "
"create a separate repository for each component."
msgstr "ເປັນທາງເລືອກ. ພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ພຽງອົງປະກອບ (component) ດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ບໍ່ສາມາດລະບຸເປັນລາຍການຫຼາຍອົງປະກອບໄດ້. ເຖິງວ່າລາຍການ apt source ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ລະບຸຫຼາຍອົງປະກອບ, ແຕ່ສຳລັບ Uyuni ແມ່ນເຮັດບໍ່ໄດ້. ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງຄັງເກັບແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບແທນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "``uyuni_arch``"
msgstr "``uyuni_arch``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:47
msgid ""
"is optional.  If omitted the architecture name is calculated with a SQL "
"query for the channel from the database.  Specify ``uyuni_arch`` explicitly "
"if it does not match the architecture of the channel (sometimes architecture "
"naming is ambiguous)."
msgstr "ເປັນທາງເລືອກ. ຫາກລະເວັ້ນໄວ້ ຊື່ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຈະຖືກຄຳນວນດ້ວຍ SQL query ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ໃຫ້ລະບຸ ``uyuni_arch`` ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ ຫາກມັນບໍ່ກົງກັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ (ບາງຄັ້ງການຕັ້ງຊື່ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳອາດຈະກຳກວມ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:48
msgid "Here are some examples:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງບາງສ່ວນ:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Debian non-flat repository mapping"
msgstr "ການຈັບຄູ່ຄັງເກັບ Debian ແບບ non-flat"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Type             | Source line / URL\n"
"| apt source line  | ``deb https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/``\n"
"| URL mapping      | "
"``https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable?uyuni_suite=binary/``\n"
"| {nbsp}           |\n"
"| apt source line  | ``deb https://deb.debian.org/debian/ stable main``\n"
"| URL mapping      | "
"``https://deb.debian.org/debian/?uyuni_suite=stable&uyuni_component=main``\n"
"| {nbsp}           |\n"
"| apt source line  | ``deb http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/ noble main``\n"
"| URL mapping      | "
"``http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/?uyuni_suite=noble&uyuni_component=main``\n"
msgstr ""
"| ປະເພດ             | ບັນທັດແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາ / URL\n"
"| ບັນທັດແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາ apt  | ``deb https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/``\n"
"| ການຈັບຄູ່ URL      | ``https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable?uyuni_suite=binary/``\n"
"| {nbsp}           |\n"
"| ບັນທັດແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາ apt  | ``deb https://deb.debian.org/debian/ stable main``\n"
"| ການຈັບຄູ່ URL      | ``https://deb.debian.org/debian/?uyuni_suite=stable&uyuni_component=main``\n"
"| {nbsp}           |\n"
"| ບັນທັດແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາ apt  | ``deb http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/ noble main``\n"
"| ການຈັບຄູ່ URL      | ``http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/?uyuni_suite=noble&uyuni_component=main``\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:51
msgid ""
"This following information about the Debian repository definition format is "
"based on https://wiki.debian.org/DebianRepository/Format#Overview."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ກ່ຽວກັບຮູບແບບການກຳນົດຄັງເກັບ Debian ແມ່ນອີງຕາມ https://wiki.debian.org/DebianRepository/Format#Overview."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:52
msgid "The repository definition format is as follows:"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການກຳນົດຄັງເກັບມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "deb uri suite [component1] [component2] [...]\n"
msgstr "deb uri suite [component1] [component2] [...]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:54
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:87
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:10
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "deb https://deb.debian.org/debian/ stable main\n"
msgstr "deb https://deb.debian.org/debian/ stable main\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:56
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:6
msgid "or"
msgstr "ຫຼື"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "deb https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/\n"
msgstr "deb https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:58
msgid ""
"For each pair of ``suite`` and ``component`` the specification defines a "
"distinct URL calculated on the base URL ``+ suite + component``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຄູ່ຂອງ ``suite`` ແລະ ``component`` ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຈະກຳນົດ URL ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ເຊິ່ງຄິດໄລ່ຈາກ URL ພື້ນຖານ ``+ suite + component``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning the repository to a channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດຄັງເກັບໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Assign your new repository to your custom channel by navigating to "
"menu:Software[Manage > Channels], clicking the name of your newly created "
"custom channel."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄັງເກັບໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານ ໂດຍໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງທີ່ທ່ານຫາກໍ່ສ້າງໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Repositories`` tab, and ensure the repository you "
"want to assign to the channel is checked.  Click btn:[Save Repositories]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Repositories``, ແລະ ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຄັງເກັບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການກຳນົດໃຫ້ຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນຖືກໝາຍເລືອກໄວ້. ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Save Repositories]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:62
msgid "By default, the synchronization process starts immediately."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຂະບວນການປັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກົງກັນ (synchronization) ຈະເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນທັນທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:63
msgid ""
"For more information about channel synchronization, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#custom-channel-sync[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການປັບຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງໃຫ້ກົງກັນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#custom-channel-sync[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding custom channels to an activation key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງໃຫ້ກັບຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (activation key)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:65
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Activation Keys], and "
"select the key you want to add the custom channel to."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Activation Keys], ແລ້ວເລືອກຄີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງເຂົ້າໄປ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:66
msgid ""
"On the [guiemnu]``Details`` tab, in the [guimenu]``Child Channels`` listing, "
"select the channel to associate."
msgstr "ໃນແທັບ [guimenu]``Details``, ໃນລາຍການ [guimenu]``Child Channels``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:67
msgid "You can select multiple channels, if you need to."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຫຼາຍຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້ ຫາກຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:68
msgid "Click btn:[Update Activation Key]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Update Activation Key]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom channel synchronization"
msgstr "ການປັບຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງໃຫ້ກົງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:70
msgid ""
"To avoid missing important updates, {suse} recommends to keep your custom "
"channels up to date with the remote repositories changes."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການພາດການອັບເດດທີ່ສຳຄັນ, {suse} ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຮັກສາຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນສະເໝີ ຕາມການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງຄັງເກັບໄລຍະໄກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:71
msgid ""
"By default, a synchronization will happen automatically for all custom "
"channels you create.  In particular, it will happen:"
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ການປັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກົງກັນຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບທຸກຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງ. ໂດຍສະເພາະແມ່ນຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:72
msgid ""
"after adding a repository to a channel from the UI or by using "
"[command]``spacewalk-common-channels``"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງຜ່ານ UI ຫຼື ໂດຍໃຊ້ [command]``spacewalk-common-channels``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:73
msgid ""
"as part of the daily task ``mgr-sync-refresh-default``, which will "
"synchronize all your custom and vendor channels."
msgstr "ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງໜ້າວຽກປະຈຳວັນ ``mgr-sync-refresh-default``, ເຊິ່ງຈະປັບຂໍ້ມູນທັງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດໃຫ້ກົງກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:74
msgid "To disable this default behaviour, set in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ຫາກຕ້ອງການປິດພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນນີ້, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.unify_custom_channel_management = 0\n"
msgstr "java.unify_custom_channel_management = 0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:76
msgid ""
"With this property turned off, no synchronization is performed automatically "
"and, in order to keep a custom channel up to date, you need to:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອປິດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ຈະບໍ່ມີການປັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກົງກັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ເພື່ອຮັກສາຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງໃຫ້ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:77
msgid ""
"synchronize it manually by navigating to the [guimenu]``Sync`` tab and click "
"btn:[Sync Now],"
msgstr "ປັບຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Sync`` ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Sync Now],"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:78
msgid ""
"set up an automated synchronization schedule from the "
"[guimenu]``Repositories`` tab."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າກຳນົດເວລາການປັບຂໍ້ມູນອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກແທັບ [guimenu]``Repositories``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:79
msgid ""
"When the process is started, there are several ways to check if a channel "
"has finished synchronizing:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຂະບວນການເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນ, ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການກວດສອບວ່າຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້ສຳເລັດການປັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກົງກັນແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:80
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard] and "
"select the [guimenu]``Products`` tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Admin[Setup Wizard] ແລ້ວເລືອກແທັບ [guimenu]``Products``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:81
msgid ""
"This dialog displays a completion bar for each product when they are being "
"synchronized."
msgstr "ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບນີ້ຈະສະແດງແຖບສະຖານະຄວາມສຳເລັດສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງປັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກົງກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:82
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"then click the channel associated to the repository."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຄັງເກັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:83
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:[Repositories > Sync] tab.  The [guimenu]``Sync "
"Status`` is shown next to the repository name."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ ເມນູ:[Repositories > Sync]. [guimenu]``Sync Status`` ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ຖັດຈາກຊື່ຄັງເກັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:84
msgid "Check the synchronization log file at the command prompt:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ (log file) ການປັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກົງກັນຜ່ານ command prompt:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log\n"
msgstr "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:86
msgid ""
"Each child channel generates its own log during the synchronization "
"progress.  You need to check all the base and child channel log files to be "
"sure that the synchronization is complete."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງລູກຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກຂອງຕົນເອງໃນລະຫວ່າງຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງການປັບຂໍ້ມູນ. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກຂອງທັງຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງລູກ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການປັບຂໍ້ມູນສຳເລັດສົມບູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:87
msgid "The following custom channel synchronization options are available:"
msgstr "ມີຕົວເລືອກການປັບຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງໃຫ້ກົງກັນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retain packages in channels which have been removed from the repository"
msgstr "ຮັກສາແພັກເກດໄວ້ໃນຊ່ອງທາງເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກຄັງເກັບແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:89
msgid "This turns off [literal]``strict`` mode."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປິດໂໝດ [literal]``strict`` (ເຄັ່ງຄັດ)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "Do not sync errata"
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງປັບຂໍ້ມູນ errata ໃຫ້ກົງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:91
msgid "Do not synchronize patches."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງປັບຂໍ້ມູນແພັດ (patches) ໃຫ້ກົງກັນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sync only latest packages"
msgstr "ປັບຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະແພັກເກດເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:93
msgid "Synchronize latest package version only."
msgstr "ປັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກົງກັນສະເພາະແພັກເກດເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create kickstartable tree"
msgstr "ສ້າງ kickstartable tree"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:95
msgid ""
"This option prepares a directory tree ready for {kickstart} auto "
"installation."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະກຽມໂຄງສ້າງໂຟນເດີ (directory tree) ໃຫ້ພ້ອມສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດຂອງ {kickstart}."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:96
#, no-wrap
msgid "Terminate upon any error"
msgstr "ຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃດໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:97
msgid "Stop synchronizing if an error occurs."
msgstr "ຢຸດການປັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກົງກັນຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:98
msgid ""
"These options will be saved persistently for each channel.  The btn:[Sync "
"now] button also saves the channel options before performing the "
"synchronization."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ຢ່າງຖາວອນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງ. ປຸ່ມ btn:[Sync now] ຍັງຈະບັນທຶກຕົວເລືອກຂອງຊ່ອງທາງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມການປັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກົງກັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:99
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add packages and patches to custom channels"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມແພັກເກດ ແລະ ແພັດໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:100
msgid ""
"When you create a new custom channel without cloning it from an existing "
"channel, it does not contain any packages or patches.  You can add the "
"packages and patches you require using the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງໃໝ່ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ໂຄລນ (cloning) ມາຈາກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະບໍ່ມີແພັກເກດ ຫຼື ແພັດໃດໆ. ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມແພັກເກດ ແລະ ແພັດທີ່ຕ້ອງການໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:101
msgid ""
"Custom channels can only include packages or patches that are cloned or "
"custom, and they must match the base architecture of the channel.  Patches "
"added to custom channels must apply to a package that exists in the channel."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງສາມາດມີໄດ້ສະເພາະແພັກເກດ ຫຼື ແພັດທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນ ຫຼື ກຳນົດເອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ ພວກມັນຕ້ອງກົງກັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳພື້ນຖານຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ. ແພັດທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງຕ້ອງສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ກັບແພັກເກດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:102
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding packages to custom channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມແພັກເກດໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:103
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and go to the [guimenu]``Packages`` tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Packages``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:104
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: See all packages currently in the channel by navigating to the "
"[guimenu]``List/Remove`` tab."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ເບິ່ງແພັກເກດທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``List/Remove``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:105
msgid "Add new packages to the channel by navigating to the [guimenu]``Add`` tab."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມແພັກເກດໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Add``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:106
msgid ""
"Select the parent channel to provide packages, and click btn:[View Packages] "
"to populate the list."
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງແມ່ທີ່ຈະສະໜອງແພັກເກດ, ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[View Packages] ເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍຊື່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:107
msgid ""
"Check the packages to add to the custom channel, and click btn:[Add "
"Packages]."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກແພັກເກດທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ, ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Add Packages]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:108
msgid ""
"When you are satisfied with the selection, click btn:[Confirm Addition] to "
"add the packages to the channel."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານພໍໃຈກັບການເລືອກແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Confirm Addition] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມແພັກເກດເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:109
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: You can compare the packages in the current channel with those in "
"a different channel by navigating to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], and "
"going to the menu:Packages[Compare] tab."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ທ່ານສາມາດປຽບທຽບແພັກເກດໃນຊ່ອງທາງປັດຈຸບັນກັບແພັກເກດໃນຊ່ອງທາງອື່ນໄດ້ ໂດຍໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ ເມນູ: Packages[Compare]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:110
msgid ""
"To make the two channels the same, click the btn:[Merge Differences] button, "
"and resolve any conflicts."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ທັງສອງຊ່ອງທາງຄືກັນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Merge Differences], ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງໃດໆ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding patches to a custom channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມແພັດໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:112
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and go to the [guimenu]``Patches`` tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Patches``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:113
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: See all patches currently in the channel by navigating to the "
"[guimenu]``List/Remove`` tab."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ເບິ່ງແພັດທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``List/Remove``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:114
msgid ""
"Add new patches to the channel by navigating to the [guimenu]``Add`` tab, "
"and selecting what kind of patches you want to add."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມແພັດໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Add``, ແລະ ເລືອກປະເພດຂອງແພັດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:115
msgid ""
"Select the parent channel to provide patches, and click btn:[View Associated "
"Patches] to populate the list."
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງແມ່ທີ່ຈະສະໜອງແພັດ, ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[View Associated Patches] ເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍຊື່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:116
msgid "Check the patches to add to the custom channel, and click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກແພັດທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ, ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:117
msgid ""
"When you are satisfied with the selection, click btn:[Confirm] to add the "
"patches to the channel."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານພໍໃຈກັບການເລືອກແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Confirm] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມແພັດເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:118
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage custom channels"
msgstr "ຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:119
msgid ""
"{productname} administrators and channel administrators can alter or delete "
"any channel."
msgstr "ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ {productname} ແລະ ຜູ້ດູແລຊ່ອງທາງສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງໃດກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:120
msgid ""
"To grant other users rights to alter or delete a channel, navigate to "
"menu:Software[Manage > Channels] and select the channel you want to edit.  "
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Managers`` tab, and check the user to grant "
"permissions.  Click btn:[Update] to save the changes."
msgstr "ເພື່ອມອບສິດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ລຶບຊ່ອງທາງໄດ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels] ແລ້ວເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ. ໄປທີ່ແທັບ [guimenu]``Managers``, ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຈະມອບສິດໃຫ້. ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Update] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:121
msgid ""
"If you delete a channel that has been assigned to a set of clients, it "
"triggers an immediate update of the channel state for any clients associated "
"with the deleted channel.  This is to ensure that the changes are reflected "
"accurately in the repository file."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານລຶບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມລູກຂ່າຍໄວ້, ມັນຈະກະຕຸ້ນການອັບເດດສະຖານະຊ່ອງທາງທັນທີສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍໃດໆທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກລຶບນັ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ແມ່ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການປ່ຽນແປງຖືກສະທ້ອນໃຫ້ເຫັນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໃນໄຟລ໌ຄັງເກັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:122
msgid ""
"You cannot delete {productname} channels with the {webui}.  Only custom "
"channels can be deleted."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບຊ່ອງທາງຂອງ {productname} ດ້ວຍ {webui} ໄດ້. ມີພຽງແຕ່ຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດລຶບໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:123
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting custom channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລຶບຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:124
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and select the channel you want to delete."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Channels], ແລ້ວເລືອກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລຶບ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:125
msgid "Click btn:[Delete software channel]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Delete software channel]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:126
msgid ""
"On the [guimenu]``Delete Channel`` page, check the details of the channel "
"you are deleting, and check the [guimenu]``Unsubscribe Systems`` checkbox to "
"remove the custom channel from any systems that might still be subscribed."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Delete Channel``, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງຈະລຶບ, ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກທີ່ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Unsubscribe Systems`` ເພື່ອຖອນຊ່ອງທາງກຳນົດເອງອອກຈາກລະບົບໃດໆທີ່ອາດຈະຍັງສະໝັກຮັບຂໍ້ມູນຢູ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:127
msgid "Click btn:[Delete Channel]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Delete Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:128
msgid ""
"When channels are deleted, the packages that are part of the deleted channel "
"are not automatically removed.  You are not able to update packages that "
"have had their channel deleted."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຊ່ອງທາງຖືກລຶບ, ແພັກເກດທີ່ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກລຶບນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ຖືກຖອນອອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດອັບເດດແພັກເກດທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງພວກມັນຖືກລຶບໄປແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:129
msgid ""
"You can delete packages that are not associated with a channel in the "
"{productname} {webui}.  Navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Packages], check "
"the packages to remove, and click btn:[Delete Packages]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບແພັກເກດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງໃດໆໃນ {productname} {webui} ໄດ້. ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Manage > Packages], ໝາຍເລືອກແພັກເກດທີ່ຈະຖອນອອກ, ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Delete Packages]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disconnected Setup"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບບໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Disconnected Setup)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When it is not possible to connect {productname} to the internet, you can "
"use it within a disconnected environment."
msgstr "ເມື່ອບໍ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {productname} ກັບອິນເຕີເນັດໄດ້, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ງານມັນພາຍໃຕ້ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແບບບໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The repository mirroring tool (RMT) is available on {sle}{nbsp}15 and "
"later.  RMT replaces the subscription management tool (SMT), which can be "
"used on older {sle} installations."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື Repository Mirroring Tool (RMT) ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ {sle} 15 ແລະ ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ.  RMT ມາແທນທີ່ Subscription Management Tool (SMT) ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle} ເວີຊັນເກົ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In a disconnected {productname} setup, RMT or SMT uses an external network "
"to connect to {scclongform}.  All software channels and repositories are "
"synchronized to a removable storage device.  The storage device can then be "
"used to update the disconnected {productname} installation."
msgstr "ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ແບບບໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, RMT ຫຼື SMT ຈະໃຊ້ເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍນອກເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {scclongform}. ທຸກຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບຈະຖືກປັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກົງກັນໃສ່ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖອດໄດ້. ຈາກນັ້ນອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນນັ້ນສາມາດນຳມາໃຊ້ເພື່ອອັບເດດການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This setup allows your {productname} installation to remain in an offline, "
"disconnected environment."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແບບອອບລາຍ ແລະ ບໍ່ຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Your RMT or SMT instance must be used to manage the {productname} Server "
"directly.  It cannot be used to manage a second RMT or SMT instance, in a "
"cascade."
msgstr "ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) RMT ຫຼື SMT ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການ {productname} Server ໂດຍກົງ. ບໍ່ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ RMT ຫຼື SMT ອັນທີສອງແບບຕໍ່ກັນເປັນທອດໆ (cascade) ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:7
msgid "For more information on RMT, see {sles-base-os-documentation}/book-rmt.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ RMT, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ {sles-base-os-documentation}/book-rmt.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize Channels and Repositories from {scc}"
msgstr "ປັບຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບໃຫ້ກົງກັນຈາກ {scc}"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize RMT"
msgstr "ປັບຂໍ້ມູນ RMT ໃຫ້ກົງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You can use RMT on {sle} 15 installations to manage clients running {sle} 12 "
"or later."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ RMT ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle} 15 ເພື່ອຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ {sle} 12 ຫຼື ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:11
msgid ""
"We recommend you set up a dedicated RMT instance for each {productname} "
"installation."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ RMT ສະເພາະສຳລັບແຕ່ລະການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up RMT"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ RMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:13
msgid "On the RMT instance, install the RMT package:"
msgstr "ໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ RMT, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ RMT:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in rmt-server\n"
msgstr "zypper in rmt-server\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:15
msgid "Configure RMT using {yast}:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ RMT ໂດຍໃຊ້ {yast}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "yast2 rmt\n"
msgstr "yast2 rmt\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:17
msgid "Follow the prompts to complete installation."
msgstr "ເຮັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For more information on setting up RMT, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/book-rmt.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ RMT, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ {sles-base-os-documentation}/book-rmt.html."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing RMT with {scc}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປັບຂໍ້ມູນ RMT ໃຫ້ກົງກັນກັບ {scc}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:20
msgid ""
"On the RMT instance, list all available products and repositories for your "
"organization:"
msgstr "ໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ RMT, ໃຫ້ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບທັງໝົດທີ່ມີສຳລັບອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rmt-cli products list --all\n"
"rmt-cli repos list --all\n"
msgstr ""
"rmt-cli products list --all\n"
"rmt-cli repos list --all\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:22
msgid "Synchronize all available updates for your organization:"
msgstr "ປັບຂໍ້ມູນການອັບເດດທັງໝົດທີ່ມີສຳລັບອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ກົງກັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "rmt-cli sync\n"
msgstr "rmt-cli sync\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:24
msgid "You can also configure RMT to synchronize regularly using systemd."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າ RMT ໃຫ້ປັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກົງກັນຢ່າງສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີໂດຍໃຊ້ systemd."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:25
msgid "Enable the products you require."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:26
msgid "For example, to enable SLES 15:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ SLES 15:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "rmt-cli product enable sles/15/x86_64\n"
msgstr "rmt-cli product enable sles/15/x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:28
msgid "Export the synchronized data to your removable storage."
msgstr "ສົ່ງອອກ (export) ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ປັບແລ້ວໄປຫາອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖອດໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:29
msgid "In this example, the storage medium is mounted at [path]``/mnt/usb``:"
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖືກເມົາທ໌ (mount) ຢູ່ທີ່ [path]``/mnt/usb``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "rmt-cli export data /mnt/usb\n"
msgstr "rmt-cli export data /mnt/usb\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:31
msgid "Export the enabled repositories to your removable storage:"
msgstr "ສົ່ງອອກຄັງເກັບທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວໄປຫາອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖອດໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rmt-cli export settings /mnt/usb\n"
"rmt-cli export repos /mnt/usb\n"
msgstr ""
"rmt-cli export settings /mnt/usb\n"
"rmt-cli export repos /mnt/usb\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Ensure that the external storage is mounted to a directory that is writeable "
"by the RMT user.  You can change RMT user settings in the `cli` section of "
"[path]``/etc/rmt.conf``."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກຖືກເມົາທ໌ໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ RMT ສາມາດຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນລົງໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ RMT ໄດ້ໃນສ່ວນ `cli` ຂອງ [path]``/etc/rmt.conf``."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize SMT"
msgstr "ປັບຂໍ້ມູນ SMT ໃຫ້ກົງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:35
msgid ""
"SMT is included with {sle} 12, and can be used to manage clients running "
"{sle} 10 or later."
msgstr "SMT ມາພ້ອມກັບ {sle} 12, ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ {sle} 10 ຫຼື ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:36
msgid ""
"SMT requires you to create a local mirror directory on the SMT instance to "
"synchronize repositories and packages."
msgstr "SMT ຮຽກຮ້ອງໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງໂຟນເດີມິເຣີພາຍໃນ (local mirror) ໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ SMT ເພື່ອປັບຂໍ້ມູນຄັງເກັບ ແລະ ແພັກເກດໃຫ້ກົງກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:37
msgid ""
"For more details on installing and configuring SMT, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/html/SLES-all/book-smt.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SMT, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/html/SLES-all/book-smt.html."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing SMT with {scc}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປັບຂໍ້ມູນ SMT ໃຫ້ກົງກັນກັບ {scc}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:39
msgid "On the SMT instance, create a database replacement file:"
msgstr "ໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ SMT, ໃຫ້ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຖານຂໍ້ມູນທົດແທນ (database replacement file):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "smt-sync --createdbreplacementfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml\n"
msgstr "smt-sync --createdbreplacementfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Export the synchronized data to your removable storage.  In this example, "
"the storage medium is mounted at [path]``/mnt/usb``:"
msgstr "ສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ປັບແລ້ວໄປຫາອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖອດໄດ້. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖືກເມົາທ໌ຢູ່ທີ່ [path]``/mnt/usb``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"smt-sync --todir /mnt/usb\n"
"smt-mirror --dbreplfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml --directory /mnt/usb \\\n"
"           --fromlocalsmt -L /var/log/smt/smt-mirror-export.log\n"
"curl https://scc.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/product_tree.json -o "
"/mnt/usb/product_tree.json\n"
msgstr ""
"smt-sync --todir /mnt/usb\n"
"smt-mirror --dbreplfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml --directory /mnt/usb \\\n"
"           --fromlocalsmt -L /var/log/smt/smt-mirror-export.log\n"
"curl https://scc.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/product_tree.json -o /mnt/usb/product_tree.json\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:43
msgid ""
"Ensure that the external storage is mounted to a directory that is writeable "
"by the RMT user.  You can change SMT user settings in "
"[path]``/etc/smt.conf``."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກຖືກເມົາທ໌ໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ RMT ສາມາດຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນລົງໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ SMT ໄດ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/smt.conf``."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mandatory Channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຈຳເປັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:45
msgid ""
"The corresponding {productname} Client Tools Channels are required, for "
"{productname} to be able to synchronize a given channel.  If these channels "
"are not enabled, {productname} may fail to detect that product."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ {productname} Client Tools ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງແມ່ນມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ສາມາດປັບຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກົງກັນໄດ້. ຫາກຊ່ອງທາງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, {productname} ອາດຈະກວດບໍ່ພົບຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:46
msgid "Run the following command to enable these mandatory channels:"
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຈຳເປັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "SLES 12 and products based on it such as SLES for SAP or SLE HPC"
msgstr "SLES 12 ແລະ ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ອີງໃສ່ SLES 12 ເຊັ່ນ SLES for SAP ຫຼື SLE HPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:48
msgid "RMT: [command]``rmt-cli products enable sle-manager-tools/12/x86_64``"
msgstr "RMT: [command]``rmt-cli products enable sle-manager-tools/12/x86_64``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:49
msgid "SMT: [command]``smt repos -p sle-manager-tools,12,x86_64``"
msgstr "SMT: [command]``smt repos -p sle-manager-tools,12,x86_64``"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "SLES 15 and products based on it such as SLES for SAP or SLE HPC"
msgstr "SLES 15 ແລະ ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ອີງໃສ່ SLES 15 ເຊັ່ນ SLES for SAP ຫຼື SLE HPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:51
msgid "RMT: [command]``rmt-cli products enable sle-manager-tools/15/x86_64``"
msgstr "RMT: [command]``rmt-cli products enable sle-manager-tools/15/x86_64``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:52
msgid "SMT: [command]``smt repos -p sle-manager-tools,15,x86_64``"
msgstr "SMT: [command]``smt repos -p sle-manager-tools,15,x86_64``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:53
msgid "Then mirror the channels, and export."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ເຮັດມິເຣີຊ່ອງທາງ, ແລະ ສົ່ງອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Other distributions, or architectures, can be enabled.  For more information "
"about enabling product channels or repositories to be mirrored, see the "
"documentation:"
msgstr "ການແຈກຢາຍ (distributions) ຫຼື ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳອື່ນໆ ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການເປີດໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຜະລິດຕະພັນ ຫຼື ຄັງເກັບທີ່ຈະເຮັດມິເຣີ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ເອກະສານ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "RMT"
msgstr "RMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:56
msgid "{sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-rmt-mirroring.html#sec-rmt-mirroring-enable-disable"
msgstr "{sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-rmt-mirroring.html#sec-rmt-mirroring-enable-disable"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "SMT"
msgstr "SMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:58
msgid "https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/single-html/SLES-smt/index.html#smt-mirroring-manage-domirror"
msgstr "https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/single-html/SLES-smt/index.html#smt-mirroring-manage-domirror"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disconnected Server"
msgstr "ເຊີບເວີແບບບໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Disconnected Server)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:60
msgid ""
"To set up {productname} as a disconnected server follow the instructions of "
"an air-gapped deployment."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ເປັນເຊີບເວີແບບບໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບ air-gapped (ຕັດຂາດຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍນອກ)."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ (Deploy)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:62
msgid ""
"It is recommended to deploy a disconnected server as a Virtual Machine (VM) "
"using a provided image.  For an air-gapped deployment of {productname} "
"Server, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc[]."
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ເຊີບເວີແບບຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃນຮູບແບບຂອງ Virtual Machine (VM) ໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບພາບ (image) ທີ່ໄດ້ຈັດຫາໃຫ້. ສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ເຊີບເວີ {productname} ແບບແຍກອອກຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Keep in mind to execute the final command with the [option]``--mirror`` "
"option and replace [literal]``</media/disk>`` with your mount point:"
msgstr "ຢ່າລືມປະຕິບັດຄຳສັ່ງສຸດທ້າຍດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ [option]``--mirror`` ແລະ ແທນທີ່ [literal]``</media/disk>`` ດ້ວຍຈຸດເມົາທ໌ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm install podman --mirror </media/disk>\n"
msgstr "mgradm install podman --mirror </media/disk>\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize"
msgstr "ປັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກົງກັນ (Synchronize)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:66
msgid ""
"When you have removable media loaded with your {scclongform} data, you can "
"use it to synchronize your disconnected server."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານມີອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖອດໄດ້ທີ່ໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນ {scclongform} ໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອປັບຂໍ້ມູນເຊີບເວີແບບບໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ກົງກັນໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:67
msgid ""
"The removable media that you use for synchronization must always be "
"available at the same mount point.  Do not trigger a synchronization if the "
"storage medium is not mounted.  This results in data corruption."
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖອດໄດ້ທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ໃນການປັບຂໍ້ມູນຕ້ອງຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດເມົາທ໌ເດີມສະເໝີ. ຢ່າເລີ່ມການປັບຂໍ້ມູນຫາກອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເມົາທ໌ ເພາະຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເສຍຫາຍໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing a Disconnected Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປັບຂໍ້ມູນເຊີບເວີແບບບໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃຫ້ກົງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:69
msgid "Restart the Tomcat service:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມລະບົບການບໍລິການ Tomcat ໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- systemctl restart tomcat\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- systemctl restart tomcat\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:71
msgid "Refresh the local data:"
msgstr "ຣີເຟຣຊ (refresh) ຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync refresh\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync refresh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:73
msgid "Perform a synchronization:"
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການປັບຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກົງກັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync list channels\n"
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync add channel channel-label\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync list channels\n"
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync add channel channel-label\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:75
msgid ""
"Be aware that if [literal]``server.susemanager.fromdir`` is set, "
"{productname} will not be able to check if {scclongform} credentials are "
"valid or not.  Instead, a warning sign will be displayed and no {scc} online "
"check will be performed."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ລະວັງວ່າຫາກ [literal]``server.susemanager.fromdir`` ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, {productname} ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ (credentials) ຂອງ {scclongform} ຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່. ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນແນວນັ້ນ, ມັນຈະສະແດງເຄື່ອງໝາຍເຕືອນ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ມີການກວດສອບອອນລາຍຂອງ {scc}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:76
msgid ""
"An alternative to disconnected setup may be to copy content between servers "
"using Inter-Server Synchronization (ISS).  For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc[Inter-Server "
"Synchronization - Version 2]."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກອື່ນນອກຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ອາດຈະແມ່ນການສຳເນົາເນື້ອຫາລະຫວ່າງເຊີບເວີໂດຍໃຊ້ການຊິງໂຄໄນລະຫວ່າງເຊີບເວີ (Inter-Server Synchronization ຫຼື ISS). ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc[Inter-Server Synchronization - Version 2]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image Building and Management"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ ແລະ ການຈັດການອິເມຈ໌ (Image Building and Management)"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image building overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂອງການສ້າງອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} enables system administrators to build containers and OS "
"Images and push the results to an image store."
msgstr "{productname} ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບສາມາດສ້າງຄອນເທນເນີ ແລະ OS Images ແລະ ສົ່ງ (push) ຜົນທີ່ໄດ້ໄປຫາບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌ (image store) ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Building and pushing images"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ ແລະ ການສົ່ງ (push) ອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:5
msgid "Define an image store."
msgstr "ກຳນົດບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌ (image store)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Define an image profile and associate it with a source (either a git "
"repository or a directory)."
msgstr "ກຳນົດໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌ (image profile) ແລະ ເຊື່ອມໂຍງມັນກັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນຄັງເກັບ git ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີ)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:7
msgid "Build the image."
msgstr "ສ້າງ (build) ອິເມຈ໌."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:8
msgid "Push the image to the image store."
msgstr "ສົ່ງ (push) ອິເມຈ໌ໄປຫາບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:9
msgid ""
"{productname} supports these two build types: Dockerfile and the Kiwi build "
"type.  The Kiwi build type is used to build system, virtual, and other "
"images."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບການສ້າງສອງປະເພດນີ້: Dockerfile ແລະ Kiwi build type. Kiwi build type ແມ່ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບສ້າງອິເມຈ໌ຂອງລະບົບ, ວຽກຊົວ (virtual) ແລະ ອິເມຈ໌ອື່ນໆ."

#.  Needs checking
#.  at later places to be fix accordingly
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The image store for the Kiwi build type is pre-defined as a file system "
"directory in the [path]``srv-www`` volume."
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌ສຳລັບ Kiwi build type ແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າເປັນໂຟນເດີລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໃນວໍລຸມ (volume) [path]``srv-www``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:11
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:209
msgid ""
"The image files can be downloaded from "
"[path]``https://MANAGER-HOST/os-images/ORGANIZATION-ID/FILE-NAME``.  The "
"exact location can be determined from the image details page."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌ສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ຈາກ [path]``https://MANAGER-HOST/os-images/ORGANIZATION-ID/FILE-NAME``. ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ແນ່ນອນສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ຈາກໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດຂອງອິເມຈ໌."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:12
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:210
msgid ""
"The image files can be downloaded from "
"[path]``https://UYUNI-HOST/os-images/ORGANIZATION-ID/FILE-NAME``.  The exact "
"location can be determined from the image details page."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌ສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ຈາກ [path]``https://UYUNI-HOST/os-images/ORGANIZATION-ID/FILE-NAME``. ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ແນ່ນອນສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ຈາກໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດຂອງອິເມຈ໌."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Container images"
msgstr "ອິເມຈ໌ຄອນເທນເນີ (Container images)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The containers feature is available for {salt} clients running {sles} 12 or "
"later.  Before you begin, ensure your environment meets these requirements:"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດຄອນເທນເນີແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ທີ່ໃຊ້ {sles} 12 ຫຼື ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ. ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານກົງຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:16
msgid ""
"A published git repository containing a Dockerfile and configuration "
"scripts.  The repository can be public or private, and should be hosted on "
"GitHub, GitLab, or BitBucket."
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບ git ທີ່ຖືກເຜີຍແຜ່ ເຊິ່ງມີ Dockerfile ແລະ ສະຄຣິບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ຄັງເກັບສາມາດເປັນແບບສາທາລະນະ ຫຼື ສ່ວນຕົວ ແລະ ຄວນຈະຢູ່ເທິງ GitHub, GitLab ຫຼື BitBucket."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:17
msgid "A properly configured image store, such as a Docker registry."
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌ທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ ເຊິ່ງເປັນ Docker registry."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For more information on containers, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/container/all/html/Container-guide/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄອນເທນເນີ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/container/all/html/Container-guide/."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:19
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:167
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a build host"
msgstr "ສ້າງໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌ (build host)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:20
msgid ""
"To build images with {productname}, you need to create and configure a build "
"host.  Container build hosts are {salt} clients running {sle} 12 or later.  "
"This section guides you through the initial configuration for a build host."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງອິເມຈ໌ດ້ວຍ {productname}, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌ (build host). ໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌ຄອນເທນເນີແມ່ນລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ທີ່ໃຊ້ {sle} 12 ຫຼື ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຈະແນະນຳທ່ານກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເບື້ອງຕົ້ນສຳລັບໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:21
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:170
msgid ""
"The operating system on the build host must match the operating system on "
"the targeted image."
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການໃນໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌ ຕ້ອງກົງກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການໃນອິເມຈ໌ເປົ້າໝາຍ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:22
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:171
msgid ""
"For example, build {sles}{nbsp}15 based images on a build host running "
"{sles}{nbsp}15 (SP2 or later) OS version.  Build {sles}{nbsp}12 based images "
"on a build host running {sles}{nbsp}12 SP5 or {sles}{nbsp}12 SP4 OS version."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃຫ້ສ້າງອິເມຈ໌ທີ່ອີງໃສ່ {sles} 15 ໃນໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ {sles} 15 (SP2 ຫຼື ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ). ແລະ ສ້າງອິເມຈ໌ທີ່ອີງໃສ່ {sles} 12 ໃນໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ {sles} 12 SP5 ຫຼື {sles} 12 SP4."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:23
msgid "Cross-architecture builds are not supported."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການສ້າງແບບຂ້າມສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ (Cross-architecture builds)."

#. 2022-05-12, ke: at least for now, according to feedback, this is unsupported:
#. For example, you must build Raspberry Pi {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3 images on a Raspberry Pi (aarch64 architecture) build host running {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3.
#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:24
msgid ""
"From the {productname} {webui}, perform these steps to configure a build "
"host:"
msgstr "ຈາກ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Building a host"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການບິວດ໌ໂຮສ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Select a {salt} client to be designated as a build host from the "
"menu:Systems[Systems] overview page."
msgstr "ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ທີ່ຈະກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌ ຈາກໜ້າພາບລວມ ເມນູ: Systems[Systems]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:27
msgid ""
"From the [guimenu]``System Details`` page of the selected client assign the "
"containers modules.  Navigate to menu:Software[Software Channels] and enable "
"the containers module (for example, "
"[guimenu]``SLE-Module-Containers15-Pool`` and "
"[guimenu]``SLE-Module-Containers15-Updates``).  Continue with btn:[Next]."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ [guimenu]``System Details`` ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເລືອກ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດໂມດູນຄອນເທນເນີ. ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Software[Software Channels] ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນຄອນເທນເນີ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [guimenu]``SLE-Module-Containers15-Pool`` ແລະ [guimenu]``SLE-Module-Containers15-Updates``). ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Next]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:28
msgid "Schedule the [guimenu]`` Software Channel Change``, and click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງກຳນົດເວລາການປ່ຽນແປງຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ [guimenu]`` Software Channel Change``, ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:29
msgid ""
"From the [guimenu]``System Details`` tab select menu:Properties[] page, and "
"enable ``Container Build Host`` from the [guimenu]``Add-on System Types`` "
"list.  Confirm by clicking btn:[Update Properties]."
msgstr "ຈາກແທັບ [guimenu]``System Details`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກໜ້າ ເມນູ: Properties[], ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ``Container Build Host`` ຈາກລາຍການ [guimenu]``Add-on System Types``. ຢືນຢັນໂດຍຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Update Properties]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Install all required packages by applying [systemitem]``Highstate``.  From "
"the system details tab select menu:States[Highstate], and click btn:[Apply "
"Highstate].  Alternatively, apply [systemitem]``Highstate`` from the "
"{productname} Server command line:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດໂດຍໃຊ້ [systemitem]``Highstate``. ຈາກແທັບລາຍລະອຽດລະບົບ ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ເມນູ: States[Highstate], ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Apply Highstate]. ຫຼື ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [systemitem]``Highstate`` ຈາກ command line ຂອງ {productname} Server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:31
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:182
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '$your_client' state.highstate\n"
msgstr "salt '$your_client' state.highstate\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an activation key for containers"
msgstr "ສ້າງຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (activation key) ສຳລັບຄອນເທນເນີ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The containers built with {productname} use channels associated to the "
"activation key as repositories when building the image.  This section guides "
"you through creating an ad-hoc activation key for this purpose."
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີທີ່ສ້າງດ້ວຍ {productname} ຈະໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານເປັນຄັງເກັບໃນເວລາສ້າງອິເມຈ໌. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຈະແນະນຳທ່ານກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານສະເພາະກິດສຳລັບຈຸດປະສົງນີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:34
msgid ""
"To build a container, you need an activation key that is associated with a "
"channel other than `SUSE Manager Default`."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງຄອນເທນເນີ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ `SUSE Manager Default`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:35
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:200
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an activation key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:36
msgid "Select menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ ເມນູ: Systems[Activation Keys]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:37
msgid "Click btn:[Create Key]."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Key]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Enter a [guimenu]``Description`` and a [guimenu]``Key`` name.  Use the "
"drop-down menu to select the [guimenu]``Base Channel`` to associate with "
"this key."
msgstr "ປ້ອນ [guimenu]``Description`` (ຄຳອະທິບາຍ) ແລະ ຊື່ [guimenu]``Key``. ໃຊ້ລາຍການເລືອກເພື່ອເລືອກ [guimenu]``Base Channel`` ທີ່ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຄີນີ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:39
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:204
msgid "Confirm with btn:[Create Activation Key]."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນໂດຍຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Activation Key]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:40
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:205
msgid "For more information, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:41
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:206
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an image store"
msgstr "ສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌ (image store)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:42
msgid ""
"All built images are pushed to an image store.  This section contains "
"information about creating an image store.  Image store is generally "
"referenced as a registry."
msgstr "ທຸກອິເມຈ໌ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະຖືກສົ່ງ (push) ໄປຫາບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ ບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ ເຣຈິສທຣີ (registry)."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating image store"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:44
msgid "Select menu:Images[Stores]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ ເມນູ: Images[Stores]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:45
msgid "Click [guimenu]``Create`` to create a new store."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ [guimenu]``Create`` ເພື່ອສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:46
msgid "From the [guimenu]``Store Type`` select the correct type."
msgstr "ຈາກ [guimenu]``Store Type`` ໃຫ້ເລືອກປະເພດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:47
msgid "Define a name for the image store in the [guimenu]``Label`` field."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຊື່ສຳລັບບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Label``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Provide the path to your image registry by filling in the [guimenu]``URI`` "
"field, as a fully qualified domain name (FQDN) for the container registry "
"host (whether internal or external)."
msgstr "ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ image registry ຂອງທ່ານໂດຍຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``URI`` ເປັນຊື່ໂດເມນເຕັມ (FQDN) ສຳລັບໂຮສຂອງ container registry (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນພາຍໃນ ຫຼື ພາຍນອກ)."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "registry.example.com\n"
msgstr "registry.example.com\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:50
msgid ""
"The Registry URI can also be used to specify an image store on a registry "
"that is already in use."
msgstr "Registry URI ຍັງສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌ໃນເຣຈິສທຣີທີ່ມີການໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "registry.example.com:5000/myregistry/myproject\n"
msgstr "registry.example.com:5000/myregistry/myproject\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:52
msgid "Click btn:[Create] to add the new image store."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌ໃໝ່."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:53
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:211
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an image profile"
msgstr "ສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌ (image profile)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:54
msgid ""
"All container images are built using an image profile, which contains the "
"building instructions.  This section contains information about creating an "
"image profile with the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ທຸກອິເມຈ໌ຄອນເທນເນີຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌ ເຊິ່ງມີຄຳແນະນຳໃນການສ້າງ. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌ດ້ວຍ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:55
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:213
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an image profile"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:56
msgid ""
"To create an image profile select menu:Images[Profiles] and click "
"btn:[Create]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌ ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ເມນູ: Images[Profiles] ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Provide a name for the image profile by filling in the [guimenu]``Label`` "
"field."
msgstr "ລະບຸຊື່ສຳລັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌ໂດຍຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Label``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:58
msgid ""
"If your container image tag is in a format such as `myproject/myimage`, make "
"sure your image store registry URI contains the `/myproject` suffix."
msgstr "ຫາກແທັກອິເມຈ໌ຄອນເທນເນີຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບເຊັ່ນ `myproject/myimage`, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າ registry URI ຂອງບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌ນັ້ນມີຄຳລົງທ້າຍວ່າ `/myproject`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:59
msgid "Use `Dockerfile` as the [guimenu]``Image Type``."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ `Dockerfile` ເປັນ [guimenu]``Image Type``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Use the drop-down menu to select your registry from the [guimenu]``Target "
"Image Store`` field."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ລາຍການເລືອກເພື່ອເລືອກເຣຈິສທຣີຂອງທ່ານຈາກຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Target Image Store``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:61
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Path`` field, type a GitHub, GitLab, or BitBucket "
"repository URL.  The path can also be a local directory on the build host.  "
"The URL should be [literal]``http``, [literal]``https``, or a token "
"authentication URL.  For GitHub or GitLab, use one of these formats:"
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Path``, ໃຫ້ພິມ URL ຂອງຄັງເກັບ GitHub, GitLab ຫຼື BitBucket. ເສັ້ນທາງນັ້ນຍັງສາມາດເປັນໂຟນເດີພາຍໃນໃນໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌ໄດ້. URL ຄວນເປັນ [literal]``http``, [literal]``https`` ຫຼື URL ທີ່ໃຊ້ token ໃນການກວດສອບສິດ. ສຳລັບ GitHub ຫຼື GitLab, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໜຶ່ງໃນຮູບແບບເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "GitHub Path Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເສັ້ນທາງ GitHub"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:63
msgid "GitHub single user project repository"
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບໂຄງການຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄົນດຽວໃນ GitHub"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/USER/project.git#branchname:folder\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/USER/project.git#branchname:folder\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:65
msgid "GitHub organization project repository"
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບໂຄງການຂອງອົງກອນໃນ GitHub"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/ORG/project.git#branchname:folder\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/ORG/project.git#branchname:folder\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:67
msgid "GitHub token authentication"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບສິດດ້ວຍ token ຂອງ GitHub"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:68
msgid ""
"If your git repository is private, modify the profile's URL to include "
"authentication.  Use this URL format to authenticate with a GitHub token:"
msgstr "ຫາກຄັງເກັບ git ຂອງທ່ານເປັນແບບສ່ວນຕົວ, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂ URL ຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອລວມເອົາການກວດສອບສິດ. ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ URL ນີ້ເພື່ອຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ token ຂອງ GitHub:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://USER:<AUTHENTICATION_TOKEN>@github.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"
msgstr "https://USER:<AUTHENTICATION_TOKEN>@github.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "GitLab Path Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເສັ້ນທາງ GitLab"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:71
msgid "GitLab single user project repository"
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບໂຄງການຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄົນດຽວໃນ GitLab"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://gitlab.example.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"
msgstr "https://gitlab.example.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:73
msgid "GitLab groups project repository"
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບໂຄງການຂອງກຸ່ມໃນ GitLab"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://gitlab.example.com/GROUP/project.git#master:/container/\n"
msgstr "https://gitlab.example.com/GROUP/project.git#master:/container/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:75
msgid "GitLab token authentication"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບສິດດ້ວຍ token ຂອງ GitLab"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:76
msgid ""
"If your git repository is private and not publicly accessible, you need to "
"modify the profile's git URL to include authentication.  Use this URL format "
"to authenticate with a GitLab token:"
msgstr "ຫາກຄັງເກັບ git ຂອງທ່ານເປັນແບບສ່ວນຕົວ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ແບບສາທາລະນະ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂ git URL ຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອລວມເອົາການກວດສອບສິດ. ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ URL ນີ້ເພື່ອຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ token ຂອງ GitLab:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://gitlab-ci-token:<AUTHENTICATION_TOKEN>@gitlab.example.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"
msgstr "https://gitlab-ci-token:<AUTHENTICATION_TOKEN>@gitlab.example.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:78
msgid ""
"If you do not specify a git branch, the `master` branch is used by default.  "
"If a `folder` is not specified, the image sources (Dockerfile sources) are "
"expected to be in the root directory of the GitHub or GitLab checkout."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ລະບຸ git branch, ລະບົບຈະໃຊ້ branch `master` ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຫາກບໍ່ມີການລະບຸ `folder`, ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນອິເມຈ໌ (Dockerfile sources) ຈະຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີຮາກ (root directory) ຂອງ GitHub ຫຼື GitLab."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:79
msgid ""
"Select an `Activation Key`.  Activation keys ensure that images using a "
"profile are assigned to the correct channel and packages."
msgstr "ເລືອກ `Activation Key`. ຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າອິເມຈ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:80
msgid ""
"When you associate an activation key with an image profile you are ensuring "
"any image using the profile uses the correct software channel and any "
"packages in the channel."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເຊື່ອມໂຍງຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌, ທ່ານກຳລັງເຮັດໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທຸກອິເມຈ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນຈະໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ແພັກເກດໃດໆທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:81
msgid "Click the btn:[Create] button."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Dockerfile sources"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ Dockerfile"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:83
msgid ""
"An Image Profile that can be reused is published at "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles."
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌ທີ່ສາມາດນຳມາໃຊ້ໃໝ່ໄດ້ຖືກເຜີຍແຜ່ຢູ່ທີ່ https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:84
msgid ""
"The [option]``ARG`` parameters ensure that the built image is associated "
"with the desired repository served by {productname}.  The [option]``ARG`` "
"parameters also allow you to build image versions of {sles} which may differ "
"from the version of {sles} used by the build host itself."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີ [option]``ARG`` ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າອິເມຈ໌ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນນັ້ນເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຄັງເກັບທີ່ຕ້ອງການເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ບໍລິການໂດຍ {productname}. ພາຣາມິເຕີ [option]``ARG`` ຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງອິເມຈ໌ເວີຊັນຂອງ {sles} ທີ່ອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກເວີຊັນຂອງ {sles} ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌ເອງໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:85
msgid ""
"For example: The [command]``ARG repo`` parameter and the [command]``echo`` "
"command pointing to the repository file, creates and then injects the "
"correct path into the repository file for the desired channel version."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ພາຣາມິເຕີ [command]``ARG repo`` ແລະ ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``echo`` ທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ຄັງເກັບ ຈະສ້າງ ແລະ ແຊກເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ຄັງເກັບສຳລັບເວີຊັນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:86
msgid ""
"The repository is determined by the activation key that you assigned to your "
"image profile."
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບຈະຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:87
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"FROM registry.example.com/sles12sp2\n"
"MAINTAINER Tux Administrator \"tux@example.com\"\n"
msgstr ""
"FROM registry.example.com/sles12sp2\n"
"MAINTAINER Tux Administrator \"tux@example.com\"\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "### Begin: These lines are required for use with {productname}\n"
msgstr "### Begin: These lines are required for use with {productname}\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ARG repo\n"
"ARG cert\n"
msgstr ""
"ARG repo\n"
"ARG cert\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Add the correct certificate\n"
"RUN echo \"$cert\" > /etc/pki/trust/anchors/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT.pem\n"
msgstr ""
"# Add the correct certificate\n"
"RUN echo \"$cert\" > /etc/pki/trust/anchors/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT.pem\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:91
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Update certificate trust store\n"
"RUN update-ca-certificates\n"
msgstr ""
"# Update certificate trust store\n"
"RUN update-ca-certificates\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Add the repository path to the image\n"
"RUN echo \"$repo\" > /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager:dockerbuild.repo\n"
msgstr ""
"# Add the repository path to the image\n"
"RUN echo \"$repo\" > /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager:dockerbuild.repo\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "### End: These lines are required for use with {productname}\n"
msgstr "### End: These lines are required for use with {productname}\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Add the package script\n"
"ADD add_packages.sh /root/add_packages.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"# Add the package script\n"
"ADD add_packages.sh /root/add_packages.sh\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:95
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Run the package script\n"
"RUN /root/add_packages.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"# Run the package script\n"
"RUN /root/add_packages.sh\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:96
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# After building remove the repository path from image\n"
"RUN rm -f /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager:dockerbuild.repo\n"
msgstr ""
"# After building remove the repository path from image\n"
"RUN rm -f /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager:dockerbuild.repo\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using custom info key-value pairs as Docker `buildargs`"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຄູ່ຄີ-ຄ່າ (key-value) ຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງເປັນ `buildargs` ຂອງ Docker"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:98
msgid ""
"You can assign custom info key-value pairs to attach information to the "
"image profiles.  Additionally, these key-value pairs are passed to the "
"Docker build command as `buildargs`."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຄູ່ຄີ-ຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອແນບຂໍ້ມູນໃສ່ກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈ໌. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຄູ່ຄີ-ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາຄຳສັ່ງ build ຂອງ Docker ໃນຮູບແບບ `buildargs`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:99
msgid ""
"For more information about the available custom info keys and creating "
"additional ones, see xref:reference:systems/custom-system-info.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄີຂໍ້ມູນກຳນົດເອງທີ່ມີໃຫ້ ແລະ ການສ້າງຄີເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:reference:systems/custom-system-info.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:100
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:247
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build an image"
msgstr "ສ້າງອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:101
msgid ""
"There are two ways to build an image.  The first way is to create it from "
"scratch.  To do that, select menu:Images[Build] from the left navigation "
"bar, or click the build icon in the menu:Images[Profiles] list and follow "
"the procedure."
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີໃນການສ້າງຮູບພາບ. ວິທີທຳອິດແມ່ນການສ້າງມັນຂຶ້ນມາໃໝ່ທັງໝົດ. ເພື່ອເຮັດແນວນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ menu:Images[Build] ຈາກແຖບນຳທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ, ຫຼື ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນ build ໃນລາຍການ menu:Images[Profiles] ແລະ ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:102
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:249
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Building an image"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:103
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:250
msgid "Select menu:Images[Build]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ ເມນູ: Images[Build]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:104
msgid ""
"Add a different tag name if you want a version other than the default "
"``latest`` (only relevant to containers)."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຊື່ແທັກ (tag name) ອື່ນ ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການເວີຊັນອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ ``latest`` ເຊິ່ງເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງສະເພາະກັບຄອນເທນເນີເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:105
msgid "Select [guimenu]``Build Profile`` and [guimenu]``Build Host``."
msgstr "ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Build Profile`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Build Host``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:106
msgid ""
"Notice the [guimenu]``Profile Summary`` to the right of the build fields.  "
"When you have selected a build profile, detailed information about the "
"selected profile is displayed in this area."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ສັງເກດ [guimenu]``Profile Summary`` ທາງເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນການສ້າງ. ເມື່ອທ່ານເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການສ້າງແລ້ວ, ຂໍ້ມູນລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເລືອກຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນບໍລິເວນນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:107
msgid "To schedule a build click the btn:[Build] button."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງກຳນົດເວລາການສ້າງ ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Build]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import an image"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:109
msgid ""
"The second way to get an image is to import and inspect arbitrary images.  "
"To do that, select menu:Images[Image List] from the left navigation bar.  "
"Complete the text boxes of the [guimenu]``Import`` dialog.  When it has "
"processed, the imported image is listed on the [guimenu]``Image List`` page."
msgstr "ວິທີທີສອງໃນການໄດ້ຮູບພາບມາແມ່ນການນຳເຂົ້າ ແລະ ກວດສອບຮູບພາບໃດໜຶ່ງ. ເພື່ອເຮັດແນວນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ menu:Images[Image List] ຈາກແຖບນຳທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ. ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃສ່ໃນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ [guimenu]``Import``. ເມື່ອປະມວນຜົນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ຮູບພາບທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Image List``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:110
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Importing an image"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳເຂົ້າອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:111
msgid ""
"From menu:Images[Image list] click btn:[Import] to open the "
"[guimenu]``Import Image`` dialog."
msgstr "ຈາກ ເມນູ: Images[Image list] ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Import] ເພື່ອເປີດກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ [guimenu]``Import Image``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:112
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Import Image`` dialog complete these fields:"
msgstr "ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ [guimenu]``Import Image`` ໃຫ້ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:113
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image store"
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:114
msgid "The registry from where the image is pulled for inspection."
msgstr "ເຣຈິສທຣີທີ່ຈະດຶງ (pull) ອິເມຈ໌ມາເພື່ອການກວດສອບ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:115
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image name"
msgstr "ຊື່ອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:116
msgid "The name of the image in the registry."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງອິເມຈ໌ໃນເຣຈິສທຣີ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:117
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image version"
msgstr "ເວີຊັນອິເມຈ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:118
msgid "The version of the image in the registry."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນຂອງອິເມຈ໌ໃນເຣຈິສທຣີ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:119
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build host"
msgstr "ໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:120
msgid "The build host that pulls and inspects the image."
msgstr "ໂຮສສຳລັບບິວດ໌ທີ່ຈະດຶງ ແລະ ກວດສອບອິເມຈ໌."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:121
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activation key"
msgstr "ຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:122
msgid ""
"The activation key that provides the path to the software channel that the "
"image is inspected with."
msgstr "ຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານທີ່ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການກວດສອບອິເມຈ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:123
msgid "For confirmation, click btn:[Import]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ btn:[Import]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:124
msgid ""
"The entry for the image is created in the database, and an ``Inspect Image`` "
"action on {productname} is scheduled."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນຂອງອິເມຈ໌ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ແລະ ການດຳເນີນການ ``Inspect Image`` (ກວດສອບອິເມຈ໌) ໃນ {productname} ຈະຖືກກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:125
msgid ""
"When it has been processed, you can find the imported image in the ``Image "
"List``.  It has a different icon in the ``Build`` column, to indicate that "
"the image is imported.  The status icon for the imported image can also be "
"seen on the ``Overview`` tab for the image."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມັນຖືກປະມວນຜົນແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຊອກຫາຮູບພາບທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າໄດ້ໃນ ``ລາຍຊື່ຮູບພາບ``. ມັນມີໄອຄອນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນຖັນ ``ບິວດ໌ (Build)``, ເພື່ອສະແດງວ່າຮູບພາບນັ້ນຖືກນຳເຂົ້າ. ໄອຄອນສະຖານະສຳລັບຮູບພາບທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າຍັງສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ໃນແຖບ ``ພາບລວມ (Overview)`` ສຳລັບຮູບພາບນັ້ນ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:126
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:262
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ"

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:127
#, no-wrap
msgid "General issues"
msgstr "ບັນຫາທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:128
msgid "These are some known problems when working with images:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນບາງບັນຫາທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍໃນເວລານຳໃຊ້ຮູບພາບ:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:129
msgid ""
"HTTPS certificates to access the registry or the git repositories should be "
"deployed to the client by a custom state file."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ HTTPS ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງເຣຈິດສະຕຣີ (registry) ຫຼື ຄັງເກັບ git ຄວນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບໄຄລເອັນໂດຍໄຟລ໌ສະຖານະ (state file) ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:130
msgid "SSH git access using Docker is currently unsupported."
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ SSH git ໂດຍໃຊ້ Docker ແມ່ນຍັງບໍ່ທັນຮອງຮັບໃນເວລານີ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:131
#, no-wrap
msgid "OS images"
msgstr "ຮູບພາບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ (OS images)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:132
msgid ""
"OS Images are built by the Kiwi build system.  The output image is "
"customizable and can be PXE, QCOW2, LiveCD, or other types of images."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບ OS ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍລະບົບການບິວດ໌ Kiwi. ຮູບພາບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກແມ່ນສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ ແລະ ສາມາດເປັນ PXE, QCOW2, LiveCD, ຫຼື ຮູບພາບປະເພດອື່ນໆ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:133
msgid ""
"For more information about the Kiwi build system, see the "
"https://osinside.github.io/kiwi/[Kiwi documentation]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບລະບົບການບິວດ໌ Kiwi, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://osinside.github.io/kiwi/[ເອກະສານຂອງ Kiwi]."

#. SLE15 images support is not yet released for MLM4, but is part of MLM4.0.4 as tech preview
#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:135
msgid ""
"The Kiwi image building feature is available for {salt} clients running "
"{sles}{nbsp}12 and {sles}{nbsp}11."
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດການສ້າງຮູບພາບ Kiwi ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບໄຄລເອັນ {salt} ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກເທິງ {sles}{nbsp}12 ແລະ {sles}{nbsp}11."

#. From {sles}{nbsp}15, ``kiwi-ng`` is used instead of the legacy Kiwi.
#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:136
msgid ""
"Kiwi image configuration files and configuration scripts must be accessible "
"in one of these locations:"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າຮູບພາບ Kiwi ແລະ ສະຄຣິບກຳນົດຄ່າຕ້ອງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໃນໜຶ່ງໃນສະຖານທີ່ເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:137
msgid "Git repository"
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບ Git"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:138
msgid "HTTP or HTTPS hosted tar archive"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຈັດເກັບ tar ທີ່ໂຮສດ້ວຍ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:139
msgid "Local directory on the build host"
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ໃຊ້ບິວດ໌"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:140
msgid ""
"For an example of a complete Kiwi repository served by git, see "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/OSImage."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຄັງເກັບ Kiwi ທີ່ສົມບູນເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ບໍລິການໂດຍ git, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/OSImage."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:141
msgid ""
"You need at least 1{nbsp}GB of RAM available for hosts running OS Images "
"built with Kiwi.  Disk space depends on the actual size of the image.  For "
"more information, see the documentation of the underlying system."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງມີ RAM ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 1{nbsp}GB ສຳລັບໂຮສທີ່ໃຊ້ຮູບພາບ OS ທີ່ບິວດ໌ດ້ວຍ Kiwi. ພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໃນດິສກ໌ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຂະໜາດຕົວຈິງຂອງຮູບພາບ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງລະບົບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:142
#, no-wrap
msgid "Accessing Git repositories via an HTTP/HTTPS proxy when building images"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຄັງເກັບ Git ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ HTTP/HTTPS ໃນເວລາບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:143
msgid ""
"When a build host needs to fetch sources from a git repository that is only "
"reachable through an HTTP/HTTPS proxy, you may see git timeouts during the "
"build because the git client invoked by the Salt state does not always pick "
"up system-wide proxy settings (for example [path]``/etc/sysconfig/proxy`` or "
"environment variables)."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ build host ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງດຶງແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຈາກຄັງເກັບ git ທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານ HTTP/HTTPS proxy ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະເຫັນການໝົດເວລາ (timeout) ຂອງ git ໃນລະຫວ່າງການ build ເພາະວ່າ git client ທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍ Salt state ບໍ່ໄດ້ດຶງເອົາການກຳນົດຄ່າ proxy ຂອງລະບົບມາໃຊ້ສະເໝີໄປ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [path]``/etc/sysconfig/proxy`` ຫຼື ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:144
msgid ""
"To make git use the proxy for non-interactive builds create "
"[path]``/etc/gitconfig`` with an http.proxy entry:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ git ໃຊ້ພຣັອກຊີສຳລັບການບິວດ໌ແບບບໍ່ໂຕ້ຕອບ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ [path]``/etc/gitconfig`` ດ້ວຍລາຍການ http.proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:145
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# /etc/gitconfig\n"
"[http]\n"
"    proxy = http://proxy.example.com:3128\n"
"# or for HTTPS\n"
"[http]\n"
"    proxy = https://proxy.example.com:3128\n"
msgstr ""
"# /etc/gitconfig\n"
"[http]\n"
"    proxy = http://proxy.example.com:3128\n"
"# ຫຼື ສຳລັບ HTTPS\n"
"[http]\n"
"    proxy = https://proxy.example.com:3128\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:146
msgid ""
"If the proxy requires authentication, prefer a credential helper or use a "
"credential store instead of embedding credentials in the URL."
msgstr "ຫາກພຣັອກຊີຕ້ອງການການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ, ຄວນໃຊ້ຕົວຊ່ວຍຈັດການຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ (credential helper) ຫຼື ໃຊ້ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ ແທນການຝັງຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວໄວ້ໃນ URL."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:147
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automating with {salt}"
msgstr "ການເຮັດວຽກແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດດ້ວຍ {salt}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:148
msgid ""
"You can manage [path]`/etc/gitconfig` on build hosts through Configuration "
"Management, the same way as on any other managed system.  Create a Salt "
"state file and assign it to the build host via a config channel, then apply "
"a highstate from the {productname} UI."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດຈັດການ [path]`/etc/gitconfig` ໃນ build host ຜ່ານ Configuration Management, ຄືກັນກັບລະບົບອື່ນໆທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ. ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ Salt state ແລະ ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ build host ຜ່ານ config channel, ຈາກນັ້ນນຳໃຊ້ highstate ຈາກ {productname} UI."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:149
msgid ""
"If you want to source the proxy address from a System Custom Info field, use "
"the `custom_info:` pillar prefix:"
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການດຶງທີ່ຢູ່ພຣັອກຊີຈາກຟິວຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບແບບກຳນົດເອງ (System Custom Info), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳນຳໜ້າ pillar `custom_info:`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:150
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/etc/gitconfig:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - user: root\n"
"    - group: root\n"
"    - mode: '0644'\n"
"    - contents: |\n"
"        [http]\n"
"            proxy = {{ "
"salt['pillar.get']('custom_info:build_server:git_proxy', "
"'http://proxy.example.com:3128') }}\n"
msgstr ""
"/etc/gitconfig:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - user: root\n"
"    - group: root\n"
"    - mode: '0644'\n"
"    - contents: |\n"
"        [http]\n"
"            proxy = {{ salt['pillar.get']('custom_info:build_server:git_proxy', 'http://proxy.example.com:3128') }}\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:151
#, no-wrap
msgid "Container-based Kiwi image build support"
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບການບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບ Kiwi ແບບຄອນເທນເນີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:152
msgid ""
"{productname} introduces a container-based Kiwi image build system, in "
"addition to the existing legacy Kiwi and KiwiNG tools."
msgstr "{productname} ນຳສະເໜີລະບົບການບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບ Kiwi ແບບຄອນເທນເນີ, ເພີ່ມເຕີມຈາກເຄື່ອງມື Kiwi ແລະ KiwiNG ແບບເກົ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:153
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration and overrides "
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າ ແລະ ການຂຽນທັບ "

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:154
msgid ""
"Administrators can override the default behavior using the following pillar "
"or custom values.  To configure these, navigate to menu:[Systems>Custom "
"System Info] in the {webui} and create the necessary keys."
msgstr "ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບສາມາດຂຽນທັບພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ pillar ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ຫຼື ຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ. ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:[Systems>Custom System Info] ໃນ {webui} ແລະ ສ້າງຄີ (key) ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:155
msgid ""
"The build system used depends on the underlying OS or specific pillar "
"values:"
msgstr "ລະບົບການບິວດ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບ OS ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ ຫຼື ຄ່າ pillar ສະເພາະ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:156
msgid "for SLE 11 / SLE 12: legacy Kiwi v7"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ SLE 11 / SLE 12: Kiwi v7 ແບບເກົ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:157
msgid "for SLE 15: KiwiNG (v9 and containerized Kiwi 10)"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ SLE 15: KiwiNG (v9 ແລະ Kiwi 10 ແບບຄອນເທນເນີ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:158
msgid ""
"Administrators can override the default behavior using the following pillar "
"or custom values:"
msgstr "ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບສາມາດຂຽນທັບພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ pillar ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ຫຼື ຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:159
msgid "[literal]``use_kiwi_ng``: force the use of Kiwi 9,"
msgstr "[literal]``use_kiwi_ng``: ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Kiwi 9,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:160
msgid ""
"[literal]``use_kiwi_container``: force the use of containerized Kiwi 10.  To "
"enable this, set the value to [literal]``1``."
msgstr "[literal]``use_kiwi_container``: ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Kiwi 10 ແບບຄອນເທນເນີ. ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານສິ່ງນີ້, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ [literal]``1``."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:161
#, no-wrap
msgid "Version-specific configurations"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າສະເພາະເວີຊັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:162
msgid ""
"When using a containerized build host for SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 profiles, "
"specific configurations are required because SLES 15 profiles rely on Kiwi "
"9, while the default container behavior uses Kiwi 10."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂຮສບິວດ໌ແບບຄອນເທນເນີສຳລັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ SUSE Linux Enterprise 15, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການກຳນົດຄ່າສະເພາະ ເພາະວ່າໂປຣໄຟລ໌ SLES 15 ອີງໃສ່ Kiwi 9, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຄອນເທນເນີແມ່ນໃຊ້ Kiwi 10."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:163
msgid ""
"To ensure the correct version is used for SLES 15 profiles, you must define "
"the [literal]``kiwi_image`` custom info key with the following value:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ເວີຊັນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ SLES 15, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງກຳນົດຄີຂໍ້ມູນແບບກຳນົດເອງ [literal]``kiwi_image`` ດ້ວຍຄ່າຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:164
msgid "[literal]``Key``: kiwi_image"
msgstr "[literal]``Key``: kiwi_image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:165
msgid "[literal]``Value``: [path]``registry.suse.com/bci/kiwi:9``"
msgstr "[literal]``Value``: [path]``registry.suse.com/bci/kiwi:9``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:166
msgid ""
"If this key is not set, the system defaults to the latest version (e.g., "
"[path]``registry.suse.com/bci/kiwi:10.2``), which may result in build issues "
"for SLES 15 profiles."
msgstr "ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄີນີ້, ລະບົບຈະກຳນົດເປັນເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [path]``registry.suse.com/bci/kiwi:10.2``), ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາໃນການບິວດ໌ສຳລັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ SLES 15."

#.  FIXME, bsc#1245987:
#.  Discussing Container-Based KIWI Image Build Support here?
#.  Perhaps 2.'docker' might be 2, but the container variant might be different?
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:168
msgid ""
"To build all kinds of images with {productname}, create and configure a "
"build host.  OS Image build hosts are {salt} clients running on "
"{sles}{nbsp}15 (SP2 or later) or {sles}{nbsp}12 (SP4 or later)."
msgstr "ເພື່ອບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບທຸກປະເພດດ້ວຍ {productname}, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າໂຮສບິວດ໌. ໂຮສບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບ OS ແມ່ນໄຄລເອັນ {salt} ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກເທິງ {sles}{nbsp}15 (SP2 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ) ຫຼື {sles}{nbsp}12 (SP4 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:169
msgid ""
"This procedure guides you through the initial configuration for a build "
"host."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຈະແນະນຳເຈົ້າກ່ຽວກັບການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບໂຮສບິວດ໌."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:172
msgid ""
"Cross-architecture builds are not possible.  For example, you must build "
"Raspberry PI {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3 image on a Raspberry PI (aarch64 "
"architecture) build host running {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3."
msgstr "ການບິວດ໌ຂ້າມສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳແມ່ນບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບ Raspberry PI {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3 ເທິງໂຮສບິວດ໌ Raspberry PI (ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ aarch64) ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກເທິງ {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:173
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configure the build host in the {productname} {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ກຳນົດຄ່າໂຮສບິວດ໌ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:174
msgid ""
"Select a client to be designated as a build host from the "
"menu:Systems[Overview] page."
msgstr "ເລືອກໄຄລເອັນທີ່ຈະກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນໂຮສບິວດ໌ຈາກໜ້າເມນູ:Systems[Overview]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:175
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:System Details[Properties] tab, and check the "
"[guimenu]``Add-on System Type`` > [guimenu]``OS Image Build Host`` box."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບ menu:System Details[Properties], ແລະ ໝາຍເອົາຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Add-on System Type`` > [guimenu]``OS Image Build Host``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:176
msgid "Confirm with btn:[Update Properties]."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນດ້ວຍ btn:[Update Properties]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:177
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:System Details[Software > Software Channels], and enable "
"the required software channels depending on the build host version."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:System Details[Software > Software Channels], ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ຂຶ້ນກັບເວີຊັນຂອງໂຮສບິວດ໌."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:178
msgid ""
"{sles}{nbsp}12 build hosts require {productname} Client tools "
"(``SLE-Manager-Tools12-Pool`` and ``SLE-Manager-Tools12-Updates``)."
msgstr "ໂຮສບິວດ໌ {sles}{nbsp}12 ຕ້ອງການເຄື່ອງມືໄຄລເອັນ {productname} (``SLE-Manager-Tools12-Pool`` ແລະ ``SLE-Manager-Tools12-Updates``)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:179
msgid ""
"{sles}{nbsp}15 build hosts require {sles} modules "
"``SLE-Module-DevTools15-SP4-Pool`` and "
"``SLE-Module-DevTools15-SP4-Updates``."
msgstr "ໂຮສບິວດ໌ {sles}{nbsp}15 ຕ້ອງການໂມດູນ {sles} ``SLE-Module-DevTools15-SP4-Pool`` ແລະ ``SLE-Module-DevTools15-SP4-Updates``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:180
msgid "Schedule and click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາ ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:181
msgid ""
"Install Kiwi and all required packages by applying `Highstate`.  From the "
"system details page select menu:States[Highstate] and click btn:[Apply "
"Highstate].  Alternatively, apply Highstate from the {productname} Server "
"command line:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Kiwi ແລະ ແພັກເກດທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ `Highstate`. ຈາກໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດລະບົບ ໃຫ້ເລືອກເມນູ:States[Highstate] ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Apply Highstate]. ຫຼືອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ Highstate ຈາກບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname}:"

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:183
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} web server public certificate RPM"
msgstr "RPM ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສາທາລະນະຂອງເວັບເຊີເວີ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:184
msgid ""
"Build host provisioning copies the {productname} certificate RPM to the "
"build host.  This certificate is used for accessing repositories provided by "
"{productname}."
msgstr "ການຈັດຕຽມໂຮສບິວດ໌ຈະສຳເນົາ RPM ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ {productname} ໄປຍັງໂຮສບິວດ໌. ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຄັງເກັບ (repositories) ທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການໂດຍ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:185
msgid ""
"The certificate is packaged in RPM by the "
"`mgr-package-rpm-certificate-osimage` package script.  The package script is "
"called automatically during a new {productname} installation."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຖືກຈັດເປັນແພັກເກດ RPM ໂດຍສະຄຣິບແພັກເກດ `mgr-package-rpm-certificate-osimage`. ສະຄຣິບແພັກເກດນີ້ຈະຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:186
msgid ""
"When you upgrade the `spacewalk-certs-tools` package, the upgrade scenario "
"calls the package script using the default values.  However if the "
"certificate path was changed or unavailable, call the package script "
"manually using `--ca-cert-full-path <path_to_certificate>` after the upgrade "
"procedure has finished."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າອັບເກຣດແພັກເກດ `spacewalk-certs-tools`, ຂັ້ນຕອນການອັບເກຣດຈະຮຽກໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບແພັກເກດໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ ຫາກເສັ້ນທາງຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນມີການປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້, ໃຫ້ຮຽກໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບແພັກເກດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ `--ca-cert-full-path <path_to_certificate>` ຫຼັງຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນການອັບເກຣດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:187
#, no-wrap
msgid "Package script call example"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຮຽກໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບແພັກເກດ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:188
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/usr/sbin/mgr-package-rpm-certificate-osimage --ca-cert-full-path "
"/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"
msgstr "/usr/sbin/mgr-package-rpm-certificate-osimage --ca-cert-full-path /root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:189
msgid ""
"The RPM package with the certificate is stored in a salt-accessible "
"directory such as:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ RPM ທີ່ມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ salt ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:190
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm\n"
msgstr "/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:191
msgid ""
"The RPM package with the certificate is provided in the local build host "
"repository:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ RPM ທີ່ມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈະມີໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຄັງເກັບຂອງໂຮສບິວດ໌ພາຍໃນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:192
#, no-wrap
msgid "/var/lib/Kiwi/repo\n"
msgstr "/var/lib/Kiwi/repo\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:193
msgid ""
"Specify the RPM package with the {productname} SSL certificate in the build "
"source, and make sure your Kiwi configuration contains "
"``rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage`` as a required package in the "
"``bootstrap`` section."
msgstr "ລະບຸແພັກເກດ RPM ທີ່ມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ຂອງ {productname} ໃນຊອດສ໌ການບິວດ໌, ແລະ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການກຳນົດຄ່າ Kiwi ຂອງເຈົ້າປະກອບມີ ``rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage`` ເປັນແພັກເກດທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນສ່ວນ ``bootstrap``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:194
#, no-wrap
msgid "config.xml"
msgstr "config.xml"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:195
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"...\n"
"  <packages type=\"bootstrap\">\n"
"    ...\n"
"    <package name=\"rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage\" "
"bootinclude=\"true\"/>\n"
"  </packages>\n"
"...\n"
msgstr ""
"...\n"
"  <packages type=\"bootstrap\">\n"
"    ...\n"
"    <package name=\"rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage\" bootinclude=\"true\"/>\n"
"  </packages>\n"
"...\n"

#.  FIXME 2024-04-25, ke: continue here compare with container build host
#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:196
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an activation key for OS images"
msgstr "ສ້າງຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (Activation key) ສຳລັບຮູບພາບ OS"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:197
msgid ""
"Create an activation key associated with the channel that your OS Images can "
"use as repositories when building the image."
msgstr "ສ້າງຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຮູບພາບ OS ຂອງເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຄັງເກັບໃນເວລາບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:198
msgid "Activation keys are mandatory for OS Image building."
msgstr "ຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບ OS."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:199
msgid ""
"To build OS Images, you need an activation key that is associated with a "
"channel other than `Default` activation key."
msgstr "ເພື່ອບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບ OS, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງມີຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊ່ອງທາງອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານ `Default`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:201
msgid "In the {webui}, select menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເມນູ:Systems[Activation Keys]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:202
msgid "Click [guimenu]``Create Key``."
msgstr "ຄລິກ [guimenu]``Create Key``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:203
msgid ""
"Enter a [guimenu]``Description``, a [guimenu]``Key`` name, and use the "
"drop-down box to select a [guimenu]``Base Channel`` to associate with the "
"key."
msgstr "ປ້ອນ [guimenu]``Description``, ຊື່ [guimenu]``Key``, ແລະ ໃຊ້ກ່ອງລາຍການເລືອກເພື່ອເລືອກ [guimenu]``Base Channel`` ທີ່ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຄີ."

#.  For background info about Image Store, see the overview at the beginning of this chapter.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:207
msgid ""
"OS Images can require a significant amount of storage space.  By default, "
"the image store is using the [path]``srv-www`` volume."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບ OS ອາດຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ບ່ອນເກັບຮູບພາບ (image store) ຈະໃຊ້ວໍລຸມ (volume) [path]``srv-www``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:208
msgid ""
"Image stores for Kiwi build type, used to build system, virtual, and other "
"images, are not supported yet."
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບຮູບພາບສຳລັບປະເພດການບິວດ໌ Kiwi, ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອບິວດ໌ລະບົບ, ວຽກສະເໝືອນ (virtual), ແລະ ຮູບພາບອື່ນໆ ແມ່ນຍັງບໍ່ທັນຮອງຮັບເທື່ອ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:212
msgid "Manage image profiles using the {webui}."
msgstr "ຈັດການໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:214
msgid ""
"To create an image profile select from menu:Images[Profiles] and click "
"btn:[Create]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບ ໃຫ້ເລືອກຈາກເມນູ:Images[Profiles] ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:215
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Label`` field, provide a name for the `Image Profile`."
msgstr "ໃນຟິວ [guimenu]``Label``, ໃຫ້ລະບຸຊື່ສຳລັບ `Image Profile`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:216
msgid "Use `Kiwi` as the [guimenu]``Image Type``."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ `Kiwi` ເປັນ [guimenu]``Image Type``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:217
msgid "Image store is automatically selected."
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບຮູບພາບຈະຖືກເລືອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:218
msgid ""
"Enter a [guimenu]``Config URL`` to the directory containing the Kiwi "
"configuration files.  For example, a git URI such as "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master:OSImage/SLE-Micro54.  "
"Other options are a HTTP or HTTPS hosted tar archive or a local directory on "
"the build host.  For more information, see source format options at the end "
"of this section."
msgstr "ປ້ອນ [guimenu]``Config URL`` ໄປຍັງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ Kiwi. ຕົວຢ່າງ: git URI ເຊັ່ນ https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master:OSImage/SLE-Micro54. ຕົວເລືອກອື່ນແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ຈັດເກັບ tar ທີ່ໂຮສດ້ວຍ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS ຫຼື ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງໂຮສບິວດ໌. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງຕົວເລືອກຮູບແບບຊອດສ໌ຢູ່ທ້າຍພາກນີ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:219
msgid ""
"Enter [guimenu]``Kiwi options`` if needed.  If the Kiwi configuration files "
"specify multiple profiles, use [option]``--profile <name>`` to select the "
"active one.  For other options, see Kiwi documentation."
msgstr "ປ້ອນ [guimenu]``Kiwi options`` ຫາກຈຳເປັນ. ຫາກໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ Kiwi ລະບຸຫຼາຍໂປຣໄຟລ໌, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [option]``--profile <name>`` ເພື່ອເລືອກອັນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ງານ. ສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກອື່ນໆ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ Kiwi."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:220
msgid ""
"Select an [guimenu]``Activation Key``.  Activation keys ensure that images "
"using a profile are assigned to the correct channel and packages."
msgstr "ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Activation Key``. ຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຮູບພາບທີ່ໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:221
msgid ""
"Associate an activation key with an image profile to ensure the image "
"profile uses the correct software channel, and any packages."
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມໂຍງຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ ແລະ ແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:222
msgid "Confirm with the btn:[Create] button."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນດ້ວຍປຸ່ມ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:223
#, no-wrap
msgid "Source Format Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກຮູບແບບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:224
msgid "_git/HTTP(S) URL to the repository_"
msgstr "_URL git/HTTP(S) ໄປຍັງຄັງເກັບ_"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:225
msgid ""
"URL to a public or private git repository containing the sources of the "
"image to be built.  Depending on the layout of the repository the URL can "
"be:"
msgstr "URL ໄປຍັງຄັງເກັບ git ແບບສາທາລະນະ ຫຼື ສ່ວນຕົວ ທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຊອດສ໌ຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ຈະບິວດ໌. ຂຶ້ນກັບໂຄງສ້າງຂອງຄັງເກັບ, URL ສາມາດເປັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:226
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:227
msgid ""
"You can specify a branch after the `#` character in the URL.  In this "
"example, we use the `master` branch:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດລະບຸສາຂາ (branch) ຫຼັງເຄື່ອງໝາຍ `#` ໃນ URL. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ສາຂາ `master`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:228
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:229
msgid ""
"You can specify a directory that contains the image sources after the `:` "
"character.  In this example, we use `OSImage/POS_Image-JeOS6`:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດລະບຸໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຊອດສ໌ຮູບພາບຫຼັງເຄື່ອງໝາຍ `:`.ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ `OSImage/POS_Image-JeOS6`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:230
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master:OSImage/POS_Image-JeOS6\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master:OSImage/POS_Image-JeOS6\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:231
msgid "_HTTP(S) URL to the tar archive_"
msgstr "_URL HTTP(S) ໄປຍັງໄຟລ໌ຈັດເກັບ tar_"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:232
msgid "URL to the tar archive, compressed or uncompressed, hosted on the webserver."
msgstr "URL ໄປຍັງໄຟລ໌ຈັດເກັບ tar, ທັງແບບບີບອັດ ຫຼື ບໍ່ບີບອັດ, ທີ່ໂຮສຢູ່ເທິງເວັບເຊີເວີ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:233
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://myimagesourceserver.example.org/MyKiwiImage.tar.gz\n"
msgstr "https://myimagesourceserver.example.org/MyKiwiImage.tar.gz\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:234
msgid "_Path to the directory on the build host_"
msgstr "_ເສັ້ນທາງ (Path) ໄປຍັງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເທິງໂຮສບິວດ໌_"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:235
msgid ""
"Enter the path to the directory with the Kiwi build system sources.  This "
"directory must be present on the selected build host."
msgstr "ປ້ອນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຍັງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ມີຊອດສ໌ລະບົບການບິວດ໌ Kiwi. ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ຕ້ອງມີຢູ່ໃນໂຮສບິວດ໌ທີ່ເລືອກ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:236
#, no-wrap
msgid "/var/lib/Kiwi/MyKiwiImage\n"
msgstr "/var/lib/Kiwi/MyKiwiImage\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:237
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example of Kiwi sources"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຊອດສ໌ Kiwi"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:238
msgid ""
"Kiwi sources consist at least of `config.xml`.  Usually, `config.sh` and "
"`images.sh` are present as well.  Sources can also contain files to be "
"installed in the final image under the `root` subdirectory."
msgstr "ຊອດສ໌ Kiwi ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍຕ້ອງປະກອບມີ `config.xml`. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະມີ `config.sh` ແລະ `images.sh` ຢູ່ຄຳນຳ. ຊອດສ໌ຍັງສາມາດປະກອບມີໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງໃນຮູບພາບຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍພາຍໃຕ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຍ່ອຍ `root`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:239
msgid ""
"For information about the Kiwi build system, see the "
"https://osinside.github.io/kiwi/[Kiwi documentation]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບລະບົບການບິວດ໌ Kiwi, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://osinside.github.io/kiwi/[ເອກະສານຂອງ Kiwi]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:240
msgid ""
"{suse} provides examples of fully functional image sources at the "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles[SUSE/manager-build-profiles] "
"public GitHub repository."
msgstr "{suse} ໃຫ້ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຊອດສ໌ຮູບພາບທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ເຕັມຮູບແບບຢູ່ທີ່ຄັງເກັບ GitHub ສາທາລະນະ https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles[SUSE/manager-build-profiles]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:241
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example of JeOS config.xml"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ JeOS config.xml"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:242
#, no-wrap
msgid "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\n"
msgstr "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:243
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<image schemaversion=\"6.1\" name=\"POS_Image_JeOS6\">\n"
"    <description type=\"system\">\n"
"        <author>Admin User</author>\n"
"        <contact>noemail@example.com</contact>\n"
"        <specification>SUSE Linux Enterprise 12 SP3 JeOS</specification>\n"
"    </description>\n"
"    <preferences>\n"
"        <version>6.0.0</version>\n"
"        <packagemanager>zypper</packagemanager>\n"
"        <bootsplash-theme>SLE</bootsplash-theme>\n"
"        <bootloader-theme>SLE</bootloader-theme>\n"
msgstr ""
"<image schemaversion=\"6.1\" name=\"POS_Image_JeOS6\">\n"
"    <description type=\"system\">\n"
"        <author>Admin User</author>\n"
"        <contact>noemail@example.com</contact>\n"
"        <specification>SUSE Linux Enterprise 12 SP3 JeOS</specification>\n"
"    </description>\n"
"    <preferences>\n"
"        <version>6.0.0</version>\n"
"        <packagemanager>zypper</packagemanager>\n"
"        <bootsplash-theme>SLE</bootsplash-theme>\n"
"        <bootloader-theme>SLE</bootloader-theme>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:244
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <locale>en_US</locale>\n"
"        <keytable>us.map.gz</keytable>\n"
"        <timezone>Europe/Berlin</timezone>\n"
"        <hwclock>utc</hwclock>\n"
msgstr ""
"        <locale>en_US</locale>\n"
"        <keytable>us.map.gz</keytable>\n"
"        <timezone>Europe/Berlin</timezone>\n"
"        <hwclock>utc</hwclock>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:245
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <rpm-excludedocs>true</rpm-excludedocs>\n"
"        <type boot=\"saltboot/suse-SLES12\" bootloader=\"grub2\" "
"checkprebuilt=\"true\" compressed=\"false\" filesystem=\"ext3\" "
"fsmountoptions=\"acl\" fsnocheck=\"true\" image=\"pxe\" "
"kernelcmdline=\"quiet\"></type>\n"
"    </preferences>\n"
"    <!--    CUSTOM REPOSITORY\n"
"    <repository type=\"rpm-dir\">\n"
"      <source path=\"this://repo\"/>\n"
"    </repository>\n"
"    -->\n"
"    <packages type=\"image\">\n"
"        <package name=\"patterns-sles-Minimal\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"aaa_base-extras\"/> <!-- wouldn't be SUSE without "
"that ;-) -->\n"
"        <package name=\"kernel-default\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"venv-salt-minion\"/>\n"
"        ...\n"
"    </packages>\n"
"    <packages type=\"bootstrap\">\n"
"        ...\n"
"        <package name=\"sles-release\"/>\n"
"        <!-- this certificate package is required to access {productname} "
"repositories\n"
"             and is provided by {productname} automatically -->\n"
"        <package name=\"rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage\" "
"bootinclude=\"true\"/>\n"
msgstr ""
"        <rpm-excludedocs>true</rpm-excludedocs>\n"
"        <type boot=\"saltboot/suse-SLES12\" bootloader=\"grub2\" checkprebuilt=\"true\" compressed=\"false\" filesystem=\"ext3\" fsmountoptions=\"acl\" fsnocheck=\"true\" image=\"pxe\" kernelcmdline=\"quiet\"></type>\n"
"    </preferences>\n"
"    <!--    CUSTOM REPOSITORY\n"
"    <repository type=\"rpm-dir\">\n"
"      <source path=\"this://repo\"/>\n"
"    </repository>\n"
"    -->\n"
"    <packages type=\"image\">\n"
"        <package name=\"patterns-sles-Minimal\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"aaa_base-extras\"/> <!-- wouldn't be SUSE without that ;-) -->\n"
"        <package name=\"kernel-default\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"venv-salt-minion\"/>\n"
"        ...\n"
"    </packages>\n"
"    <packages type=\"bootstrap\">\n"
"        ...\n"
"        <package name=\"sles-release\"/>\n"
"        <!-- this certificate package is required to access {productname} repositories\n"
"             and is provided by {productname} automatically -->\n"
"        <package name=\"rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage\" bootinclude=\"true\"/>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:246
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </packages>\n"
"    <packages type=\"delete\">\n"
"        <package name=\"mtools\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"initviocons\"/>\n"
"        ...\n"
"    </packages>\n"
"</image>\n"
msgstr ""
"    </packages>\n"
"    <packages type=\"delete\">\n"
"        <package name=\"mtools\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"initviocons\"/>\n"
"        ...\n"
"    </packages>\n"
"</image>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:248
msgid ""
"There are two ways to build or get an image using the {webui}.  Either "
"select menu:Images[Build], or click the build icon in the "
"menu:Images[Profiles] list."
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີໃນການບິວດ໌ ຫຼື ຮັບຮູບພາບໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}. ໂດຍການເລືອກເມນູ:Images[Build], ຫຼື ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນບິວດ໌ໃນລາຍການເມນູ:Images[Profiles]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:251
msgid ""
"Add a different tag name if you want a version other than the default "
"``latest`` (applies only to containers)."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຊື່ແທັກ (tag) ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເວີຊັນອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນເວີຊັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ``latest`` (ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບຄອນເທນເນີເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:252
msgid "Select the [guimenu]``Image Profile`` and a [guimenu]``Build Host``."
msgstr "ເລືອກ [guimenu]``Image Profile`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Build Host``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:253
msgid ""
"A [guimenu]``Profile Summary`` is displayed to the right of the build "
"fields.  When you have selected a build profile, detailed information about "
"the selected profile is shown here."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Profile Summary`` (ສະຫຼຸບໂປຣໄຟລ໌) ຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ທາງເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງຟິວການບິວດ໌. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການບິວດ໌ແລ້ວ, ຂໍ້ມູນລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເລືອກຈະສະແດງຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:254
msgid "To schedule a build, click the btn:[Build] button."
msgstr "ເພື່ອວາງແຜນການບິວດ໌, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Build]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:255
msgid ""
"The build server cannot run any form of automounter during the image "
"building process.  If applicable, ensure that you do not have your Gnome "
"session running as root.  If an automounter is running, the image build "
"finishes successfully, but the checksum of the image is different and causes "
"a failure."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີບິວດ໌ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານລະບົບຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ (automounter) ໃດໆ ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບ. ຫາກເປັນໄປໄດ້, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ເຊດຊັນ Gnome ໃນຖານະ root. ຫາກມີ automounter ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ການບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບອາດຈະສຳເລັດ, ແຕ່ຄ່າ checksum ຂອງຮູບພາບຈະແຕກຕ່າງ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:256
msgid ""
"After the image is successfully built, the inspection phase begins.  During "
"the inspection phase {susemgr} collects information about the image:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຮູບພາບຖືກບິວດ໌ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ຈະເຂົ້າສູ່ໄລຍະການກວດສອບ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງໄລຍະການກວດສອບ {susemgr} ຈະຮວບຮວມຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຮູບພາບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:257
msgid "List of packages installed in the image"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ແພັກເກດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນຮູບພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:258
msgid "Checksum of the image"
msgstr "Checksum ຂອງຮູບພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:259
msgid "Image type and other image details"
msgstr "ປະເພດຮູບພາບ ແລະ ລາຍລະອຽດອື່ນໆ ຂອງຮູບພາບ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:260
msgid ""
"If the built image type is `PXE`, a {salt} pillar is also generated.  Image "
"pillars are stored in the database and the {salt} subsystem can access "
"details about the generated image.  Details include where the image files "
"are located and provided, image checksums, information needed for network "
"boot, and more."
msgstr "ຫາກປະເພດຮູບພາບທີ່ບິວດ໌ແມ່ນ `PXE`, {salt} pillar ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນນຳ. Image pillars ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ລະບົບຍ່ອຍ {salt} ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບຮູບພາບທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້. ລາຍລະອຽດລວມມີສະຖານທີ່ເກັບໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບ, ຄ່າ checksum ຂອງຮູບພາບ, ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການບູດຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ (network boot), ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:261
msgid "The generated pillar is available to all connected clients."
msgstr "Pillar ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະມີໃຫ້ກັບໄຄລເອັນທັງໝົດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:263
msgid ""
"Building an image requires several dependent steps.  When the build fails, "
"investigating {salt} states results and build log can help identify the "
"source of the failure.  You can carry out these checks when the build fails:"
msgstr "ການບິວດ໌ຮູບພາບຕ້ອງຜ່ານຫຼາຍຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັນ. ເມື່ອການບິວດ໌ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ການກວດສອບຜົນຂອງສະຖານະ {salt} ແລະ ບັນທຶກການບິວດ໌ (build log) ສາມາດຊ່ວຍລະບຸສາເຫດຂອງຄວາມຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວໄດ້. ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:264
msgid "The build host can access the build sources"
msgstr "ໂຮສບິວດ໌ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຊອດສ໌ການບິວດ໌ໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:265
msgid ""
"There is enough disk space for the image on both the build host and the "
"{productname} server"
msgstr "ມີພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໃນດິສກ໌ພຽງພໍສຳລັບຮູບພາບທັງໃນໂຮສບິວດ໌ ແລະ ເຊີເວີ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:266
msgid "The activation key has the correct channels associated with it"
msgstr "ຄີເປີດໃຊ້ງານມີຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມໂຍງຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:267
msgid "The build sources used are valid"
msgstr "ຊອດສ໌ການບິວດ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ແມ່ນຖືກຕ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:268
msgid ""
"The RPM package with the {productname} public certificate is up to date and "
"available at "
"`/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm`.  "
"For more on how to refresh a public certificate RPM, see "
"<<at.images.kiwi.buildhost>>."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ RPM ທີ່ມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສາທາລະນະຂອງ {productname} ແມ່ນເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ ແລະ ມີໃຫ້ຢູ່ທີ່ `/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm`. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການປັບປຸງ RPM ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສາທາລະນະ, ເບິ່ງ <<at.images.kiwi.buildhost>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:270
msgid "The section contains some known issues when working with images."
msgstr "ພາກນີ້ປະກອບມີບາງບັນຫາທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍໃນເວລານຳໃຊ້ຮູບພາບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:271
msgid ""
"HTTPS certificates used to access the HTTP sources or git repositories "
"should be deployed to the client by a custom state file, or configured "
"manually."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ HTTPS ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຊອດສ໌ HTTP ຫຼື ຄັງເກັບ git ຄວນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບໄຄລເອັນໂດຍໄຟລ໌ສະຖານະທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ຫຼື ກຳນົດຄ່າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:272
msgid "Importing Kiwi-based images is not supported."
msgstr "ການນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບທີ່ອີງໃສ່ Kiwi ແມ່ນຍັງບໍ່ທັນຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:273
#, no-wrap
msgid "List of built images"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ຮູບພາບທີ່ບິວດ໌ແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:274
msgid ""
"To list available built images select menu:Images[Image List].  A list of "
"all images is displayed."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຮູບພາບທີ່ບິວດ໌ແລ້ວ ໃຫ້ເລືອກເມນູ:Images[Image List]. ລາຍຊື່ຮູບພາບທັງໝົດຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:275
msgid ""
"Displayed data about images includes an image [guimenu]``Name``, its "
"[guimenu]``Version``, [guimenu]``Revision``, and the build "
"[guimenu]``Status``.  You can also see the image update status with a "
"listing of possible patch and package updates that are available for the "
"image."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສະແດງກ່ຽວກັບຮູບພາບລວມມີ [guimenu]``Name`` (ຊື່ຮູບພາບ), [guimenu]``Version`` (ເວີຊັນ), [guimenu]``Revision`` (ການແກ້ໄຂ), ແລະ [guimenu]``Status`` (ສະຖານະການບິວດ໌). ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດເຫັນສະຖານະການອັບເດດຮູບພາບ ພ້ອມກັບລາຍຊື່ແພັດ (patch) ແລະ ການອັບເດດແພັກເກດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບຮູບພາບນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:276
msgid ""
"For OS Images, the [guimenu]``Name`` and [guimenu]``Version`` fields "
"originate from Kiwi sources and are updated at the end of successful build.  "
"During building or after failed build these fields show a temporary name "
"based on profile name."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຮູບພາບ OS, ຟິວ [guimenu]``Name`` ແລະ [guimenu]``Version`` ແມ່ນມາຈາກຊອດສ໌ Kiwi ແລະ ຈະຖືກອັບເດດເມື່ອການບິວດ໌ສຳເລັດ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງການບິວດ໌ ຫຼື ຫຼັງຈາກການບິວດ໌ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ຟິວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະສະແດງຊື່ຊົ່ວຄາວທີ່ອີງຕາມຊື່ໂປຣໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:277
msgid ""
"[guimenu]``Revision`` is automatically increased after each successful "
"build. For OS Images, multiple revisions can co-exist in the store."
msgstr "[guimenu]``Revision`` ຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກການບິວດ໌ແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງສຳເລັດ. ສຳລັບຮູບພາບ OS, ສາມາດມີຫຼາຍລຸ້ນແກ້ໄຂຢູ່ໃນບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພ້ອມກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:278
msgid ""
"For Container Images the store holds only the latest revision.  Information "
"about previous revisions (packages, patches, etc.) are preserved and it is "
"possible to list them with the [guimenu]``Show obsolete`` checkbox."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຮູບພາບຄອນເທນເນີ, ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຈະເກັບສະເພາະລຸ້ນແກ້ໄຂຫຼ້າສຸດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບລຸ້ນແກ້ໄຂກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ (ແພັກເກດ, ແພັດ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) ຈະຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ ແລະ ສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ໄດ້ໂດຍການເລືອກກ່ອງເຄື່ອງໝາຍ [guimenu]``Show obsolete`` (ສະແດງອັນທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:279
msgid ""
"Clicking the btn:[Details] button on an image provides a detailed view.  The "
"detailed view includes an exact list of relevant patches, list of all "
"packages installed within the image and a build log."
msgstr "ການຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Details] ຂອງຮູບພາບຈະສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດ. ມຸມມອງລາຍລະອຽດລວມມີ ລາຍຊື່ແພັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ, ລາຍຊື່ແພັກເກດທັງໝົດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນຮູບພາບ ແລະ ບັນທຶກການບິວດ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:280
msgid ""
"Clicking the btn:[Delete] button deletes the image from the list.  It also "
"deletes the associated pillar, files from OS Image Store and obsolete "
"revisions."
msgstr "ການຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Delete] ຈະລຶບຮູບພາບອອກຈາກລາຍຊື່. ມັນຍັງຈະລຶບ pillar ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ໄຟລ໌ຈາກບ່ອນເກັບຮູບພາບ OS ແລະ ລຸ້ນແກ້ໄຂທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝນຳ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:281
msgid ""
"The patch and the package list is only available if the inspect state after "
"a build was successful."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ແພັດ ແລະ ແພັກເກດຈະມີໃຫ້ເບິ່ງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອສະຖານະການກວດສອບຫຼັງຈາກການບິວດ໌ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image Inspection"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບອິເມຈ (Image Inspection)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:2
msgid ""
"A base container image (BCI) comes with all the software to run it, but "
"because BCIs are lightweight they may not come with all tools and libraries "
"you may need for inspection."
msgstr "Base Container Image (BCI) ມາພ້ອມກັບຊອບແວທັງໝົດເພື່ອລັນມັນ, ແຕ່ເນື່ອງຈາກ BCIs ມີນ້ຳໜັກເບົາ ພວກມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງມື ແລະ ໄລບຣາຣີທັງໝົດທີ່ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການສຳລັບການກວດສອບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:3
msgid "When inspecting a container image you can see an error message such as:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອກວດສອບ container image ທ່ານອາດຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດເຊັ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "libssl.so.1.1: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory\n"
msgstr "libssl.so.1.1: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:5
msgid ""
"A BCI can be used in the other scenarios than with the container build host "
"and using the {salt} bundle for the inspection, but if you need inspection "
"to work you must add all needed software in advance."
msgstr "BCI ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໃນສະຖານະການອື່ນໆນອກຈາກການໃຊ້ກັບ container build host ແລະ ການໃຊ້ {salt} bundle ສຳລັບການກວດສອບ, ແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ການກວດສອບເຮັດວຽກ ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຊອບແວທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:6
msgid ""
"To avoid such issues you must add [systemitem]``libopenssl`` to the image "
"with [systemitem]``Dockerfile`` and rebuild the image."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫາດັ່ງກ່າວ ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ [systemitem]``libopenssl`` ເຂົ້າໃນອິເມຈດ້ວຍ [systemitem]``Dockerfile`` ແລະ ສ້າງອິເມຈຄືນໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:7
msgid "The same can happen with [systemitem]``libexpat``."
msgstr "ກໍລະນີດຽວກັນອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບ [systemitem]``libexpat``."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Infrastructure maintenance tasks"
msgstr "ວຽກງານການບຳລຸງຮັກສາໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you work with scheduled downtime periods, you might find it difficult to "
"remember all the things that you need to do before, during, and after that "
"critical downtime of the {productname} Server.  {productname} Server related "
"systems such as Inter-Server Synchronization Slave Servers or {productname} "
"Proxies are also affected and have to be considered."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າເຮັດວຽກກັບໄລຍະເວລາຢຸດພັກລະບົບ (downtime) ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຈື່ທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດກ່ອນ, ໃນລະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ຫຼັງຈາກການຢຸດພັກລະບົບທີ່ສຳຄັນຂອງເຊີເວີ {productname} ໄດ້ຍາກ. ລະບົບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເຊີເວີ {productname} ເຊັ່ນ ເຊີເວີລູກ (Slave Servers) ຂອງການຊິງໂຄຣໄນລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ ຫຼື ພຣັອກຊີ {productname} ກໍໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການພິຈາລະນານຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{suse} recommends you always keep your {productname} infrastructure "
"updated.  That includes servers, proxies, and build hosts.  If you do not "
"keep the {productname} Server updated, you might not be able to update some "
"parts of your environment when you need to."
msgstr "{suse} ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າອັບເດດໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານ {productname} ຂອງເຈົ້າໃຫ້ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນສະເໝີ. ເຊິ່ງລວມເຖິງເຊີເວີ, ພຣັອກຊີ, ແລະ ໂຮສບິວດ໌. ຫາກເຈົ້າບໍ່ອັບເດດເຊີເວີ {productname}, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດອັບເດດບາງສ່ວນຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້ໃນເວລາທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This section contains a checklist for your downtime period, with links to "
"further information on performing each of the steps."
msgstr "ພາກນີ້ປະກອບມີລາຍການກວດສອບ (checklist) ສຳລັບໄລຍະເວລາຢຸດພັກລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າ, ພ້ອມກັບລິ້ງໄປຫາຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນການປະຕິບັດແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Server checks"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບເຊີເວີ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:7
msgid "Apply the latest updates."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ການອັບເດດຫຼ້າສຸດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:8
msgid "Upgrade to the latest service pack, if required."
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດເປັນເຊີວິດແພັກ (service pack) ຫຼ້າສຸດ, ຫາກຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Run [command]``podman ps`` and check whether all required services are up "
"and running."
msgstr "ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``podman ps`` ແລະ ກວດສອບວ່າການບໍລິການທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດເປີດໃຊ້ງານຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:10
msgid "On {sles} {bci-mlm}, you can install updates using a package manager:"
msgstr "ໃນ {sles} {bci-mlm}, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງການອັບເດດໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກດ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For information on using {yast}, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-onlineupdate-you.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ {yast}, ເບິ່ງ {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-onlineupdate-you.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For information on using zypper, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-sw-cl.html#sec-zypper."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽັບການໃຊ້ zypper, ເບິ່ງ {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-sw-cl.html#sec-zypper."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:13
msgid ""
"On {sl-micro} {microversion}, you can install updates using the "
"[command]``transactional-update`` command.  For information on using "
"[command]``transactional-update``, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/6.2/html/Micro-transactional-updates/index.html."
msgstr "ໃນ {sl-micro} {microversion}, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງການອັບເດດໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``transactional-update``. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ [command]``transactional-update``, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/6.2/html/Micro-transactional-updates/index.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:14
msgid ""
"By default, several update channels are configured and enabled for the "
"{productname} Server.  New and updated packages become available "
"automatically."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຊ່ອງທາງການອັບເດດຫຼາຍຊ່ອງທາງຈະຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບເຊີເວີ {productname}. ແພັກເກດໃໝ່ ແລະ ແພັກເກດທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To keep {susemgr} up to date, either connect it directly to {scclongform} or "
"use {rmtool} (RMT).  You can use RMT as a local installation source for "
"disconnected environments."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {susemgr} ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນຢູ່ສະເໝີ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງກັບ {scclongform} ຫຼື ໃຊ້ {rmtool} (RMT). ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ RMT ເປັນແຫຼ່ງຕິດຕັ້ງພາຍໃນສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:16
msgid ""
"You can check that the update channels are available on your system with "
"this command:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບວ່າຊ່ອງທາງການອັບເດດມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າຫຼືບໍ່ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper lr\n"
msgstr "zypper lr\n"

