"SLE-Product-SLES15-SP7-Pool                            | Yes     | (r ) Yes  | No\n"
"SLE-Product-SLES15-SP7-Updates                         | Yes     | (r ) Yes  | Yes\n"
"SUSE-Multi-Linux-Manager-Server-SLE-5.2-Pool           | Yes     | (r ) Yes  | No\n"
"SUSE-Multi-Linux-Manager-Server-SLE-5.2-Updates        | Yes     | (r ) Yes  | Yes\n"
"SLE-Module-Server-Applications15-SP7-Pool              | Yes     | (r ) Yes  | No\n"
"SLE-Module-Server-Applications15-SP7-Updates           | Yes     | (r ) Yes  | Yes\n"
"SLE-Module-Systems-Management-15-SP7-Pool              | Yes     | (r ) Yes  | No\n"
"SLE-Module-Systems-Management-15-SP7-Updates           | Yes     | (r ) Yes  | Yes\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:20
msgid ""
"{productname} releases maintenance updates (MUs) to provide newer packages.  "
"Maintenance updates are indicated with a new version number.  For example, "
"the major release 5.2 is incremented to 5.2.1 when an MU is released."
msgstr "{productname} ໄດ້ອອກການອັບເດດບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (MU) ເພື່ອສະໜອງແພັກເກດທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ. ການອັບເດດບຳລຸງຮັກສາຈະຖືກບອກດ້ວຍເລກເວີຊັນໃໝ່. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ລຸ້ນຫຼັກ 5.2 ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເປັນ 5.2.1 ເມື່ອມີການອອກ MU."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:21
msgid ""
"You can verify which version you are running by looking at the bottom of the "
"navigation bar in the {webui}.  You can also fetch the version number with "
"the [literal]``api.getVersion()`` XMLRPC API call."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບວ່າເຈົ້າກຳລັງໃຊ້ເວີຊັນໃດຢູ່ໄດ້ໂດຍການເບິ່ງທີ່ສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງແຖບນຳທາງໃນ {webui}. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດດຶງເລກເວີຊັນດ້ວຍການຮຽກໃຊ້ XMLRPC API [literal]``api.getVersion()``."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client tools"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືໄຄລເອັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:23
msgid ""
"When the server is updated consider updating some tools on the clients, "
"too.  Updating [package]``venv-salt-minion``, [package]``zypper``, and other "
"related management package on clients is not a strict requirement, but it is "
"a best practice in general.  For example, a maintenance update on the server "
"might introduce a major new Salt version.  Then Salt clients continue to "
"work but might experience problems later on.  To avoid this {suse} makes "
"sure that [package]``venv-salt-minion`` will always be updated safely."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຊີເວີຖືກອັບເດດແລ້ວ ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາອັບເດດເຄື່ອງມືບາງຢ່າງໃນ client ນຳ. ການອັບເດດ [package]``venv-salt-minion``, [package]``zypper``, ແລະ ແພັກເກດການຈັດການອື່ນໆທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນ client ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂໍ້ກຳນົດທີ່ເຂັ້ມງວດ, ແຕ່ມັນແມ່ນການປະຕິບັດທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການອັບເດດບຳລຸງຮັກສາໃນເຊີເວີອາດຈະນຳສະເໜີເວີຊັນຫຼັກໃໝ່ຂອງ Salt. ຈາກນັ້ນ Salt client ຈະຍັງຄົງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ແຕ່ອາດຈະພົບກັບບັນຫາໃນພາຍຫຼັງ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນສິ່ງນີ້ {suse} ຮັບປະກັນວ່າ [package]``venv-salt-minion`` ຈະຖືກອັບເດດຢ່າງປອດໄພສະເໝີ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inter-Server Synchronization slave server"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີລູກ (slave server) ຂອງການຊິງໂຄຣໄນລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:25
msgid ""
"If you are using an Inter-Server Synchronization slave server, update it "
"after the {productname} Server update is complete."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າກຳລັງໃຊ້ເຊີເວີລູກຂອງການຊິງໂຄຣໄນລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ, ໃຫ້ອັບເດດມັນຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ການອັບເດດເຊີເວີ {productname} ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc[Inter-Server "
"Synchronization - Version 2]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc[Inter-Server Synchronization - Version 2]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitoring server"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີຕິດຕາມກວດກາ (Monitoring server)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:28
msgid ""
"If you are using a monitoring server for Prometheus, update it after the "
"{productname} Server update is complete."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າກຳລັງໃຊ້ເຊີເວີຕິດຕາມກວດກາສຳລັບ Prometheus, ໃຫ້ອັບເດດມັນຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ການອັບເດດເຊີເວີ {productname} ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For more information on monitoring, see "
"xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕາມກວດກາ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy"
msgstr "ພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Proxies should be updated as soon as {productname} Server updates are "
"complete."
msgstr "ພຣັອກຊີຄວນໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດທັນທີທີ່ການອັບເດດເຊີເວີ {productname} ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:32
msgid ""
"In general, running a proxy connected to a server on a different version is "
"not supported.  The only exception is for the duration of updates where it "
"is expected that the server is updated first, so the proxy could run the "
"previous version temporarily."
msgstr "ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, ການໃຊ້ງານພຣັອກຊີທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີທີ່ເປັນຄົນລະເວີຊັນແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ. ຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນພຽງຢ່າງດຽວແມ່ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການອັບເດດ ເຊິ່ງຄາດວ່າເຊີເວີຈະຖືກອັບເດດກ່ອນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນພຣັອກຊີຈຶ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ງານເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໄດ້ຊົ່ວຄາວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:33
msgid "Always upgrade the server first, then any proxy."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ອັບເກຣດເຊີເວີກ່ອນສະເໝີ, ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງອັບເກຣດພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up Channels for Live Patching"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊ່ອງທາງສຳລັບການເຮັດ Live Patching"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:2
msgid ""
"A reboot is required every time you update the full kernel package.  "
"Therefore, it is important that clients using Live Patching do not have "
"newer kernels available in the channels they are assigned to.  Clients using "
"live patching have updates for the running kernel in the live patching "
"channels."
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການບູດເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ (reboot) ທຸກໆ ຄັ້ງທີ່ເຈົ້າອັບເດດແພັກເກດເຄີນເນີນ (kernel) ແບບເຕັມ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຈຶ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ໄຄລເອັນທີ່ໃຊ້ Live Patching ຈະຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີເຄີນເນີນເວີຊັນໃໝ່ກວ່າຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ພວກມັນຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້. ໄຄລເອັນທີ່ໃຊ້ live patching ຈະມີການອັບເດດສຳລັບເຄີນເນີນທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງ live patching."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:3
msgid "There are two ways to manage channels for live patching:"
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີໃນການຈັດການຊ່ອງທາງສຳລັບ live patching:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Use content lifecycle management to clone the product tree and remove kernel "
"versions newer than the running one.  This procedure is explained in the "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#enhance-project-with-livepatching[].  "
"This is the recommended solution."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດເນື້ອຫາ (content lifecycle management) ເພື່ອໂຄລນ (clone) ຜັງຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ລຶບເຄີນເນີນເວີຊັນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າເວີຊັນທີ່ກຳລັງລັນຢູ່ອອກ. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#enhance-project-with-livepatching[]. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີແກ້ໄຂທີ່ແນະນຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Alternatively, use the `spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle` tool.  This "
"procedure is more manual and requires command line tools as well as the "
"{webui}.  This procedure is explained in this section for SLES{nbsp}15 SP5, "
"but it also works for SLE{nbsp}12 SP4 or later."
msgstr "ຫຼືອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື `spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle`. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ເປັນການເຮັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຫຼາຍກວ່າ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ ລວມເຖິງ {webui}. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນພາກນີ້ສຳລັບ SLES{nbsp}15 SP5, ແຕ່ມັນກໍໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບ SLE{nbsp}12 SP4 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່ານຳ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle for Live Patching"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle ສຳລັບ Live Patching"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:7
msgid ""
"spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle has been deprecated and will be removed "
"in an upcoming release. Users are advised to switch to the supported and "
"feature-rich Content Lifecycle Management (CLM) API instead."
msgstr "spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle ໄດ້ຖືກຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວ ແລະ ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກໃນເວີຊັນທີ່ຈະມາເຖິງ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຮັບການແນະນຳໃຫ້ປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ Content Lifecycle Management (CLM) API ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ ແລະ ມີຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນກວ່າແທນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Cloned vendor channels should be prefixed by ``dev`` for development, "
"``testing``, or ``prod`` for production.  In this procedure, you create a "
"``dev`` cloned channel and then promote the channel to ``testing``."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງເວນເດີ (vendor) ທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນຄວນມີຄຳນຳໜ້າວ່າ ``dev`` ສຳລັບການພັດທະນາ, ``testing``, ຫຼື ``prod`` ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານຈິງ. ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້, ເຈົ້າຈະສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງ ທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນແບບ ``dev`` ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນຍົກລະດັບຊ່ອງທາງເປັນ ``testing``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Cloning Live Patching Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການໂໂຄລນຊ່ອງທາງ Live Patching"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:10
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the client, as root, obtain the current package "
"channel tree:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງໃນໄຄລເອັນ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ດຶງຜັງຊ່ອງທາງແພັກເກດປັດຈຸບັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle --list-channels\n"
"Spacewalk Username: admin\n"
"Spacewalk Password:\n"
"Channel tree:\n"
msgstr ""
"# spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle --list-channels\n"
"Spacewalk Username: admin\n"
"Spacewalk Password:\n"
"Channel tree:\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" 1. sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64\n"
"      \\__ sle-live-patching15-pool-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sle-live-patching15-updates-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sle-manager-tools15-pool-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sle-manager-tools15-updates-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sles15-{sp-vert}-updates-x86_64\n"
msgstr ""
" 1. sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64\n"
"      \\__ sle-live-patching15-pool-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sle-live-patching15-updates-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sle-manager-tools15-pool-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sle-manager-tools15-updates-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sles15-{sp-vert}-updates-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Use the [command]``spacewalk-manage-channel`` command with the "
"[option]``init`` argument to automatically create a new development clone of "
"the original vendor channel:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-manage-channel`` ພ້ອມກັບອາຄິວເມັ້ນ (argument) [option]``init`` ເພື່ອສ້າງໂຄລນການພັດທະນາໃໝ່ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງເວນເດີຕົ້ນສະບັບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle --init -c sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle --init -c sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Check that [systemitem]``dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-updates-x86_64`` is available "
"in your channel list."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າ [systemitem]``dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-updates-x86_64`` ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນລາຍການຊ່ອງທາງຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Check the ``dev`` cloned channel you created, and remove any kernel updates "
"that require a reboot."
msgstr "ກວດສອບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນແບບ ``dev`` ທີ່ເຈົ້າສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ແລະ ລຶບການອັບເດດເຄີນເນີນໃດໆ ທີ່ຕ້ອງການການບູດເຄື່ອງໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Removing Non-Live Kernel Patches from Cloned Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລຶບແພັດເຄີນເນີນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ Live Patch ອອກຈາກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Check the current kernel version by selecting the client from "
"menu:Systems[System List], and taking note of the version displayed in the "
"[guimenu]``Kernel`` field."
msgstr "ກວດສອບເວີຊັນເຄີນເນີນປັດຈຸບັນໂດຍການເລືອກໄຄລເອັນຈາກເມນູ:Systems[System List], ແລະ ຈົດບັນທຶກເວີຊັນທີ່ສະແດງໃນຟິວ [guimenu]``Kernel``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, select the client from menu:Systems[Overview], "
"navigate to the menu:Software[Manage > Channels] tab, and select "
"[systemitem]``dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-updates-x86_64``."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ເລືອກໄຄລເອັນຈາກເມນູ:Systems[Overview], ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ:Software[Manage > Channels], ແລະ ເລືອກ [systemitem]``dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-updates-x86_64``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Patches`` tab, and click btn:[List/Remove "
"Patches]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Patches``, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[List/Remove Patches]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:21
msgid ""
"In the search bar, type [systemitem]``kernel`` and identify the kernel "
"version that matches the kernel currently used by your client."
msgstr "ໃນແຖບຄົ້ນຫາ, ໃຫ້ພິມ [systemitem]``kernel`` ແລະ ລະບຸເວີຊັນເຄີນເນີນທີ່ກົງກັບເຄີນເນີນທີ່ໄຄລເອັນຂອງເຈົ້າກຳລັງໃຊ້ຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Remove all kernel versions that are newer than the currently installed "
"kernel."
msgstr "ລຶບເວີຊັນເຄີນເນີນທັງໝົດທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າເຄີນເນີນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Your channel is now set up for live patching, and can be promoted to "
"``testing``.  In this procedure, you also add the live patching child "
"channels to your client, ready to be applied."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງເຈົ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ live patching ແລ້ວ, ແລະ ສາມາດຍົກລະດັບເປັນ ``testing`` ໄດ້. ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້, ເຈົ້າຍັງໄດ້ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງລູກ (child channels) ຂອງ live patching ໃຫ້ກັບໄຄລເອັນຂອງເຈົ້າ, ເພື່ອພ້ອມສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Promoting Live Patching Channels"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍົກລະດັບຊ່ອງທາງ Live Patching"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:25
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the client, as `root`, promote and clone the "
"`dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64` channel to a new ``testing`` channel:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງໃນໄຄລເອັນ, ໃນຖານະ `root`, ໃຫ້ຍົກລະດັບ ແລະ ໂຄລນຊ່ອງທາງ `dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64` ໄປຍັງຊ່ອງທາງ ``testing`` ໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle --promote -c "
"dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64\n"
msgstr "# spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle --promote -c dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, select the client from menu:Systems[Overview], "
"and navigate to the menu:Software[Software Channels] tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ເລືອກໄຄລເອັນຈາກເມນູ:Systems[Overview], ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ:Software[Software Channels]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Check the new [systemitem]``test-sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64`` custom "
"channel to change the base channel, and check both corresponding live "
"patching child channels."
msgstr "ກວດສອບຊ່ອງທາງແບບກຳນົດເອງ [systemitem]``test-sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64`` ໃໝ່ ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (base channel), ແລະ ກວດສອບທັງສອງຊ່ອງທາງລູກຂອງ live patching ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Next], confirm that the details are correct, and click "
"btn:[Confirm] to save the changes."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Next], ຢືນຢັນວ່າລາຍລະອຽດຖືກຕ້ອງ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Confirm] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:30
msgid ""
"You can now select and view available CVE patches, and apply these important "
"kernel updates with Live Patching."
msgstr "ດຽວນີ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກ ແລະ ເບິ່ງແພັດ CVE ທີ່ມີໃຫ້, ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ການອັບເດດເຄີນເນີນທີ່ສຳຄັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ດ້ວຍ Live Patching."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live Patching on SLES{nbsp}12"
msgstr "Live Patching ເທິງ SLES{nbsp}12"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:2
msgid ""
"On SLES{nbsp}12 systems, live patching is managed by kGraft.  For in depth "
"information covering kGraft use, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/html/SLES-all/cha-kgraft.html."
msgstr "ໃນລະບົບ SLES{nbsp}12, live patching ແມ່ນຈັດການໂດຍ kGraft. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ kGraft, ເບິ່ງ https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/html/SLES-all/cha-kgraft.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:3
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:3
msgid "Before you begin, ensure:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ເຈົ້າຈະເລີ່ມ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:4
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:4
msgid "{productname} is fully updated."
msgstr "{productname} ໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດຄົບຖ້ວນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:5
msgid "You have one or more Salt clients running SLES{nbsp}12 (SP1 or later)."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າມີ Salt clients ໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກເທິງ SLES{nbsp}12 (SP1 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:6
msgid "Your SLES{nbsp}12 Salt clients are registered with {productname}."
msgstr "Salt clients ຂອງ SLES{nbsp}12 ຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You have access to the SLES{nbsp}12 channels appropriate for your "
"architecture, including the live patching child channel (or channels)."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງ SLES{nbsp}12 ທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງເຈົ້າ, ລວມເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງລູກຂອງ live patching."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:8
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:8
msgid "The clients are fully synchronized."
msgstr "ໄຄລເອັນໄດ້ຮັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຢ່າງຄົບຖ້ວນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:9
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:9
msgid "Assign the clients to the cloned channels prepared for live patching."
msgstr "ກຳນົດໄຄລເອັນໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຖືກໂຄລນເຊິ່ງກຽມໄວ້ສຳລັບ live patching."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:10
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:10
msgid ""
"For more information on preparation, see "
"xref:administration:live-patching-channel-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການກຽມຕົວ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:live-patching-channel-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:11
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up for Live Patching"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ Live Patching"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Select the client you want to manage with Live Patching from "
"menu:Systems[Overview], and on the system details page navigate to the "
"menu:Software[Packages > Install] tab."
msgstr "ເລືອກໄຄລເອັນທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຈັດການດ້ວຍ Live Patching ຈາກເມນູ:Systems[Overview], ແລະ ໃນໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດລະບົບ ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ:Software[Packages > Install]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:13
msgid "Search for the [systemitem]``kgraft`` package, and install it."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາແພັກເກດ [systemitem]``kgraft``, ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງມັນ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "enable_live_patching_kgraft_install.png"
msgstr "enable_live_patching_kgraft_install.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:15
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:15
msgid "Apply the highstate to enable Live Patching, and reboot the client."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ highstate ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ Live Patching, ແລະ ບູດໄຄລເອັນໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:16
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:16
msgid "Repeat for each client that you want to manage with Live Patching."
msgstr "ເຮັດຊ້ຳຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໄຄລເອັນທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຈັດການດ້ວຍ Live Patching."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:17
msgid ""
"To check that live patching has been enabled correctly, select the client "
"from menu:Systems[System List], and ensure that [systemitem]``Live "
"Patching`` appears in the [guimenu]``Kernel`` field."
msgstr "ເພື່ອວວດສອບວ່າ live patching ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກໄຄລເອັນຈາກເມນູ:Systems[System List], ແລະ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ [systemitem]``Live Patching`` ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນຟິວ [guimenu]``Kernel``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:18
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying Live Patches to a Kernel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ Live Patches ໃຫ້ກັບເຄີນເນີນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:19
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:19
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, select the client from menu:Systems[Overview]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໃຫ້ເລືອກໄຄລເອັນຈາກເມນູ:Systems[Overview]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:20
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:20
msgid ""
"A banner at the top of the screen shows the number of critical and "
"non-critical packages available for the client."
msgstr "ປ້າຍປະກາດຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍຈະສະແດງຈຳນວນແພັກເກດທີ່ສຳຄັນ ແລະ ບໍ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບໄຄລເອັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:21
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:21
msgid "Click btn:[Critical] to see a list of the available critical patches."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Critical] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ແພັດທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ມີໃຫ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:22
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Select any patch with a synopsis reading [guimenu]``Important: Security "
"update for the Linux kernel``."
msgstr "ເລືອກແພັດໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ມີຄຳອະທິບາຍຫຍໍ້ວ່າ [guimenu]``Important: Security update for the Linux kernel``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:23
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:23
msgid "Security bugs also include their CVE number, where applicable."
msgstr "ບັກດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພຍັງລວມເຖິງເລກ CVE ຂອງພວກມັນນຳ, ຫາກມີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:24
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:24
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: If you know the CVE number of a patch you want to apply, you can "
"search for it in menu:Audit[CVE Audit], and apply the patch to any clients "
"that require it."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ຫາກເຈົ້າຮູ້ເລກ CVE ຂອງແພັດທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາໄດ້ໃນ ເມນູ:Audit[CVE Audit], ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ແພັດກັບໄຄລເອັນໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການມັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:25
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Not all kernel patches are Live Patches.  Non-Live kernel patches are "
"represented by a `Reboot Required` icon located next to the `Security` "
"shield icon.  These patches always require a reboot."
msgstr "ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກແພັດເຄີນເນີນຈະເປັນ Live Patches. ແພັດເຄີນເນີນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ Live Patch ຈະຖືກສະແດງດ້ວຍໄອຄອນ `Reboot Required` ທີ່ຢູ່ຂ້າງໄອຄອນຮູບໂລ້ `Security`. ແພັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງການການບູດເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ສະເໝີ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Not all security issues can be fixed by applying a live patch.  Some "
"security issues can only be fixed by applying a full kernel update and "
"require a reboot.  The assigned CVE numbers for these issues are not "
"included in live patches.  A CVE audit displays this requirement."
msgstr "ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກບັນຫາດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ຈະແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ live patch. ບາງບັນຫາດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ການອັບເດດເຄີນເນີນແບບເຕັມເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການການບູດເຄື່ອງໃໝ່. ເລກ CVE ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ບັນຫາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ລວມຢູ່ໃນ live patches. ການກວດສອບ CVE ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ກຳນົດນີ້."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live Patching on SLES{nbsp}15"
msgstr "Live Patching ເທິງ SLES{nbsp}15"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:2
msgid ""
"On SLES{nbsp}15 systems and newer, live patching is managed by the "
"[systemitem]``klp livepatch`` tool."
msgstr "ໃນລະບົບ SLES{nbsp}15 ແລະ ໃໝ່ກວ່າ, live patching ແມ່ນຈັດການໂດຍເຄື່ອງມື [systemitem]``klp livepatch``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:5
msgid "You have one or more Salt clients running SLES{nbsp}15 (SP1 or later)."
msgstr "ທ່ານມີລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ໜຶ່ງເຄື່ອງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ SLES{nbsp}15 (SP1 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:6
msgid "Your SLES{nbsp}15 Salt clients are registered with {productname}."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍ SLES{nbsp}15 Salt ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You have access to the SLES{nbsp}15 channels appropriate for your "
"architecture, including the live patching child channel (or channels)."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງ SLES{nbsp}15 ທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງທ່ານ, ລວມທັງຊ່ອງທາງລູກ (child channel) ຂອງ live patching."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Select the client you want to manage with Live Patching from "
"menu:Systems[Overview], and navigate to the menu:Software[Packages > "
"Install] tab."
msgstr "ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການດ້ວຍ Live Patching ຈາກ menu:Systems[Overview], ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບ menu:Software[Packages > Install]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:13
msgid "Search for the [systemitem]``kernel-livepatch`` package, and install it."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາແພັກເກັດ [systemitem]``kernel-livepatch``, ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງມັນ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "enable_live_patching_kernel_live_install.png"
msgstr "enable_live_patching_kernel_live_install.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:17
msgid ""
"To check that live patching has been enabled correctly, select the client "
"from menu:Systems[System List], and ensure that [systemitem]``Live Patch`` "
"appears in the [guimenu]``Kernel`` field."
msgstr "ເພື່ອທົດສອບວ່າ live patching ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່, ໃຫ້ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍຈາກ menu:Systems[System List], ແລະ ກວດເບິ່ງໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ [systemitem]``Live Patch`` ປາກົດຢູ່ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Kernel``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Not all security issues can be fixed by applying a live patch.  Some "
"security issues can only be fixed by applying a full kernel update and "
"requires a reboot.  The assigned CVE numbers for these issues are not "
"included in live patches.  A CVE audit displays this requirement."
msgstr "ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກໆບັນຫາຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ຈະສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ດ້ວຍການໃຊ້ live patch. ບາງບັນຫາຄວາມປອດໄພສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການອັບເດດ kernel ແບບເຕັມຮູບແບບເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ມີການ restart ເຄື່ອງໃໝ່. ເລກ CVE ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບບັນຫາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນ live patches. ການກວດສອບ CVE ຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນເຖິງຄວາມຕ້ອງການນີ້."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live Patching with {productname}"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ Live Patching ດ້ວຍ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Performing a kernel update usually requires a system reboot.  Common "
"vulnerability and exposure (CVE) patches should be applied as soon as "
"possible, but if you cannot afford the downtime, you can use Live Patching "
"to inject these important updates and skip the need to reboot."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ການອັບເດດ kernel ຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ມີການ restart ລະບົບໃໝ່. ແພັດແກ້ໄຂຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ (CVE) ຄວນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃຫ້ໄວທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະໄວໄດ້, ແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງລະບົບໄດ້, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Live Patching ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງການອັບເດດທີ່ສຳຄັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງ restart ເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The procedure for setting up Live Patching is slightly different for "
"SLES{nbsp}12 and SLES{nbsp}15.  Both procedures are documented in this "
"section."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Live Patching ສຳລັບ SLES{nbsp}12 ແລະ SLES{nbsp}15 ແມ່ນມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງກັນເລັກນ້ອຍ. ເຊິ່ງທັງສອງຂັ້ນຕອນໄດ້ຖືກອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນນີ້."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maintenance Windows"
msgstr "ຊ່ວງເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The maintenance windows feature in {productname} allows you to schedule "
"actions to occur during a scheduled maintenance window period.  When you "
"have created your maintenance window schedule, and applied it to a client, "
"you are prevented from executing some actions outside of the specified "
"period."
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດຊ່ວງເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (maintenance windows) ໃນ {productname} ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດເວລາການດຳເນີນການຕ່າງໆໃຫ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ວາງແຜນໄວ້. ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງຕາຕະລາງຊ່ວງເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດດຳເນີນການບາງຢ່າງຢູ່ນອກຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ນັ້ນໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Maintenance windows operate in a different way to system locking.  System "
"locks are switched on or off as required, while maintenance windows define "
"periods of time when actions are allowed.  Additionally, the allowed and "
"restricted actions differ.  For more information about system locks, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-locking.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຊ່ວງເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາເຮັດວຽກແຕກຕ່າງຈາກການລັອກລະບົບ (system locking). ການລັອກລະບົບແມ່ນການເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ງານຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຊ່ວງເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາແມ່ນການກຳນົດຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການໄດ້. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ລາຍການການດຳເນີນການທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ ແລະ ທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດກໍມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລັອກລະບົບ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:system-locking.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Maintenance windows require both a calendar, and a schedule.  The calendar "
"defines the date and time of your maintenance window events, including "
"recurring events, and must be in [path]``ical`` format.  The schedule uses "
"the events defined in the calendar to create the maintenance windows.  You "
"must create an [path]``ical`` file for upload, or link to an [path]``ical`` "
"file to create the calendar, before you can create the schedule."
msgstr "ຊ່ວງເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາຕ້ອງມີທັງປະຕິທິນ ແລະ ຕາຕະລາງ. ປະຕິທິນຈະກຳນົດວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາຂອງເຫດການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ, ລວມທັງເຫດການທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນຊ້ຳ, ແລະ ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ [path]``ical``. ຕາຕະລາງຈະໃຊ້ເຫດການທີ່ກຳນົດໃນປະຕິທິນເພື່ອສ້າງຊ່ວງເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ [path]``ical`` ເພື່ອອັບໂຫລດ ຫຼື ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາໄຟລ໌ [path]``ical`` ເພື່ອສ້າງປະຕິທິນກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສ້າງຕາຕະລາງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:5
msgid ""
"When you have created the schedule, you can assign it to clients that are "
"registered to the {productname} Server.  Clients that have a maintenance "
"schedule assigned cannot run restricted actions outside of maintenance "
"windows."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງຕາຕະລາງແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດມັນໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} Server ໄດ້. ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ມີການກຳນົດຕາຕະລາງບຳລຸງຮັກສາຈະບໍ່ສາມາດດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດຢູ່ນອກຊ່ວງເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Restricted actions significantly modify the client, and could potentially "
"cause the client to stop running.  Some examples of restricted actions are:"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດແມ່ນການປ່ຽນແປງລູກຂ່າຍຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ ແລະ ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍຢຸດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດມີຄື:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:7
msgid "Package installation"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:8
msgid "Client upgrade"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:9
msgid "Product migration"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນ (Product migration)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:10
msgid "Highstate application"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ Highstate"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Unrestricted actions are minor actions that are considered safe and are "
"unlikely to cause problems on the client.  Some examples of unrestricted "
"actions are:"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຈຳກັດແມ່ນການດຳເນີນການເລັກນ້ອຍທີ່ຖືວ່າປອດໄພ ແລະ ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາກັບລູກຂ່າຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງມີຄື:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:12
msgid "Package profile update"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດໂປຣໄຟລ໌ແພັກເກັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:13
msgid "Hardware refresh"
msgstr "ການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຮາດແວໃໝ່ (Hardware refresh)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:14
msgid "Subscribing to software channels"
msgstr "ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Before you begin, you must create an [path]``ical`` file for upload, or link "
"to an [path]``ical`` file to create the calendar.  You can create "
"[path]``ical`` files in your preferred calendaring tool, such as Microsoft "
"Outlook, Google Calendar, or KOrganizer."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ [path]``ical`` ເພື່ອອັບໂຫລດ ຫຼື ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາໄຟລ໌ [path]``ical`` ເພື່ອສ້າງປະຕິທິນ. ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໄຟລ໌ [path]``ical`` ໄດ້ໃນເຄື່ອງມືປະຕິທິນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ ເຊັ່ນ Microsoft Outlook, Google Calendar, ຫຼື KOrganizer."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Uploading a New Maintenance Calendar"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບໂຫລດປະຕິທິນບຳລຸງຮັກສາໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows "
"> Calendars], and click btn:[Create]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows > Calendars], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:18
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Calendar Name`` section, type a name for your calendar."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Calendar Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບປະຕິທິນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Either provide a URL to your [path]``ical`` file, or upload the file "
"directly."
msgstr "ລະບຸ URL ໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ [path]``ical`` ຂອງທ່ານ ຫຼື ອັບໂຫລດໄຟລ໌ໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:20
msgid "Click btn:[Create Calendar] to save your calendar."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Calendar] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກປະຕິທິນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a New Schedule"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຕາຕະລາງໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:22
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:45
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows "
"> Schedules], and click btn:[Create]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows > Schedules], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:23
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Schedule Name`` section, type a name for your schedule."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Schedule Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບຕາຕະລາງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:24
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: If your [path]``ical`` file contains events that apply to more "
"than one schedule, check [guimenu]``Multi``."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ຖ້າໄຟລ໌ [path]``ical`` ຂອງທ່ານມີເຫດການທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງຕາຕະລາງ, ໃຫ້ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ [guimenu]``Multi``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:25
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:49
msgid "Select the calendar to assign to this schedule."
msgstr "ເລືອກປະຕິທິນທີ່ຈະກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຕາຕະລາງນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:26
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:50
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:55
msgid "Click btn:[Create Schedule] to save your schedule."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Schedule] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກຕາຕະລາງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning a Schedule to a Client"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດຕາຕະລາງໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:28
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List], select "
"the client to be assigned to a schedule, locate the [guimenu]``System "
"Properties`` panel, and click btn:[Edit These Properties]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Systems List], ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕ້ອງການກຳນົດຕາຕະລາງ, ຊອກຫາແຖບ [guimenu]``System Properties``, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Edit These Properties]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can assign clients through the system set manager by "
"navigating to menu:Systems[System Set Manager] and using the "
"menu:Misc[Maintenance Windows] tab."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນີ້, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດລູກຂ່າຍຜ່ານ system set manager ໄດ້ໂດຍໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System Set Manager] ແລະ ໃຊ້ແຖບ menu:Misc[Maintenance Windows]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:30
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Edit System Details`` page, locate the "
"[guimenu]``Maintenance Schedule`` field, and select the name of the schedule "
"to be assigned."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``Edit System Details``, ຊອກຫາຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Maintenance Schedule``, ແລະ ເລືອກຊື່ຕາຕະລາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການກຳນົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:31
msgid "Click btn:[Update Properties] to assign the maintenance schedule."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Update Properties] ເພື່ອໝາຍກຳນົດຕາຕະລາງບຳລຸງຮັກສາ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:32
msgid ""
"When you assign a new maintenance schedule to a client, it is possible that "
"the client might already have some restricted actions scheduled, and that "
"these might now conflict with the new maintenance schedule.  If this occurs, "
"the {webui} displays an error and you cannot assign the schedule to the "
"client.  To resolve this, check the btn:[Cancel affected actions] option "
"when you assign the schedule.  This cancels any previously scheduled actions "
"that conflict with the new maintenance schedule."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານກຳນົດຕາຕະລາງບຳລຸງຮັກສາໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍ, ເປັນໄປໄດ້ວ່າລູກຂ່າຍອາດຈະມີການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດບາງຢ່າງທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ກ່ອນແລ້ວ, ແລະ ເຫດການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະຂັດແຍ້ງກັບຕາຕະລາງໃໝ່. ຖ້າເກີດເຫດການນີ້, {webui} ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ, ໃຫ້ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ທາງເລືອກ btn:[Cancel affected actions] ເມື່ອກຳນົດຕາຕະລາງ. ນີ້ຈະເປັນການຍົກເລີກການດຳເນີນການໃດໆທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ທີ່ຂັດແຍ້ງກັບຕາຕະລາງບຳລຸງຮັກສາໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:33
msgid ""
"When you have created your maintenance windows, you can schedule restricted "
"actions, such as package upgrades, to be performed during the maintenance "
"window."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງຊ່ວງເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດເວລາການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ ເຊັ່ນ ການອັບເກຣດແພັກເກັດ ໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໃນຊ່ວງເວລານັ້ນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Scheduling a Package Upgrade"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດເວລາອັບເກຣດແພັກເກັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:35
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List], select "
"the client you want to upgrade, and go to the menu:Software[Packages > "
"Upgrade] tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System List], ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການອັບເກຣດ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບ menu:Software[Packages > Upgrade]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Select the package to upgrade from the list, and click btn:[Upgrade "
"Packages]."
msgstr "ເລືອກແພັກເກັດທີ່ຕ້ອງການອັບເກຣດຈາກລາຍການ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Upgrade Packages]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:37
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Maintenance Window`` field, select which maintenance "
"window the client should use to perform the upgrade."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Maintenance Window``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ວງເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍຄວນໃຊ້ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການອັບເກຣດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:38
msgid "Click btn:[Confirm] to schedule the package upgrade."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Confirm] ເພື່ອກຳນົດເວລາການອັບເກຣດແພັກເກັດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maintenance Schedule Types"
msgstr "ປະເພດຕາຕະລາງບຳລຸງຮັກສາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:40
msgid ""
"When you create a calendar, it contains a number of events, which can be "
"either one-time events, or recurring events.  Each event contains a "
"``summary`` field.  If you want to create multiple maintenance schedules for "
"one calendar, you can specify events for each using the ``summary`` field."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງປະຕິທິນ, ມັນຈະມີເຫດການຕ່າງໆ ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເປັນເຫດການຄັ້ງດຽວ ຫຼື ເຫດການທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນຊ້ຳ. ແຕ່ລະເຫດການຈະມີຫ້ອງ ``summary``. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງຫຼາຍຕາຕະລາງບຳລຸງຮັກສາສຳລັບປະຕິທິນດຽວ, ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸເຫດການສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຕາຕະລາງໂດຍໃຊ້ຫ້ອງ ``summary``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:41
msgid ""
"For example, you might like to create a schedule for production servers, and "
"a different schedule for testing servers.  In this case, you would specify "
"``SUMMARY: Production Servers`` on events for the production servers, and "
"``SUMMARY: Testing Servers`` on events for the testing servers."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການສ້າງຕາຕະລາງສຳລັບເຊີບເວີໃຊ້ງານຈິງ (production) ແລະ ອີກຕາຕະລາງໜຶ່ງສຳລັບເຊີບເວີທົດສອບ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ທ່ານຈະລະບຸ ``SUMMARY: Production Servers`` ໃນເຫດການສຳລັບເຊີບເວີໃຊ້ງານຈິງ, ແລະ ``SUMMARY: Testing Servers`` ໃນເຫດການສຳລັບເຊີບເວີທົດສອບ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "maint_windows_multi.png"
msgstr "maint_windows_multi.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:43
msgid ""
"There are two types of schedule: single, or multi.  If your calendar "
"contains events that apply to more than one schedule, then you must select "
"``multi``, and ensure you name the schedule according to the ``summary`` "
"field you used in the calendar file."
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງມີສອງປະເພດຄື: ແບບດ່ຽວ (single) ຫຼື ແບບຫຼາຍອັນ (multi). ຖ້າປະຕິທິນຂອງທ່ານມີເຫດການທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງຕາຕະລາງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເລືອກ ``multi``, ແລະ ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຊື່ຕາຕະລາງໃຫ້ກົງກັບຫ້ອງ ``summary`` ທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ປະຕິທິນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Multi Schedule"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຕາຕະລາງແບບຫຼາຍອັນ (Multi Schedule)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:46
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Schedule Name`` section, type the name for your schedule."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Schedule Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບຕາຕະລາງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:47
msgid "Ensure it matches the ``summary`` field of the calendar."
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນກົງກັບຫ້ອງ ``summary`` ຂອງປະຕິທິນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:48
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:54
msgid "Check the [guimenu]``Multi`` option."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ທາງເລືອກ [guimenu]``Multi``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:51
msgid "To create the next schedule, click btn:[Create]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງຕາຕະລາງຖັດໄປ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:52
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Schedule Name`` section, type the name for your second "
"schedule."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Schedule Name``, ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບຕາຕະລາງທີສອງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:53
msgid "Ensure it matches the ``summary`` field of the second calendar."
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນກົງກັບຫ້ອງ ``summary`` ຂອງປະຕິທິນທີສອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:56
msgid "Repeat for each schedule you need to create."
msgstr "ເຮັດຊ້ຳຄືນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຕາຕະລາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restricted and Unrestricted Actions"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ ແລະ ບໍ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:58
msgid ""
"This sections contains a complete list of restricted and unrestricted "
"actions."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍລາຍການທັງໝົດຂອງການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ ແລະ ບໍ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Restricted actions significantly modify the client, and could potentially "
"cause the client to stop running.  Restricted actions can only be run during "
"a maintenance window.  The restricted actions are:"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດແມ່ນການປ່ຽນແປງລູກຂ່າຍຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ ແລະ ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍຢຸດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໃນຊ່ວງເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ການດຳເນີນການເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນມີຄື:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:60
msgid "Package operations (for example, installing, updating, or removing packages)"
msgstr "ການຈັດການແພັກເກັດ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ການອັບເດດ, ຫຼື ການລຶບແພັກເກັດ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:61
msgid "Patch updates"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດແພັດ (Patch updates)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:62
msgid "Rebooting a client"
msgstr "ການ Restart ລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:63
msgid "Rolling back transactions"
msgstr "ການຍ້ອນກັບທຸລະກຳ (Rolling back transactions)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:64
msgid "Configuration management changing tasks"
msgstr "ວຽກງານການປ່ຽນແປງການຈັດການຄອນຟິກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:65
msgid "Applying a highstate"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ Highstate"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:66
msgid "Autoinstallation and reinstallation"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ການຕິດຕັ້ງຄືນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:67
msgid "Remote commands"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກ (Remote commands)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:68
msgid "Product migrations"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນ (Product migrations)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:69
msgid "Cluster operations"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການຂອງຄລັສເຕີ (Cluster operations)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:70
msgid ""
"It is possible to run remote commands directly at any time by navigating to "
"menu:Salt[Remote Commands].  This applies whether or not the client is in a "
"maintenance window.  For more information about remote commands, see "
"xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສັ່ງການຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຕະຫຼອດເວລາໂດຍໄປທີ່ menu:Salt[Remote Commands]. ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ບໍ່ວ່າລູກຂ່າຍຈະຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາຫຼືບໍ່. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:71
msgid ""
"Unrestricted actions are minor actions that are considered safe and are "
"unlikely to cause problems on the client.  If an action is not restricted it "
"is, by definition, unrestricted, and can be run at any time."
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຈຳກັດແມ່ນການດຳເນີນການເລັກນ້ອຍທີ່ຖືວ່າປອດໄພ ແລະ ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາກັບລູກຂ່າຍ. ຖ້າການດຳເນີນການໃດບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຈຳກັດ, ກໍໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນເປັນການດຳເນີນການທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ ແລະ ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up a Client to Master Validation Fingerprint"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າລາຍນິ້ວມື (Fingerprint) ເພື່ອກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ Master"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In highly secure network configurations you may wish to ensure your {salt} "
"clients are connecting a specific master.  To set up validation from client "
"to master start by entering the master's fingerprint within a {salt} minion "
"configuration file:"
msgstr "ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ມີຄວາມປອດໄພສູງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ຂອງທ່ານກຳລັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ Master ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຈາກລູກຂ່າຍໄປຫາ Master, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການໃສ່ລາຍນິ້ວມື (fingerprint) ຂອງ Master ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ຄອນຟິກຂອງ {salt} minion:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:3
msgid ""
"[path]``/etc/salt/minion.d/custom.conf`` in cases of using classic {salt} "
"minion in your client, or"
msgstr "[path]``/etc/salt/minion.d/custom.conf`` ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ໃຊ້ {salt} minion ແບບຄລາສສິກໃນລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ຫຼື"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:4
msgid ""
"[path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/custom.conf`` in case of using {salt} "
"Bundle in your client"
msgstr "[path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/custom.conf`` ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ໃຊ້ {salt} Bundle ໃນລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:5
msgid "and follow the procedure:"
msgstr "ແລະ ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:6
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:3
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:6
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:3
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To access a shell inside the Server container run [literal]``mgrctl term`` "
"on the container host."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ shell ພາຍໃນ Server container ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [literal]``mgrctl term`` ເທິງ container host."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Master's Fingerprint to Client"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມລາຍນິ້ວມືຂອງ Master ໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On the master, at the command prompt, as root, use this command to find the "
"``master.pub`` fingerprint:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ Master, ໃນ command prompt, ດ້ວຍສິດ root, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອຊອກຫາລາຍນິ້ວມືຂອງ ``master.pub``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-key -F master\n"
msgstr "salt-key -F master\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:10
msgid ""
"On your client, open the [path]``/etc/salt/minion.d/custom.conf`` or "
"[path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/custom.conf`` configuration file.  "
"Add this line to enter the master's fingerprint replacing the example "
"fingerprint:"
msgstr "ໃນລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ຄອນຟິກ [path]``/etc/salt/minion.d/custom.conf`` ຫຼື [path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/custom.conf``. ແລ້ວເພີ່ມແຖວນີ້ເພື່ອໃສ່ລາຍນິ້ວມືຂອງ Master ໂດຍປ່ຽນແທນລາຍນິ້ວມືຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "master_finger: 'ba:30:65:2a:d6:9e:20:4f:d8:b2:f3:a7:d4:65:11:13'\n"
msgstr "master_finger: 'ba:30:65:2a:d6:9e:20:4f:d8:b2:f3:a7:d4:65:11:13'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:12
msgid "Restart the service.  For salt-minion, run:"
msgstr "Restart ບໍລິການໃໝ່. ສຳລັບ salt-minion, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:13
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:14
msgid "Or, for venv-salt-minion, run:"
msgstr "ຫຼື, ສຳລັບ venv-salt-minion, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:15
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart venv-salt-minion\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart venv-salt-minion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For more information about {salt} Bundle, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {salt} Bundle, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For information on configuring security from a client, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/minion.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມປອດໄພຈາກລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/minion.html."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using ``mgr-sync``"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ ``mgr-sync``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The ``mgr-sync`` tool is used at the command prompt.  It provides functions "
"for using {productname} that are not always available in the {webui}.  The "
"primary use of ``mgr-sync`` is to connect to the {scclongform}, retrieve "
"product and package information, and prepare channels for synchronization "
"with the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື ``mgr-sync`` ແມ່ນໃຊ້ໃນ command prompt. ມັນມີຟັງຊັນສຳລັບການໃຊ້ {productname} ທີ່ບາງຄັ້ງບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ {webui}. ການໃຊ້ງານຫຼັກຂອງ ``mgr-sync`` ແມ່ນເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {scclongform}, ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ແພັກເກັດ, ແລະ ກຽມຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ສຳລັບການ synchronize ກັບ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This tool is designed for use with a {suse} support subscription.  It is not "
"required for open source distributions, including {opensuse}, {centos}, and "
"{ubuntu}."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscription) ຂອງ {suse}. ມັນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການແບບ open source ເຊັ່ນ {opensuse}, {centos}, ແລະ {ubuntu}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The available commands and arguments for ``mgr-sync`` are listed in this "
"table.  Use this syntax for ``mgr-sync`` commands:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ ແລະ ອາຄິວເມັນ (arguments) ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ ``mgr-sync`` ແມ່ນສະແດງຢູ່ໃນຕາຕະລາງນີ້. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ syntax ນີ້ສຳລັບຄຳສັ່ງ ``mgr-sync``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync [-h] [--version] [-v] [-s] [-d {1,2,3}] {list,add,refresh,delete}\n"
msgstr "mgr-sync [-h] [--version] [-v] [-s] [-d {1,2,3}] {list,add,refresh,delete}\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync Commands"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ mgr-sync"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Command | Description | Example Use\n"
"| list | List channels, organization credentials, or products | ``mgr-sync "
"list channels``\n"
"| add | Add channels, organization credentials, or products | ``mgr-sync add "
"channel <channel_name>``\n"
"| refresh | Refresh the local copy of products, channels, and subscriptions "
"| ``mgr-sync refresh``\n"
"| delete | Delete existing {scc} organization credentials from the local "
"system | ``mgr-sync delete credentials``\n"
"| sync | Synchronize specified channel or ask for it when left blank| "
"``mgr-sync sync channel <channel_name>``\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຄຳສັ່ງ | ຄຳອະທິບາຍ | ຕົວຢ່າງການໃຊ້\n"
"| list | ສະແດງລາຍການຊ່ອງທາງ, ຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນອົງກອນ, ຫຼື ຜະລິດຕະພັນ | ``mgr-sync list channels``\n"
"| add | ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງ, ຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນອົງກອນ, ຫຼື ຜະລິດຕະພັນ | ``mgr-sync add channel <channel_name>``\n"
"| refresh | ໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນຜະລິດຕະພັນ, ຊ່ອງທາງ, ແລະ ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໃນເຄື່ອງຄືນໃໝ່ | ``mgr-sync refresh``\n"
"| delete | ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນອົງກອນ {scc} ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບ | ``mgr-sync delete credentials``\n"
"| sync | Synchronize ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ລະບຸ ຫຼື ຖາມຫາຫາກປະວ່າງໄວ້ | ``mgr-sync sync channel <channel_name>``\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:8
msgid "To see the full list of options specific to a command, use this command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການທາງເລືອກທັງໝົດສະເພາະຂອງແຕ່ລະຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync <command> --help\n"
msgstr "mgr-sync <command> --help\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync Optional Arguments"
msgstr "ອາຄິວເມັນທາງເລືອກຂອງ mgr-sync"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option | Abbreviated option | Description | Example Use\n"
"| help | ``h`` | Display the command usage and options | ``mgr-sync "
"--help``\n"
"| version | N/A | Display the currently installed version of ``mgr-sync`` | "
"``mgr-sync --version``\n"
"| verbose | ``v`` | Provide verbose output | ``mgr-sync --verbose "
"refresh``\n"
"| store-credentials | ``s`` | Store credentials a local hidden file | "
"``mgr-sync --store-credentials``\n"
"| debug | ``d`` | Log additional debugging information. Requires a level of "
"1, 2, 3. 3 provides the highest amnount of debugging information | "
"``mgr-sync -d 3 refresh``\n"
"| no-sync | N/A | Use with the ``add`` command to add products or channels "
"without beginning a synchronization | ``mgr-sync --no-sync add "
"<channel_name>``\n"
msgstr ""
"| ທາງເລືອກ | ຕົວຫຍໍ້ | ຄຳອະທິບາຍ | ຕົວຢ່າງການໃຊ້\n"
"| help | ``h`` | ສະແດງການໃຊ້ງານຄຳສັ່ງ ແລະ ທາງເລືອກຕ່າງໆ | ``mgr-sync --help``\n"
"| version | N/A | ສະແດງເວີຊັນຂອງ ``mgr-sync`` ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ | ``mgr-sync --version``\n"
"| verbose | ``v`` | ສະແດງຜົນການເຮັດວຽກແບບລະອຽດ | ``mgr-sync --verbose refresh``\n"
"| store-credentials | ``s`` | ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຊ່ອນຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງ | ``mgr-sync --store-credentials``\n"
"| debug | ``d`` | ບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນການດີບັກເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ຕ້ອງການລະດັບ 1, 2, 3. ລະດັບ 3 ຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ | ``mgr-sync -d 3 refresh``\n"
"| no-sync | N/A | ໃຊ້ກັບຄຳສັ່ງ ``add`` ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຜະລິດຕະພັນ ຫຼື ຊ່ອງທາງໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເລີ່ມ synchronization | ``mgr-sync --no-sync add <channel_name>``\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:12
msgid "Logs for ``mgr-sync`` are located in:"
msgstr "Log ຂອງ ``mgr-sync`` ແມ່ນເກັບໄວ້ທີ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:13
msgid "[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-log/_data/rhn/mgr-sync.log``"
msgstr "[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-log/_data/rhn/mgr-sync.log``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:14
msgid "[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-log/_data/rhn/rhn_web_api.log``"
msgstr "[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-log/_data/rhn/rhn_web_api.log``"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mirror Source Packages"
msgstr "ການ Mirror ແພັກເກັດຊອດໂຄ້ດ (Source Packages)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you build your own packages locally, or if you require the source code "
"for your packages for legal reasons, it is possible to mirror the source "
"packages on {productname} Server."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານສ້າງແພັກເກັດຂອງທ່ານເອງໃນເຄື່ອງ, ຫຼື ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຊອດໂຄ້ດ (source code) ຂອງແພັກເກັດຍ້ອນເຫດຜົນທາງກົດໝາຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດ mirror ແພັກເກັດຊອດໂຄ້ດໄວ້ໃນ {productname} Server ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:3
msgid "Mirroring source packages can consume a significant amount of disk space."
msgstr "ການ mirror ແພັກເກັດຊອດໂຄ້ດອາດຈະໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ດິດເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Mirroring Source Packages"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການ Mirror ແພັກເກັດຊອດໂຄ້ດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Open the [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` configuration file, and add this "
"line:"
msgstr "ເປີດໄຟລ໌ຄອນຟິກ [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``, ແລະ ເພີ່ມແຖວນີ້ລົງໄປ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "server.sync_source_packages = 1\n"
msgstr "server.sync_source_packages = 1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:8
msgid "Restart the Spacewalk service to pick up the changes:"
msgstr "Restart ບໍລິການ Spacewalk ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Currently, this feature can only be enabled globally for all repositories.  "
"It is not possible to select individual repositories for mirroring."
msgstr "ໃນປະຈຸບັນ, ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນລະດັບສາກົນ (global) ສຳລັບທຸກໆ repository ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ບໍ່ສາມາດເລືອກ mirror ສະເພາະບາງ repository ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:11
msgid ""
"When this feature has been activated, the source packages become available "
"in the {productname} {webui} after the next repository synchronization.  "
"They are shown as sources for the binary package, and can be downloaded "
"directly from the {webui}.  Source packages cannot be installed on clients "
"using the {webui}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ແລ້ວ, ແພັກເກັດຊອດໂຄ້ດຈະສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ໃນ {productname} {webui} ຫຼັງຈາກການ synchronize repository ຄັ້ງຖັດໄປ. ພວກມັນຈະຖືກສະແດງເປັນຊອດໂຄ້ດສຳລັບ binary package ແລະ ສາມາດດາວໂຫລດໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກ {webui}. ແຕ່ແພັກເກັດຊອດໂຄ້ດບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໃນລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui} ໄດ້."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitoring with Prometheus and Grafana"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕາມ (Monitoring) ດ້ວຍ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can monitor your {productname} environment using Prometheus and "
"Grafana.  {productname} Server and Proxy are able to provide self-health "
"metrics.  You can also install and manage a number of Prometheus exporters "
"on Salt clients."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana. {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy ສາມາດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນ metrics ກ່ຽວກັບສຸຂະພາບຂອງລະບົບເອງໄດ້. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຈັດການ Prometheus exporters ຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງໃນລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Prometheus and Grafana packages are included in the {productname} Client "
"Tools for:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana ແມ່ນຖືກລວມຢູ່ໃນ {productname} Client Tools ສຳລັບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:9
msgid "{sle}{nbsp}15"
msgstr "{sle}{nbsp}15"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:6
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:10
msgid "{sle}{nbsp}16"
msgstr "{sle}{nbsp}16"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:7
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:11
msgid "openSUSE Leap 15.x"
msgstr "openSUSE Leap 15.x"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:8
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:12
msgid "openSUSE Leap 16.x"
msgstr "openSUSE Leap 16.x"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:13
msgid "Only the above listed clients are supported as a monitoring server."
msgstr "ສະເພາະລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຮອງຮັບການເປັນ monitoring server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:14
msgid ""
"You need to install Prometheus and Grafana on a machine separate from the "
"{productname} Server.  We recommend to use a managed Salt {suse} client as "
"your monitoring server."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ແຍກອອກຈາກ {productname} Server. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt {suse} ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການຢູ່ແລ້ວມາເປັນ monitoring server ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Prometheus fetches metrics using a pull mechanism, so the server must be "
"able to establish TCP connections to monitored clients.  Clients must have "
"corresponding open ports and be reachable over the network.  Alternatively, "
"you can use reverse proxies to establish a connection."
msgstr "Prometheus ຈະດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ metrics ໂດຍໃຊ້ກົນໄກ pull, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ server ຕ້ອງສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມໄດ້. ລູກຂ່າຍຕ້ອງເປີດພອດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ແລະ ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ. ຫຼື ທ່ານອາດຈະໃຊ້ reverse proxies ເພື່ອສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກໍໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:16
msgid ""
"You must have a monitoring add-on subscription for each client you want to "
"monitor.  Visit the {scclongform} to manage your {productname} "
"subscriptions."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscription) monitoring add-on ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕາມ. ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ {scclongform} ເພື່ອຈັດການການສະໝັກໃຊ້ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prometheus and Grafana"
msgstr "Prometheus ແລະ Grafana"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prometheus"
msgstr "Prometheus"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Prometheus is an open-source monitoring tool that is used to record "
"real-time metrics in a time-series database.  Metrics are pulled via HTTP, "
"enabling high performance and scalability."
msgstr "Prometheus ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມືຕິດຕາມແບບ open-source ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອບັນທຶກ metrics ແບບ real-time ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນອະນຸກົມເວລາ (time-series database). ຂໍ້ມູນ metrics ຈະຖືກດຶງຜ່ານ HTTP, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງ ແລະ ສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍຕົວໄດ້ດີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Prometheus metrics are time series data, or timestamped values belonging to "
"the same group or dimension.  A metric is uniquely identified by its name "
"and set of labels."
msgstr "Prometheus metrics ແມ່ນຂໍ້ມູນອະນຸກົມເວລາ ຫຼື ຄ່າທີ່ມີການລະບຸເວລາ (timestamped) ເຊິ່ງຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມ ຫຼື ມິຕິດຽວກັນ. ແຕ່ລະ metric ຈະຖືກລະບຸດ້ວຍຊື່ ແລະ ຊຸດຂອງປ້າຍກຳກັບ (labels) ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ."

#.  TODO:: This should be an actual image.
#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   metric name               labels                 timestamp     value\n"
"┌────────┴───────┐  ┌───────────┴───────────┐    ┌──────┴──────┐  ┌─┴─┐\n"
"http_requests_total{status=\"200\", method=\"GET\"}  @1557331801.111  "
"42236\n"
msgstr ""
"   ຊື່ metric                ປ້າຍກຳກັບ              ວັນເວລາ        ຄ່າ\n"
"┌────────┴───────┐  ┌───────────┴───────────┐    ┌──────┴──────┐  ┌─┴─┐\n"
"http_requests_total{status=\"200\", method=\"GET\"}  @1557331801.111  42236\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Each application or system being monitored must expose metrics in the format "
"above, either through code instrumentation or Prometheus exporters."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ຫຼື ລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມ ຈະຕ້ອງສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນ metrics ໃນຮູບແບບຂ້າງເທິງ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຜ່ານທາງ code instrumentation ຫຼື ຜ່ານ Prometheus exporters."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prometheus exporters"
msgstr "Prometheus Exporters"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Exporters are libraries that help with exporting metrics from third-party "
"systems as Prometheus metrics.  Exporters are useful whenever it is not "
"feasible to instrument a given application or system with Prometheus metrics "
"directly.  Multiple exporters can run on a monitored host to export local "
"metrics."
msgstr "Exporters ແມ່ນໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃນການສົ່ງອອກ metrics ຈາກລະບົບພາຍນອກ (third-party) ໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ Prometheus metrics. Exporters ຈະມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດ metrics ໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ຫຼື ລະບົບນັ້ນໆໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ exporters ຫຼາຍຕົວໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມເພື່ອສົ່ງອອກ metrics ໃນເຄື່ອງນັ້ນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:25
msgid ""
"The Prometheus community provides a list of official exporters, and more can "
"be found as community contributions.  For more information and an extensive "
"list of exporters, see https://prometheus.io/docs/instrumenting/exporters/."
msgstr "ຊຸມຊົນ Prometheus ໄດ້ຈັດຕຽມລາຍການຂອງ exporters ຢ່າງເປັນທາງການໄວ້ໃຫ້, ແລະ ຍັງມີອີກຫຼາຍຕົວທີ່ມາຈາກການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຂອງຊຸມຊົນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ລາຍການ exporters ທັງໝົດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://prometheus.io/docs/instrumenting/exporters/."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Grafana"
msgstr "Grafana"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Grafana is a tool for data visualization, monitoring, and analysis.  It is "
"used to create dashboards with panels representing specific metrics over a "
"set period of time.  Grafana is commonly used together with Prometheus, but "
"also supports other data sources such as ElasticSearch, MySQL, PostgreSQL, "
"and Influx DB.  For more information about Grafana, see "
"https://grafana.com/docs/."
msgstr "Grafana ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມືສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນຂໍ້ມູນ (visualization), ການຕິດຕາມ, ແລະ ການວິເຄາະ. ມັນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງ dashboards ທີ່ມີແຜງ (panels) ສະແດງ metrics ທີ່ລະບຸໃນຊ່ວງເວລາໃດໜຶ່ງ. Grafana ມັກຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ Prometheus, ແຕ່ກໍຍັງຮອງຮັບແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ ElasticSearch, MySQL, PostgreSQL, ແລະ Influx DB. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Grafana, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://grafana.com/docs/."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up the monitoring server"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີຕິດຕາມກວດກາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:29
msgid ""
"To set up your monitoring server, you need to install Prometheus and "
"Grafana, and configure them."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ monitoring server ຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana, ພ້ອມທັງຕັ້ງຄ່າພວກມັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Only {suse} clients are supported as a monitoring server.  For a complete "
"list, see xref:administration:monitoring.adoc#monitoring-requirements[]."
msgstr "ສະເພາະລູກຂ່າຍ {suse} ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຮອງຮັບການເປັນ monitoring server. ສຳລັບລາຍການທັງໝົດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:monitoring.adoc#monitoring-requirements[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Prometheus"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:32
msgid ""
"If your monitoring server is a Salt client, you can install the Prometheus "
"package using the {productname} {webui}.  Otherwise you can download and "
"install the package on your monitoring server manually.  The Prometheus "
"software is also available for {productname} Proxy and {productname} {smr} "
"Branch Server."
msgstr "ຖ້າ monitoring server ຂອງທ່ານແມ່ນລູກຂ່າຍ Salt, ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ Prometheus ໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui}. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດດາວໂຫລດ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດໃນ monitoring server ຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ຊອບແວ Prometheus ຍັງມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ແລະ {productname} {smr} Branch Server ອີກດ້ວຍ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:33
msgid ""
"To access a shell inside the {productname} Server container run "
"[literal]``mgrctl term`` on the container host, or to execute one command "
"run [literal]``mgrctl exec <options> -- <command>``."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ Shell ພາຍໃນ {productname} Server container, ໃຫ້ລັນ [literal]``mgrctl term`` ຢູ່ເທິງ container host, ຫຼື ເພື່ອລັນຄຳສັ່ງດຽວໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [literal]``mgrctl exec <options> -- <command>``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:34
msgid ""
"To copy files from inside the container to the container host use "
"[literal]``mgrctl cp``."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຄັດລອກໄຟລ໌ຈາກພາຍໃນ container ມາຍັງ container host ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [literal]``mgrctl cp``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Prometheus expects POSIX filesystem for storing data.  Non-POSIX compliant "
"filesystems are not supported.  NFS filesystems are not supported."
msgstr "Prometheus ຕ້ອງການລະບົບໄຟລ໌ POSIX ສຳລັບການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ. ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ POSIX ແລະ ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ NFS ແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Prometheus using the {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:37
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, open the details page of the system where "
"Prometheus is to be installed, and navigate to the [guimenu]``Formulas`` "
"tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ເປີດໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດຂອງລະບົບທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Formulas``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Prometheus`` checkbox to enable monitoring formulas, "
"and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Prometheus`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ monitoring formulas, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:39
msgid "Navigate to the ``Prometheus`` tab in the top menu."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບ ``Prometheus`` ໃນເມນູດ້ານເທິງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:40
msgid ""
"In the ``{productname} Server`` section, enter valid {productname} API "
"credentials."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ ``{productname} Server``, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ (credentials) API ຂອງ {productname} ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Make sure that the credentials you have entered allow access to the set of "
"systems you want to monitor."
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ທ່ານໃສ່ນັ້ນ ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງກຸ່ມລະບົບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕາມໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:42
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:69
msgid "Customize any other configuration options according to your needs."
msgstr "ປັບແຕ່ງທາງເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າອື່ນໆ ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:43
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:70
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:154
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:187
msgid "Click btn:[Save Formula]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save Formula]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:44
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:71
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:188
msgid "Apply the highstate and confirm that it completes successfully."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ (Apply) highstate ແລະ ກວດສອບວ່າມັນສຳເລັດຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:45
msgid ""
"Check that the Prometheus interface loads correctly. In your browser, "
"navigate to the URL of the server where Prometheus is installed, on "
"port 9090 (for example, [literal]``http://example.com:9090``)."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງ Prometheus ໂຫຼດໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ URL ຂອງເຊີບເວີທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus ທີ່ພອດ 9090 (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [literal]``http://example.com:9090``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:46
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:95
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:161
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:189
msgid ""
"For more information about the monitoring formulas, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ monitoring formulas, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Manually installing and configuring Prometheus"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Prometheus ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:48
msgid ""
"On the monitoring server, install the "
"[package]``golang-github-prometheus-prometheus`` package:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ monitoring server, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ [package]``golang-github-prometheus-prometheus``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in golang-github-prometheus-prometheus\n"
msgstr "zypper in golang-github-prometheus-prometheus\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:50
msgid "Enable the Prometheus service:"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານບໍລິການ Prometheus:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl enable --now prometheus\n"
msgstr "systemctl enable --now prometheus\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:52
msgid ""
"Check that the Prometheus interface loads correctly.  In your browser, "
"navigate to the URL of the server where Prometheus is installed, on "
"port 9090 (for example, [literal]``http://example.com:9090``)."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າອິນເຕີເຟດຂອງ Prometheus ໂຫຼດໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ URL ຂອງເຊີເວີທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus, ທີ່ພອດ 9090 (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [literal]``http://example.com:9090``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:53
msgid ""
"Open the configuration file at [path]``/etc/prometheus/prometheus.yml`` and "
"add this configuration information.  Replace `server.url` with your "
"{productname} server URL and adjust `username` and `password` fields to "
"match your {productname} credentials."
msgstr "ເປີດໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ [path]``/etc/prometheus/prometheus.yml`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້. ປ່ຽນແທນ `server.url` ດ້ວຍ URL ຂອງ {productname} server ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ປັບຊ່ອງ `username` ແລະ `password` ໃຫ້ກົງກັບຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# {productname} self-health metrics\n"
"scrape_configs:\n"
"- job_name: 'mgr-server'\n"
"  static_configs:\n"
"    - targets:\n"
"      - 'server.url:9100'  # Node exporter\n"
"      - 'server.url:9187'  # PostgreSQL exporter\n"
"      - 'server.url:5556'  # JMX exporter (Tomcat)\n"
"      - 'server.url:5557'  # JMX exporter (Taskomatic)\n"
"      - 'server.url:9800'  # Taskomatic\n"
"    - targets:\n"
"      - 'server.url:80'    # Message queue\n"
"      labels:\n"
"        __metrics_path__: /rhn/metrics\n"
msgstr ""
"# {productname} self-health metrics\n"
"scrape_configs:\n"
"- job_name: 'mgr-server'\n"
"  static_configs:\n"
"    - targets:\n"
"      - 'server.url:9100'  # Node exporter\n"
"      - 'server.url:9187'  # PostgreSQL exporter\n"
"      - 'server.url:5556'  # JMX exporter (Tomcat)\n"
"      - 'server.url:5557'  # JMX exporter (Taskomatic)\n"
"      - 'server.url:9800'  # Taskomatic\n"
"    - targets:\n"
"      - 'server.url:80'    # Message queue\n"
"      labels:\n"
"        __metrics_path__: /rhn/metrics\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Managed systems metrics:\n"
"- job_name: 'mgr-clients'\n"
"  uyuni_sd_configs:\n"
"   - server: \"http://server.url\"\n"
"     username: \"admin\"\n"
"     password: \"admin\"\n"
"  relabel_configs:\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_exporter]\n"
"     target_label: exporter\n"
"   - source_labels: [__address__]\n"
"     replacement: \"No group\"\n"
"     target_label: groups\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_groups]\n"
"     regex: (.+)\n"
"     target_label: groups\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_minion_hostname]\n"
"     target_label: hostname\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_primary_fqdn]\n"
"     regex: (.+)\n"
"     target_label: hostname\n"
"   - source_labels: [hostname, __address__]\n"
"     regex: (.*);.*:(.*)\n"
"     replacement: ${1}:${2}\n"
"     target_label: __address__\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_metrics_path]\n"
"     regex: (.+)\n"
"     target_label: __metrics_path__\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_proxy_module]\n"
"     target_label: __param_module\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_scheme]\n"
"     target_label: __scheme__\n"
msgstr ""
"# Managed systems metrics:\n"
"- job_name: 'mgr-clients'\n"
"  uyuni_sd_configs:\n"
"   - server: \"http://server.url\"\n"
"     username: \"admin\"\n"
"     password: \"admin\"\n"
"  relabel_configs:\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_exporter]\n"
"     target_label: exporter\n"
"   - source_labels: [__address__]\n"
"     replacement: \"No group\"\n"
"     target_label: groups\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_groups]\n"
"     regex: (.+)\n"
"     target_label: groups\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_minion_hostname]\n"
"     target_label: hostname\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_primary_fqdn]\n"
"     regex: (.+)\n"
"     target_label: hostname\n"
"   - source_labels: [hostname, __address__]\n"
"     regex: (.*);.*:(.*)\n"
"     replacement: ${1}:${2}\n"
"     target_label: __address__\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_metrics_path]\n"
"     regex: (.+)\n"
"     target_label: __metrics_path__\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_proxy_module]\n"
"     target_label: __param_module\n"
"   - source_labels: [__meta_uyuni_scheme]\n"
"     target_label: __scheme__\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:56
msgid "Save the configuration file."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ຄອນຟິກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:57
msgid "Restart the Prometheus service:"
msgstr "Restart ບໍລິການ Prometheus ໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart prometheus\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart prometheus\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:59
msgid ""
"For more information about the Prometheus configuration options, see the "
"official Prometheus documentation at "
"https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/configuration/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບທາງເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ Prometheus, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານທາງການຂອງ Prometheus ທີ່ https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/configuration/."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Grafana"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Grafana"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:61
msgid ""
"If your monitoring server is a client managed by {productname}, you can "
"install the Grafana package using the {productname} {webui}.  Otherwise you "
"can download and install the package on your monitoring server manually."
msgstr "ຖ້າ monitoring server ຂອງທ່ານແມ່ນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກຈັດການໂດຍ {productname}, ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ Grafana ໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui}. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດດາວໂຫລດ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດໃນ monitoring server ຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:62
msgid "Grafana is not available on {productname} Proxy."
msgstr "Grafana ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ {productname} Proxy."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Grafana using the {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Grafana ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:64
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, open the details page of the system where "
"Grafana is to be installed, and navigate to the [guimenu]``Formulas`` tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ເປີດໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດຂອງລະບົບທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ Grafana, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Formulas``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:65
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Grafana`` checkbox to enable monitoring formulas, and "
"click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Grafana`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ monitoring formulas, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:66
msgid "Navigate to the ``Grafana`` tab in the top menu."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບ ``Grafana`` ໃນເມນູດ້ານເທິງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:67
msgid ""
"In the ``Enable and configure Grafana`` section, enter the admin credentials "
"you want to use to log in Grafana."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ ``Enable and configure Grafana``, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງ admin ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ Grafana."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:68
msgid ""
"On the ``Datasources`` section, make sure that the Prometheus URL field "
"points to the system where Prometheus is running."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ ``Datasources``, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຫ້ອງ Prometheus URL ຊີ້ໄປຫາລະບົບທີ່ Prometheus ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:72
msgid ""
"Check that the Grafana interface is loading correctly. In your browser, "
"navigate to the URL of the server where Grafana is installed, on port 3000 "
"(for example, [literal]``http://example.com:3000``)."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງ Grafana ໂຫຼດໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ URL ຂອງເຊີບເວີທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ Grafana ທີ່ພອດ 3000 (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [literal]``http://example.com:3000``)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:73
msgid "Ensure that port 3000 is open on the firewall to successfully access Grafana"
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພອດ 3000 ໄດ້ຖືກເປີດຢູ່ໃນ Firewall ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ Grafana ໄດ້ຢ່າງສຳເລັດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:74
msgid ""
"{productname} provides pre-built dashboards for server self-health, basic "
"client monitoring, and more.  You can choose which dashboards to provision "
"in the formula configuration page."
msgstr "{productname} ໄດ້ຈັດຕຽມ dashboards ທີ່ສ້າງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າສຳລັບການກວດສອບສຸຂະພາບຂອງເຊີບເວີ, ການຕິດຕາມລູກຂ່າຍຂັ້ນພື້ນຖານ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກ dashboards ທີ່ຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນໜ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າ formula."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Manually installing Grafana"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Grafana ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:76
msgid "Install the [package]``grafana`` package:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ [package]``grafana``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in grafana\n"
msgstr "zypper in grafana\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:78
msgid "Enable the Grafana service:"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານບໍລິການ Grafana:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl enable --now grafana-server\n"
msgstr "systemctl enable --now grafana-server\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:80
msgid ""
"In your browser, navigate to the URL of the server where Grafana is "
"installed, on port 3000 (for example, [literal]``http://example.com:3000``)."
msgstr "ໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ URL ຂອງເຊີບເວີທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ Grafana ທີ່ພອດ 3000 (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [literal]``http://example.com:3000``)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:81
msgid ""
"Ensure that port 3000 is open on the firewall to successfully access "
"Grafana."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພອດ 3000 ໄດ້ຖືກເປີດຢູ່ໃນ Firewall ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ Grafana ໄດ້ຢ່າງສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:82
msgid "On the login page, enter ``admin`` for username and password."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ ``admin`` ທັງ username ແລະ password."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:83
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Log in].  If login is successful, then you will see a prompt to "
"change the password."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Log in]. ຫາກເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບສຳເລັດ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃຫ້ປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:84
msgid "Click btn:[OK] on the prompt, then change your password."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[OK] ຢູ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ແລ້ວປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:85
msgid ""
"Move your cursor to the cog icon on the side menu which will show the "
"configuration options."
msgstr "ເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ໄປທີ່ໄອຄອນຮູບຟັນເຟືອງໃນເມນູດ້ານຂ້າງ ເພື່ອເບິ່ງທາງເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:86
msgid "Click btn:[Data sources]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Data sources]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:87
msgid "Click btn:[Add data source] to see a list of all supported data sources."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Add data source] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:88
msgid "Choose the Prometheus data source."
msgstr "ເລືອກແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ Prometheus."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:89
msgid "Make sure to specify the correct URL of the Prometheus server."
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ລະບຸ URL ຂອງ Prometheus server ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:90
msgid "Click btn:[Save & test]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save & test]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:91
msgid ""
"To import a dashboard click the btn:[+] icon in the side menu, and then "
"click btn:[Import]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອ import dashboard ໃຫ້ຄລິກໄອຄອນ btn:[+] ໃນເມນູດ້ານຂ້າງ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Import]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:92
msgid "For {productname} server overview load the dashboard ID: ``17569``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບພາບລວມຂອງ {productname} server ໃຫ້ໂຫຼດ dashboard ID: ``17569``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:93
msgid "For {productname} clients overview load the dashboard ID: ``17570``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບພາບລວມຂອງ {productname} clients ໃຫ້ໂຫຼດ dashboard ID: ``17570``."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "monitoring_grafana_example.png"
msgstr "monitoring_grafana_example.png"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:96
msgid ""
"For more information on how to manually install and configure Grafana, see "
"https://grafana.com/docs."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Grafana ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://grafana.com/docs."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure {productname} monitoring"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການຕິດຕາມກວດກາຂອງ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:98
msgid ""
"With {productname}{nbsp}4 and higher, you can enable the server to expose "
"Prometheus self-health metrics, and also install and configure exporters on "
"client systems."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງແຕ່ {productname}{nbsp}4 ຂຶ້ນໄປ, ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານໃຫ້ເຊີບເວີສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນ Prometheus self-health metrics ໄດ້, ພ້ອມທັງຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ exporters ໃນລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:99
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server self-monitoring"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕາມກວດກາສຸຂະພາບຂອງເຊີເວີເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:100
msgid ""
"The Server self-health metrics cover hardware, operating system and "
"{productname} internals.  These metrics are made available by "
"instrumentation of the Java application, combined with Prometheus exporters."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ Server self-health metrics ຈະກວມເອົາຮາດແວ, ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃນຂອງ {productname}. metrics ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ຜ່ານ instrumentation ຂອງ Java application ຮ່ວມກັບ Prometheus exporters."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:101
msgid "These exporters are shipped with {productname} Server:"
msgstr "exporters ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຖືກມາກັບ {productname} Server:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:102
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:109
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:139
msgid "Node exporter: [systemitem]``golang-github-prometheus-node_exporter``."
msgstr "Node exporter: [systemitem]``golang-github-prometheus-node_exporter``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:103
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:110
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:140
msgid "See https://github.com/prometheus/node_exporter."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ https://github.com/prometheus/node_exporter."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:104
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:141
msgid "PostgreSQL exporter: [systemitem]``prometheus-postgres_exporter``."
msgstr "PostgreSQL exporter: [systemitem]``prometheus-postgres_exporter``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:105
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:142
msgid "See https://github.com/wrouesnel/postgres_exporter."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ https://github.com/wrouesnel/postgres_exporter."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:106
msgid "JMX exporter: [systemitem]``prometheus-jmx_exporter``."
msgstr "JMX exporter: [systemitem]``prometheus-jmx_exporter``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:107
msgid "See https://github.com/prometheus/jmx_exporter."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ https://github.com/prometheus/jmx_exporter."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:108
msgid "These exporter packages are shipped with {productname} Proxy:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ exporter ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຖືກມາກັບ {productname} Proxy:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:111
msgid "Squid exporter: [systemitem]``golang-github-boynux-squid_exporter``."
msgstr "Squid exporter: [systemitem]``golang-github-boynux-squid_exporter``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:112
msgid "See https://github.com/boynux/squid-exporter."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ https://github.com/boynux/squid-exporter."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:113
msgid ""
"The exporters are pre-installed in {productname} Server and Proxy, but their "
"respective systemd daemons are disabled by default."
msgstr "exporters ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າແລ້ວໃນ {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy, ແຕ່ systemd daemons ຂອງພວກມັນຖືກປິດໄວ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:114
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling self-monitoring"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານການຕິດຕາມກວດກາສຸຂະພາບຂອງຕົນເອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:115
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > "
"Monitoring]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Monitoring]."

#. type: delimited block _
