#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:45
msgid "Take a note of the file paths and profiles for performing the scan."
msgstr "ຈົດບັນທຶກທີ່ຢູ່ໄຟລ໌ (file paths) ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການສະແກນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform an audit scan"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການສະແກນກວດສອບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:47
msgid ""
"When you have installed or transferred your content files, you can perform "
"audit scans.  Audit scans can be triggered using the {productname} {webui}.  "
"You can also use the {productname} API to schedule regular scans."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ສົ່ງໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາໄປແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມການສະແກນກວດສອບໄດ້. ການສະແກນກວດສອບສາມາດສັ່ງການໄດ້ຜ່ານ {productname} {webui}. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} API ເພື່ອກຳນົດເວລາການສະແກນແບບປົກກະຕິໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Running an audit scan from the {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລັນການສະແກນກວດສອບຈາກ {webui}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:49
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List] and "
"select the client you want to scan."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Systems[Systems List] ແລ້ວເລືອກໄຄເອັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສະແກນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Audit`` tab, and the [guimenu]``Schedule`` "
"subtab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Audit`` ແລະ ແຖບຍ່ອຍ [guimenu]``Schedule``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:51
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Path to XCCDF Document`` field, enter the parameters for "
"the SCAP template and profile you want to use on the client.  For example:"
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Path to XCCDF Document``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນພາຣາມິເຕີສຳລັບເທມເພຼດ SCAP ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໃນໄຄເອັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:52
msgid "[literal]``Command``: /usr/bin/oscap xccdf eval"
msgstr "[literal]``Command``: /usr/bin/oscap xccdf eval"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:53
msgid ""
"[literal]``Command-line arguments``: --profile "
"xccdf_org.ssgproject.content_profile_stig"
msgstr "[literal]``Command-line arguments``: --profile xccdf_org.ssgproject.content_profile_stig"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:54
msgid ""
"[literal]``Path to XCCDF document``: "
"/usr/share/xml/scap/ssg/content/ssg-sle15-ds.xml"
msgstr "[literal]``Path to XCCDF document``: /usr/share/xml/scap/ssg/content/ssg-sle15-ds.xml"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:55
msgid ""
"If you use [literal]``--fetch-remote-resources`` parameter a lot of RAM is "
"required.  In addition, you may need to increase the value of "
"[literal]``file_recv_max_size``."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີ [literal]``--fetch-remote-resources``, ຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ RAM ຫຼາຍ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຄ່າຂອງ [literal]``file_recv_max_size`` ນຳອີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:56
msgid "The scan runs at the client's next scheduled synchronization."
msgstr "ການສະແກນຈະເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຮອດຮອບວຽນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເຊຊັນ (synchronization) ຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປຂອງໄຄເອັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:57
msgid ""
"The XCCDF content file is validated before it is run on the remote system.  "
"If the content file includes invalid arguments, the test fails."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ XCCDF ຈະຖືກກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລັນຢູ່ເທິງລະບົບປາຍທາງ. ຖ້າໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາມີພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ການທົດສອບຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Running an audit scan from the API"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລັນການສະແກນກວດສອບຈາກ API"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Before you begin, ensure that the client to be scanned has Python and "
"XML-RPC libraries installed."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄຄເອັນທີ່ຈະຖືກສະແກນມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ Python ແລະ XML-RPC libraries ແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Choose an existing script or create a script for scheduling a system scan "
"through ``system.scap.scheduleXccdfScan``.  For example:"
msgstr "ເລືອກສະຄຣິບທີ່ມີຢູ່ ຫຼື ສ້າງສະຄຣິບເພື່ອວາງແຜນການສະແກນລະບົບຜ່ານ ``system.scap.scheduleXccdfScan``. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#!/usr/bin/python3\n"
"import xmlrpc.client\n"
"client = xmlrpc.client.ServerProxy('https://server.example.com/rpc/api')\n"
"key = client.auth.login('username', 'password')\n"
"client.system.scap.scheduleXccdfScan(key, <1000010001>,\n"
"    '<path_to_xccdf_file.xml>',\n"
"    '--profile <profile_name>')\n"
"client.auth.logout(session_key)\n"
msgstr ""
"#!/usr/bin/python3\n"
"import xmlrpc.client\n"
"client = xmlrpc.client.ServerProxy('https://server.example.com/rpc/api')\n"
"key = client.auth.login('username', 'password')\n"
"client.system.scap.scheduleXccdfScan(key, <1000010001>,\n"
"    '<path_to_xccdf_file.xml>',\n"
"    '--profile <profile_name>')\n"
"client.auth.logout(session_key)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:62
msgid "In this example:"
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:63
msgid "``<1000010001>`` is the system ID (sid)."
msgstr "``<1000010001>`` ແມ່ນໄອດີລະບົບ (sid)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:64
msgid ""
"``<path_to_xccdf_file.xml>`` is the path to the content file location on the "
"client.  For example, "
"[path]``/usr/share/xml/scap/ssg/content/ssg-sle15-ds.xml``."
msgstr "``<ເສັ້ນທາງ_ໄປຫາ_ໄຟລ໌_xccdf.xml>`` ແມ່ນເສັ້ນທາງບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາໃນຄຼາຍເອນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: [path]``/usr/share/xml/scap/ssg/content/ssg-sle15-ds.xml``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:65
msgid ""
"``<profile_name>`` is an additional argument for the [command]``oscap`` "
"command.  For example, use "
"``united_states_government_configuration_baseline`` (USGCB)."
msgstr "``<profile_name>`` ແມ່ນພາຣາມິເຕີເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``oscap``. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃຊ້ ``united_states_government_configuration_baseline`` (USGCB)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:66
msgid "Run the script on the client you want to scan, from the command prompt."
msgstr "ລັນສະຄຣິບຢູ່ເທິງໄຄເອັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສະແກນ ຜ່ານໜ້າຈໍຄຳສັ່ງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scan results"
msgstr "ຜົນການສະແກນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:68
msgid ""
"Information about the scans you have run is in the {productname} {webui}.  "
"Navigate to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > All Scans] for a table of results.  For "
"more information about the data in this table, see "
"xref:reference:audit/openscap-all-scans.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການສະແກນທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ລັນໄປນັ້ນແມ່ນມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname} {webui}. ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > All Scans] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕາຕະລາງຜົນການສະແກນ. ສໍາລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃນຕາຕະລາງນີ້, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:reference:audit/openscap-all-scans.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:69
msgid ""
"To ensure that detailed information about scans is available, you need to "
"enable it on the client.  In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to "
"menu:Admin[Organizations] and click on the organization the client is a part "
"of.  Navigate to the [guimenu]``Configuration`` tab, and check the "
"[guimenu]``Enable Upload of Detailed SCAP Files`` option.  When enabled, "
"this generates an additional HTML file on every scan, which contains extra "
"information.  The results show an extra line similar to this:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຈະມີຂໍ້ມູນລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບການສະແກນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານມັນໃນໄຄເອັນ. ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Admin[Organizations] ແລ້ວຄລິກເລືອກອົງກອນທີ່ໄຄເອັນນັ້ນສັງກັດຢູ່. ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Configuration``, ແລ້ວໝາຍຕິກເອົາຕົວເລືອກ [guimenu]``Enable Upload of Detailed SCAP Files``. ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ HTML ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນທຸກໆ ການສະແກນ ເຊິ່ງຈະມີຂໍ້ມູນພິເສດຕ່າງໆ. ຜົນລັດທີ່ໄດ້ຈະສະແດງແຖວເພີ່ມເຕີມຄືແນວນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Detailed Results: xccdf-report.html xccdf-results.xml "
"scap-yast2sec-oval.xml.result.xml\n"
msgstr "Detailed Results: xccdf-report.html xccdf-results.xml scap-yast2sec-oval.xml.result.xml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:71
msgid ""
"To retrieve scan information from the command line, use the "
"[command]``spacewalk-report`` command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນການສະແກນຈາກໜ້າຈໍຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-report``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacewalk-report system-history-scap\n"
"spacewalk-report scap-scan\n"
"spacewalk-report scap-scan-results\n"
msgstr ""
"spacewalk-report system-history-scap\n"
"spacewalk-report scap-scan\n"
"spacewalk-report scap-scan-results\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:73
msgid ""
"You can also use the {productname} API to view results, with the "
"``system.scap`` handler."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} API ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຜົນລັດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການ ``system.scap``."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Removing SCAP Scan Results"
msgstr "ການລົບຜົນການສະແກນ SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:75
msgid ""
"Only SCAP scans that have passed the configured retention period can be "
"deleted.  You can configure the retention period in the "
"[literal]``Organization Configuration`` section."
msgstr "ສະເພາະການສະແກນ SCAP ທີ່ກາຍກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາການເກັບຮັກສາທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດລົບໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະເວລາການເກັບຮັກສາໄດ້ໃນສ່ວນ [literal]``Organization Configuration``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the SCAP results retention period"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະເວລາການເກັບຮັກສາຜົນການສະແກນ SCAP"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:77
msgid "Navigate to menu:Home[My Organization > Configuration]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Home[My Organization > Configuration]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:78
msgid "Under [guimenu]``SCAP``, check [guimenu]``Allow Deletion of SCAP Results``."
msgstr "ພາຍໃຕ້ [guimenu]``SCAP``, ໃຫ້ໝາຍຕິກເອົາ [guimenu]``Allow Deletion of SCAP Results``."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:79
msgid "Enter a number of days in [guimenu]``Allow Deletion After`` (default is 90)."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຈຳນວນມື້ໃນຊ່ອງ [guimenu]``Allow Deletion After`` (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 90 ມື້)."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting SCAP scan results"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົບຜົນການສະແກນ SCAP"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:81
msgid "Navigate to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > All Scans]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > All Scans]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:82
msgid "Select the checkbox for the scan or scans you want to delete."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກເອົາຊ່ອງສຳລັບການສະແກນໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍອັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລົບ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:83
msgid "Click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:85
msgid ""
"Remediation Bash scripts and Ansible playbooks are provided in the same SCAP "
"Security Guide packages to harden the client systems."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບແກ້ໄຂແບບ Bash ແລະ Ansible playbooks ມີໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນແພັກເກັດ SCAP Security Guide ອັນດຽວກັນ ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍເສີມສ້າງຄວາມປອດໄພ (harden) ໃຫ້ກັບລະບົບຄຼາຍເອນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:86
msgid ""
"If you have the beta SCAP features enabled, you can apply remediation "
"directly from scan results in the {webui}, including custom per-rule "
"remediation scripts.  See "
"xref:administration:openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc#remediation-enhanced[Enhanced "
"SCAP Auditing - Remediation]."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ SCAP ເບຕ້າ, ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ການແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກຜົນການກວດສອບໃນ {webui}, ລວມທັງສະຄຣິບແກ້ໄຂແບບກຳນົດເອງຕາມແຕ່ລະກົດລະບຽບ. ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc#remediation-enhanced[Enhanced SCAP Auditing - Remediation]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "bash scripts"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ bash"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-cis.sh\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-standard.sh\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-stig.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-cis.sh\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-standard.sh\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-stig.sh\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ansible playbooks"
msgstr "Ansible playbooks"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:91
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-cis.yml\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-standard.yml\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-stig.yml\n"
msgstr ""
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-cis.yml\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-standard.yml\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-stig.yml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:92
msgid ""
"You can run them using remote commands or with Ansible, after enabling "
"Ansible in the client system."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານພວກມັນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ Ansible ຫຼັງຈາກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ Ansible ໃນລະບົບຄຼາຍເອນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run remediation using a Bash script"
msgstr "ການລັນການແກ້ໄຂໂດຍໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ Bash"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:94
msgid ""
"Install the [package]``scap-security-guide`` package on all your target "
"systems.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ [package]``scap-security-guide`` ລົງໃນທຸກລະບົບເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງທ່ານ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:95
msgid ""
"Packages, channels and scripts are different for each operating system and "
"distribution.  Examples are listed in the <<scripts-for-os-types>> section."
