msgstr "ຫົວຂໍ້ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາສະເພາະສຳລັບ Public Cloud ແມ່ນຈະຖືກກ່າວເຖິງແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-intro.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For Public Cloud troubleshooting, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Public Cloud, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Inter-Server Synchronization"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຊິງໂຄຣໄນລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ (Inter-Server Synchronization)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. Cause: Caches on the ISS slave and master can contain old or out-of-date entries.
#. Consequence: Synchronizing fails, with ``ERROR: Encountered IntegrityError``.
#. Fix: Delete the cache on the slave and the master
#. Result: Synchronization completes successfully.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Inter-server synchronization uses caches to manage the ISS Master and "
"Slaves.  These caches can be prone to bugs that create invalid entries.  In "
"this case, bugs can show up even after updating to a version that resolves "
"the bug, because the cache is still using invalid entries.  If you upgrade "
"to a new version of ISS, but are still experiencing problems, clear all the "
"caches to ensure you no longer have old entries creating a problem."
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີໃຊ້ແຄຊ (caches) ເພື່ອຈັດການ ISS Master ແລະ Slaves. ແຄຊເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະມີບັກ (bugs) ທີ່ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ, ບັກອາດຈະຍັງສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະອັບເດດເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ແກ້ໄຂບັກແລ້ວກໍຕາມ, ເພາະແຄຊຍັງຄົງໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງນັ້ນຢູ່. ຫາກເຈົ້າອັບເກຣດເປັນເວີຊັນໃໝ່ຂອງ ISS ແຕ່ຍັງພົບບັນຫາຢູ່, ໃຫ້ລ້າງແຄຊທັງໝົດເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນເກົ່າທີ່ສ້າງບັນຫາອີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Cache errors can lead to synchronization failing with a variety of errors, "
"but the error message will usually report something like this:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງແຄຊອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະລາຍງານປະມານນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"consider removing satellite-sync cache at /var/cache/rhn/satsync/* and "
"re-run satellite-sync with same options.\n"
msgstr "consider removing satellite-sync cache at /var/cache/rhn/satsync/* and re-run satellite-sync with same options.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can resolve this by deleting the cache on the ISS Master and the ISS "
"Slave, so that synchronization completes successfully."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການລຶບແຄຊຢູ່ເທິງ ISS Master ແລະ ISS Slave, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving ISS Caching Errors"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງແຄຊ ISS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On the ISS Master, at the command prompt, as root, delete the cache file for "
"the Master:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ ISS Master, ທີ່ຄຳສັ່ງຄອມມານ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ແຄຊສຳລັບ Master:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/xml-*\n"
msgstr "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/xml-*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:10
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:14
msgid "Restart the service:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມການບໍລິການໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:11
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "rcapache2 restart\n"
msgstr "rcapache2 restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:12
msgid ""
"On the ISS Master, at the command prompt, as root, delete the cache file for "
"the Slave:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ ISS Master, ທີ່ຄຳສັ່ງຄອມມານ, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ແຄຊສຳລັບ Slave:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/satsync/*\n"
msgstr "rm -rf /var/cache/rhn/satsync/*\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-localcert.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Local Issuer Certificates"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງຜູ້ອອກໃຫ້ໃນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (Local Issuer Certificates)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-localcert.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Some older bootstrap scripts create a link to the local certificate in the "
"wrong place.  This results in zypper returning an ``Unrecognized error`` "
"about the local issuer certificate.  You can ensure that the link to the "
"local issuer certificate has been created correctly by checking the "
"[path]``/etc/ssl/certs/`` directory.  If you come across this problem, you "
"should consider updating your bootstrap scripts to ensure that zypper "
"operates as expected."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ລຸ້ນເກົ່າບາງອັນສ້າງລິ້ງໄປຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທ້ອງຖິ່ນໄວ້ຜິດບ່ອນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ zypper ສົ່ງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ``Unrecognized error`` ກ່ຽວກັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງຜູ້ອອກໃຫ້ໃນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບວ່າລິ້ງໄປຫາໃບຢັ້ງຢືນດັ່ງກ່າວຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການກວດສອບໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/etc/ssl/certs/``. ຫາກເຈົ້າພົບບັນຫານີ້, ເຈົ້າຄວນພິຈາລະນາອັບເດດສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ຂອງເຈົ້າເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ zypper ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Login Timeouts"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການໝົດເວລາເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:2
msgid ""
"By default, the {productname} {webui} requires users to log in again after "
"30{nbsp}minutes.  Depending on your environment, you might want to adjust "
"the login timeout value."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} {webui} ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກ 30 ນາທີ. ຂຶ້ນກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງເຈົ້າ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການປັບຄ່າການໝົດເວລາເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To adjust the value, you need to make the change in both [path]``rhn.conf`` "
"and [path]``web.xml``.  Ensure you set the value in seconds in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``, and in minutes in [path]``web.xml``.  The two "
"values must equal the same amount of time."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປັບຄ່າ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງປ່ຽນແປງທັງໃນ [path]``rhn.conf`` ແລະ [path]``web.xml``. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນວິນາທີໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``, ແລະ ເປັນນາທີໃນ [path]``web.xml``. ທັງສອງຄ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງມີໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ເທົ່າກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For example, to change the timeout value to one hour, set the value in "
"[path]``rhn.conf`` to 3600 seconds, and the value in [path]``web.xml`` to 60 "
"minutes."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເພື່ອປ່ຽນເວລາໝົດເວລາເປັນໜຶ່ງຊົ່ວໂມງ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ [path]``rhn.conf`` ເປັນ 3600 ວິນາທີ, ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ [path]``web.xml`` ເປັນ 60 ນາທີ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adjusting the {webui} Login Timeout Value"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປັບຄ່າການໝົດເວລາເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຂອງ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:6
msgid "On the container host, open a command line inside the server container:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງໂຮສຄອນເທນເນີ, ໃຫ້ເປີດຄອມມານໄລພາຍໃນຄອນເທນເນີເຊີເວີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Open [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` and add or edit this line to include the "
"new timeout value in seconds:"
msgstr "ເປີດ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລ້ວເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຄ່າການໝົດເວລາໃໝ່ເປັນວິນາທີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "web.session_database_lifetime = <Timeout_Value_in_Seconds>\n"
msgstr "web.session_database_lifetime = <Timeout_Value_in_Seconds>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:10
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:13
msgid "Save and close the file."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກ ແລະ ປິດໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Open [path]``/etc/tomcat/web.xml`` and add or edit this line to include the "
"new timeout value in minutes:"
msgstr "ເປີດ [path]``/etc/tomcat/web.xml`` ແລ້ວເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຄ່າການໝົດເວລາໃໝ່ເປັນນາທີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "<session-timeout>Timeout_Value_in_Minutes</session-timeout>\n"
msgstr "<session-timeout>Timeout_Value_in_Minutes</session-timeout>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:14
msgid "On the container host, restart the server to enforce the new configuration:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງໂຮສຄອນເທນເນີ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມເຊີເວີໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ມີຜົນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart uyuni-server.service\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart uyuni-server.service\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Mail Configuration"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຕັ້ງຄ່າອີເມລ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For secure mail communication, you can enable authentication, define "
"username and password, and enable [literal]``SSL`` or [literal]``STARTLS`` "
"in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບການສື່ສານອີເມລທີ່ປອດໄພ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ, ກຳນົດຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ [literal]``SSL`` ຫຼື [literal]``STARTLS`` ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.smtp_server = string (default: localhost)\n"
"java.smtp_port = integer (default: 25)\n"
"java.smtp_auth = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_ssl = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_starttls = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_user = string (default: null)\n"
"java.smtp_pass = string (default: null)\n"
msgstr ""
"java.smtp_server = string (default: localhost)\n"
"java.smtp_port = integer (default: 25)\n"
"java.smtp_auth = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_ssl = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_starttls = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_user = string (default: null)\n"
"java.smtp_pass = string (default: null)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To increase the connection timeout for SMTP server communication, the "
"following parameters can be set in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເພີ່ມເວລາໝົດເວລາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳລັບການສື່ສານກັບເຊີເວີ SMTP, ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.smtp_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_connection_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_write_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
msgstr ""
"java.smtp_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_connection_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_write_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mass Machine_id Duplication"
msgstr "ການຊ້ຳຊ້ອນຂອງ Machine_id ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:2
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you are using {productname} to manage virtual machines, you might find it "
"useful to create clones of your VMs.  A clone is a VM that uses a primary "
"disk that is an exact copy of an existing disk."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າໃຊ້ {productname} ເພື່ອຈັດການເວີຊົວແມຊີນ (VMs), ເຈົ້າອາດຈະເຫັນວ່າມັນມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການສ້າງໂຄລນຂອງ VM. ໂຄລນແມ່ນ VM ທີ່ໃຊ້ດິສຫຼັກທີ່ເປັນການສຳເນົາທີ່ຄືກັນທຸກຢ່າງຂອງດິສທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:3
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:3
msgid ""
"While cloning VMs can save you a lot of time, the duplicated identifying "
"information on the disk can sometimes cause problems."
msgstr "ເຖິງວ່າການໂຄລນ VM ຈະຊ່ວຍປະຢັດເວລາໄດ້ຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນການລະບຸຕົວຕົນທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນຢູ່ໃນດິສບາງຄັ້ງອາດສ້າງບັນຫາໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you try to register two machine where one is the clone of the other, you "
"probably want {productname} to register them as two separate clients.  "
"However, if the machine ID in both the original client and the clone is the "
"same, {productname} registers both clients as one system, and the data is "
"overwritten one the second machine is registered."
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າພະຍາຍາມລົງທະບຽນສອງເຄື່ອງໂດຍທີ່ເຄື່ອງໜຶ່ງເປັນໂຄລນຂອງອີກເຄື່ອງໜຶ່ງ, ເຈົ້າຄົງຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ {productname} ລົງທະບຽນພວກມັນເປັນສອງລູກຂ່າຍແຍກກັນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຫາກ machine ID ໃນທັງລູກຂ່າຍຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ໂຕໂຄລນແມ່ນອັນດຽວກັນ, {productname} ຈະລົງທະບຽນທັງສອງລູກຂ່າຍເປັນລະບົບດຽວ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບເມື່ອເຄື່ອງທີສອງຖືກລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This can be resolved by changing the machine ID of the clone, so that "
"{productname} recognizes them as two different clients.  For more "
"information and instructions on how to change machine ID, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."
msgstr "ບັນຫານີ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ machine ID ຂອງໂຕໂຄລນ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ຮັບຮູ້ພວກມັນເປັນສອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຄຳແນະນຳເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການປ່ຽນ machine ID, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:6
msgid ""
"However, in some situations, it is neither feasible nor practical to change "
"the machine ID on all systems, as this could disrupt other applications that "
"depend on the existing machine IDs. In those cases, a option is available "
"where a fake machine ID is generated to be used in the context of "
"{productname}."
msgstr "ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃນບາງສະຖານະການ, ມັນອາດຈະບໍ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ ຫຼື ບໍ່ສະດວກທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນ machine ID ໃນທຸກລະບົບ, ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນອາດຈະລົບກວນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນທີ່ຕ້ອງອາໄສ machine ID ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ໃນກໍລະນີເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ, ມີໂຕເລືອກໃນການສ້າງ machine ID ປອມເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນບໍລິບົດຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Generating machine ID for {productname} at registration time"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ machine ID ສຳລັບ {productname} ໃນລະຫວ່າງການລົງທະບຽນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Create a Bootstrap script (skip this step if you already have it)  For more "
"information, see xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສ້າງສະຄຣິບ Bootstrap (ຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ໄປຫາກເຈົ້າມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:9
msgid "Open the file and change the parameter:"
msgstr "ເປີດໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ປ່ຽນພະລາມິເຕີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "GENERATE_OWN_MACHINEID=1\n"
msgstr "GENERATE_OWN_MACHINEID=1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:11
msgid "Start using your bootstrap strict, and machine ID will not collide anymore."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມນຳໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ຂອງເຈົ້າ, ແລະ machine ID ຈະບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Mounting /tmp with noexec"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຕິດຕັ້ງ (Mount) /tmp ດ້ວຍ noexec"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt runs remote commands from [path]``/tmp`` on the client's file system.  "
"Therefore you must not mount [path]``/tmp`` with the [option]``noexec`` "
"option.  The other way to solve this issue is to override temporary "
"directory path with the [literal]``TMPDIR`` environment variable specified "
"for the Salt service to make it pointing to the directory with no "
"[option]``noexec`` option set.  It is recommended to use systemd drop-in "
"configuration file "
"[path]``/etc/systemd/system/venv-salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf`` if "
"Salt Bundle is used, or "
"[path]``/etc/systemd/system/salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf`` if "
"[package]``salt-minion`` is used on the client.  The example of the drop-in "
"configuration file content:"
msgstr "Salt ລັນຄຳສັ່ງທາງໄກຈາກ [path]``/tmp`` ຢູ່ເທິງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງບໍ່ mount [path]``/tmp`` ດ້ວຍໂຕເລືອກ [option]``noexec``. ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງໃນການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ຄືການຂຽນທັບ (override) ເສັ້ນທາງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຊົ່ວຄາວດ້ວຍໂຕແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ [literal]``TMPDIR`` ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບບໍລິການ Salt ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນຊີ້ໄປຫາໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [option]``noexec``. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ systemd drop-in [path]``/etc/systemd/system/venv-salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf`` ຫາກໃຊ້ Salt Bundle, ຫຼື [path]``/etc/systemd/system/salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf`` ຫາກໃຊ້ [package]``salt-minion`` ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງເນື້ອຫາຂອງໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ drop-in:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=TMPDIR=/var/tmp\n"
msgstr ""
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=TMPDIR=/var/tmp\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-vartmp-with-noexec.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Mounting /var/tmp with noexec"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຕິດຕັ້ງ (Mount) /var/tmp ດ້ວຍ noexec"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-vartmp-with-noexec.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt SSH is using [path]``/var/tmp`` to deploy Salt Bundle to and execute "
"Salt commands on the client with the bundled Python.  Therefore you must not "
"mount [path]``/var/tmp`` with the [option]``noexec`` option.  It is not "
"possible to bootstrap the clients, which have [path]``/var/tmp`` mounted "
"with [option]``noexec`` option, with the {webui} because the bootstrap "
"process is using Salt SSH to reach a client."
msgstr "Salt SSH ໃຊ້ [path]``/var/tmp`` ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ Salt Bundle ແລະ ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ໃນລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ Python ທີ່ຮວມມານຳ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງບໍ່ mount [path]``/var/tmp`` ດ້ວຍໂຕເລືອກ [option]``noexec``. ມັນບໍ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະ bootstrap ລູກຂ່າຍ ທີ່ mount [path]``/var/tmp`` ດ້ວຍ [option]``noexec`` ຜ່ານ {webui} ເພາະຂະບວນການ bootstrap ໃຊ້ Salt SSH ເພື່ອເຂົ້າຫາລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Not Enough Disk Space"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເນື້ອທີ່ດິສບໍ່ພຽງພໍ"

#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Check the available disk space before you begin migration.  We recommend "
"locating [path]``/var/spacewalk`` and [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` on separate "
"XFS file systems."
msgstr "ກວດສອບເນື້ອທີ່ດິສທີ່ມີຢູ່ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມການຍ້າຍ (migration). ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [path]``/var/spacewalk`` ແລະ [path]``/var/lib/pgsql`` ໄວ້ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ XFS ທີ່ແຍກຈາກກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When you are setting up a separate file system, edit [path]``/etc/fstab`` "
"and remove the [path]``/var/lib/pqsql`` subvolume.  Reboot the server to "
"pick up the changes."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າກຳລັງຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂ [path]``/etc/fstab`` ແລະ ເອົາ subvolume [path]``/var/lib/pqsql`` ອອກ. ຣີບູດເຊີເວີເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To get more information about an upgrade problem, check the migration log "
"file.  The log file is located at [path]``/var/log/rhn/migration.log`` on "
"the system you are upgrading."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຮັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບບັນຫາການອັບເກຣດ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກການຍ້າຍ (migration log). ໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກຕັ້ງຢູ່ທີ່ [path]``/var/log/rhn/migration.log`` ຢູ່ເທິງລະບົບທີ່ເຈົ້າກຳລັງອັບເກຣດ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Notifications"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The default lifetime of notification messages is 30 days, after which "
"messages are deleted from the database, regardless of read status.  To "
"change this value, add or edit this line in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານມາດຕະຖານຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນຄື 30 ວັນ, ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະອ່ານແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່ກໍຕາມ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວນີ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.notifications_lifetime = 30\n"
msgstr "java.notifications_lifetime = 30\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To enable or disable a notification type, add or edit a line as follows in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ງານປະເພດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂແຖວດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.notifications_type_disabled = OnboardingFailed,ChannelSyncFailed,\\\n"
"  ChannelSyncFinished,CreateBootstrapRepoFailed,StateApplyFailed,\\\n"
"  PaygAuthenticationUpdateFailed,EndOfLifePeriod,SubscriptionWarning\n"
msgstr ""
"java.notifications_type_disabled = OnboardingFailed,ChannelSyncFailed,\\\n"
"  ChannelSyncFinished,CreateBootstrapRepoFailed,StateApplyFailed,\\\n"
"  PaygAuthenticationUpdateFailed,EndOfLifePeriod,SubscriptionWarning\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For default settings and configuration options, see the "
"[path]``usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java.conf`` template file."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ ແລະ ໂຕເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່າງໆ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ໄຟລ໌ແມ່ແບບ [path]``usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java.conf``."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting OES repositories enablement"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄັງເກັບ OES"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To enable Open Enterprise Server (OES) on {productname} Server, follow the "
"procedure described."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ Open Enterprise Server (OES) ຢູ່ເທິງເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling OES repositories"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄັງເກັບ OES"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:4
msgid "Ensure you have mirror credentials from Microfocus with access to OES."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າມີຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ (credentials) ສຳລັບການ Mirror ຈາກ Microfocus ທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ OES ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:5
msgid "Log in to {productname} Server."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບເຊີເວີ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:6
msgid "Go to [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials``."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:7
msgid "Make sure you already have SUSE credentials for {productname}."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າມີຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ SUSE ສຳລັບ {productname} ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:8
msgid "Select option for adding new and type in Microfocus credentials."
msgstr "ເລືອກໂຕເລືອກສຳລັບການເພີ່ມໃໝ່ ແລະ ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ Microfocus ເຂົ້າໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Go to [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials`` and wait "
"for the refresh operation to complete."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials`` ແລະ ລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ການຣີເຟຣຊສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:10
msgid ""
"OES should be visible on the refreshed product list.  You can now enable it "
"like any other products."
msgstr "OES ຄວນຈະປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຣີເຟຣຊແລ້ວ. ຕອນນີ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານມັນໄດ້ຄືກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more information about OES, see "
"https://www.microfocus.com/documentation/open-enterprise-server/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ OES, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://www.microfocus.com/documentation/open-enterprise-server/."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Package Inconsistencies"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຄວາມບໍ່ສອດຄ່ອງຂອງແພັກເກດ"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When packages on a client are locked, {productname} Server may not be able "
"to correctly determine the set of applicable patches.  When this occurs, "
"package updates are available in the {webui}, but do not appear on the "
"client, and attempts to update the client fail.  Check package locks and "
"exclude lists to determine if packages are locked or excluded on the client."
msgstr "ເມື່ອແພັກເກດໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຖືກລັອກ, ເຊີເວີ {productname} ອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດຊຸດຂອງແພັດ (patch) ທີ່ເໝາະສົມໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ເມື່ອເຫດການນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ການອັບເດດແພັກເກດຈະມີໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນ {webui}, ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ປະກົດຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ຄວາມພະຍາຍາມໃນການອັບເດດເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບການລັອກແພັກເກດ ແລະ ລາຍການຍົກເວັ້ນ ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງວ່າແພັກເກດຖືກລັອກ ຫຼື ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຫຼືບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:3
msgid ""
"On the client, check package locks and exclude lists to determine if "
"packages are locked or excluded:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບການລັອກແພັກເກດ ແລະ ລາຍການຍົກເວັ້ນ ເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າແພັກເກດຖືກລັອກ ຫຼື ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຫຼືບໍ່:"

#.  SUSE Liberty Linux not available at Uyuni for now
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:4
msgid ""
"On an Expanded Support Platform, check [path]``/etc/yum.conf`` and search "
"for ``exclude=``."
msgstr "ໃນແພລດຟອມການສະໜັບສະໜູນແບບຂະຫຍາຍ (Expanded Support Platform), ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງ [path]``/etc/yum.conf`` ແລະ ຄົ້ນຫາ ``exclude=``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:5
msgid "On {sle} and {opensuse}, use the [command]``zypper locks`` command."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ {sle} ແລະ {opensuse}, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``zypper locks``."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Passing Grains to a Start Event"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການສົ່ງ Grains ໄປຍັງເຫດການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (Start Event)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Every time a Salt client starts, it passes the ``machine_id`` grain to "
"{productname}. {productname} uses this grain to determine if the client is "
"registered.  This process requires a synchronous Salt call. Synchronous Salt "
"calls block other processes, so if you have a lot of clients start at the "
"same time, the process could create significant delays."
msgstr "ທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ມັນຈະສົ່ງ grain ``machine_id`` ໄປຫາ {productname}. {productname} ຈະໃຊ້ grain ນີ້ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່. ຂະບວນການນີ້ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ການເອີ້ນ Salt ແບບ synchronous. ການເອີ້ນແບບ synchronous ຈະຂັດຂວາງຂະບວນການອື່ນໆ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ຖ້າທ່ານມີເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນພ້ອມກັນ, ຂະບວນການນີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຊັກຊ້າຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To overcome this problem, a new feature has been introduced in Salt to avoid "
"making a separate synchronous Salt call."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ໄດ້ມີການເພີ່ມຄຸນສົມບັດໃໝ່ໃນ Salt ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການເອີ້ນ Salt ແບບ synchronous ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To use this feature, you can add a configuration parameter to the client "
"configuration, on clients that support it."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມພາຣາມິເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃສ່ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຮອງຮັບມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To make this process easier, you can use the ``mgr_start_event_grains.sls`` "
"helper Salt state."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະບວນການນີ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Salt state ຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ ``mgr_start_event_grains.sls``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:6
msgid ""
"This only applies to already registered clients.  If you registered your "
"Salt client recently, this config parameter is added by default."
msgstr "ອັນນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າທ່ານຫາກໍ່ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຂອງທ່ານເມື່ອບໍ່ດົນມານີ້, ພາຣາມິເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:7
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, use this command to "
"enable the ``start_event_grains`` configuration helper:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານຕົວຊ່ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``start_event_grains``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_start_event_grains\n"
msgstr "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_start_event_grains\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This command adds the required configuration into the client's configuration "
"file, and applies it when the client is restarted.  If you have a large "
"number of clients, you can execute the command in batch mode instead:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຈຳເປັນເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ຈະມີຜົນເມື່ອເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່. ຖ້າທ່ານມີເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງໃນຮູບແບບ batch ແທນໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls mgr_start_event_grains\n"
msgstr "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls mgr_start_event_grains\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Proxy Connections and FQDN"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ Proxy ແລະ FQDN"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Sometimes clients connected through a proxy appear in the {webui}, but do "
"not show that they are connected through a proxy.  This can occur if you are "
"not using the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) to connect, and the proxy "
"is not known to {productname}."
msgstr "ບາງຄັ້ງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ proxy ຈະປະກົດຢູ່ໃນ {webui}, ແຕ່ບໍ່ສະແດງວ່າພວກເຂົາເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ proxy. ເຫດການນີ້ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຊື່ໂດເມນແບບເຕັມ (FQDN) ໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ແລະ proxy ນັ້ນບໍ່ເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກສຳລັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To correct this behavior, specify additional FQDNs as grains in the client "
"configuration file on the proxy:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ລະບຸ FQDN ເພີ່ມເຕີມເປັນ grains ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຢູ່ໃນ proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"grains:\n"
"  susemanager:\n"
"    custom_fqdns:\n"
"      - name.one\n"
"      - name.two\n"
msgstr ""
"grains:\n"
"  susemanager:\n"
"    custom_fqdns:\n"
"      - name.one\n"
"      - name.two\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Registration from {webui} fails and does not show any errors"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການລົງທະບຽນຈາກ {webui} ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ບໍ່ສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃດໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For the initial registration from the {webui}, all Salt clients are using "
"Salt SSH."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນເບື້ອງຕົ້ນຈາກ {webui}, ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ທັງໝົດແມ່ນໃຊ້ Salt SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Because of its nature, Salt SSH clients do not report errors back to the "
"server."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກທຳມະຊາດຂອງມັນ, ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt SSH ຈະບໍ່ລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດກັບຄືນໄປຫາເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:4
msgid ""
"However, the Salt SSH clients store a log locally at "
"[path]``/var/log/salt-ssh.log`` that can be inspected for errors."
msgstr "ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt SSH ຈະເກັບບັນທຶກ (log) ໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ [path]``/var/log/salt-ssh.log`` ເຊິ່ງສາມາດກວດສອບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໄດ້."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Registering Cloned Clients"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you have a client that is already registered, you create a clone of that "
"client, and then try and register the clone, you probably want {productname} "
"to register them as two separate clients.  However, if the machine ID in "
"both the original client and the clone is the same, {productname} registers "
"both clients as one system, and the existing client data is overwritten with "
"that of the clone."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານມີເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ, ແລະທ່ານສ້າງຕົວໂຄນຂອງເຄື່ອງນັ້ນ, ຈາກນັ້ນພະຍາຍາມລົງທະບຽນຕົວໂຄນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ {productname} ລົງທະບຽນພວກມັນເປັນສອງເຄື່ອງແຍກກັນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າ machine ID ໃນທັງເຄື່ອງຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ຕົວໂຄນຄືກັນ, {productname} ຈະລົງທະບຽນທັງສອງເຄື່ອງເປັນລະບົບດຽວກັນ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຕົວໂຄນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This can be resolved by changing the machine ID of the clone, so that "
"{productname} recognizes them as two different clients."
msgstr "ບັນຫານີ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ machine ID ຂອງຕົວໂຄນ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ຮັບຮູ້ວ່າພວກມັນເປັນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Each step of this procedure is performed on the cloned client.  This "
"procedure does not manipulate the original client, which remains registered "
"to {productname}."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນຂອງວິທີການນີ້ແມ່ນເຮັດຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ. ວິທີການນີ້ຈະບໍ່ໄປປ່ຽນແປງເຄື່ອງຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ເຊິ່ງຍັງຄົງລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname} ຢູ່."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Duplicate Machine IDs in Cloned Salt Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂ Machine ID ທີ່ຊໍ້າກັນໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Initial System Configuration*\n"
msgstr "*ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ*\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:9
msgid "On the cloned machine, change the hostname and IP addresses."
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ຖືກໂຄນ, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນ hostname ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Make sure [path]``/etc/hosts`` contains the changes you made and the correct "
"host entries."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ [path]``/etc/hosts`` ມີການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ເຮັດ ແລະ ມີຂໍ້ມູນ host ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Resolving Duplicate Machine IDs*\n"
msgstr "*ການແກ້ໄຂ Machine ID ທີ່ຊໍ້າກັນ*\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:12
msgid "_For distributions that support systemd:_"
msgstr "_ສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ຮອງຮັບ systemd:_"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:13
msgid ""
"If your machines have the same machine ID, as root, delete the files on each "
"duplicated client and re-create it:"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານມີ machine ID ດຽວກັນ, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ໃນແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຊໍ້າກັນ ແລະ ສ້າງມັນໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
"systemd-machine-id-setup\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
"systemd-machine-id-setup\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:15
msgid ""
"If the cloned machine also has a folder in [path]``/var/log/journal/`` it "
"needs to be renamed accordingly to the new machine ID. If names do not "
"match, [command]``journalctl`` could not retrieve any log and "
"[command]``podman logs`` would not show anything."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຄື່ອງທີ່ຖືກໂຄນມີໂຟນເດີໃນ [path]``/var/log/journal/`` ມັນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ປ່ຽນຊື່ຕາມ machine ID ໃໝ່. ຖ້າຊື່ບໍ່ກົງກັນ, [command]``journalctl`` ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດດຶງຂໍ້ມູນບັນທຶກໃດໆ ແລະ [command]``podman logs`` ກໍຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຫຍັງເລີຍ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "mv /var/log/journal/* /var/log/journal/$(cat /etc/machine-id)\n"
msgstr "mv /var/log/journal/* /var/log/journal/$(cat /etc/machine-id)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:17
msgid "_For distributions that do not support systemd:_"
msgstr "_ສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ systemd:_"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:18
msgid "As root, generate a machine ID from dbus:"
msgstr "ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ machine ID ຈາກ dbus:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:20
msgid ""
"If you are cloning a {rhel} 8.10 server that will later be liberated to "
"{sll}, you must perform extra steps to fix the kernel configuration files."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງໂຄນເຊີເວີ {rhel} 8.10 ທີ່ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນ {sll} ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຮັດຂັ້ນຕອນເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ kernel."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:21
msgid ""
"{rhel} uses the machine ID to generate kernel entries in "
"[path]``/boot/loader/entries``.  Not performing these steps will result in a "
"mix of old and new kernel entries after the liberation, as {sll} kernels "
"will create new entries instead of replacing the old ones."
msgstr "{rhel} ໃຊ້ machine ID ເພື່ອສ້າງລາຍການ kernel ໃນ [path]``/boot/loader/entries``. ຖ້າບໍ່ເຮັດຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການປະປົນກັນລະຫວ່າງລາຍການ kernel ເກົ່າ ແລະ ໃໝ່ ຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນລະບົບ, ເພາະ kernel ຂອງ {sll} ຈະສ້າງລາຍການໃໝ່ແທນທີ່ຈະໄປປ່ຽນແທນອັນເກົ່າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:22
msgid "After changing the machine ID and before liberating, run:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນ machine ID ແລະ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເຮັດການປ່ຽນລະບົບ, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo rm -rf /boot/loader/entries/\n"
"sudo for ver in $(rpm -q kernel --qf '%{VERSION}-%{RELEASE}.%{ARCH}\\n'); do "
"echo \"Reinstalling kernel $ver...\"; sudo kernel-install add $ver "
"/lib/modules/$ver; done\n"
"sudo grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/efi/EFI/redhat/grub.cfg\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo rm -rf /boot/loader/entries/\n"
"sudo for ver in $(rpm -q kernel --qf '%{VERSION}-%{RELEASE}.%{ARCH}\\n'); do echo \"Reinstalling kernel $ver...\"; sudo kernel-install add $ver /lib/modules/$ver; done\n"
"sudo grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/efi/EFI/redhat/grub.cfg\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:24
msgid ""
"For more information and example on liberating {rhel} 8.10 server, see "
"xref:common-workflows:workflow-liberate-rhel-with-secureboot.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ຕົວຢ່າງກ່ຽວກັບການປ່ຽນເຊີເວີ {rhel} 8.10, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:common-workflows:workflow-liberate-rhel-with-secureboot.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Reconfiguring {salt} Clients*\n"
msgstr "*ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ໃໝ່*\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:26
msgid ""
"If your clients still have the same Salt client ID, delete the "
"[path]``minion_id`` file on each client (FQDN is used when it is regenerated "
"on client restart)."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານຍັງຄົງມີ Salt client ID ດຽວກັນ, ໃຫ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ [path]``minion_id`` ໃນແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງ (FQDN ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເມື່ອມັນຖືກສ້າງໃໝ່ຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເຄື່ອງໃໝ່)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:27
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:32
msgid "For Salt Minion clients:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt Minion:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/salt/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/salt/pki\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/salt/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/salt/pki\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:29
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:34
msgid "For Salt Bundle clients:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt Bundle:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/venv-salt-minion/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/venv-salt-minion/pki\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/venv-salt-minion/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/venv-salt-minion/pki\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Delete accepted keys from the onboarding page and the system profile from "
"{productname}, and restart the client with."
msgstr "ລຶບຄີ (keys) ທີ່ຖືກຍອມຮັບແລ້ວອອກຈາກໜ້າ onboarding ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ລະບົບຈາກ {productname}, ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "service salt-minion restart\n"
msgstr "service salt-minion restart\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "service venv-salt-minion restart\n"
msgstr "service venv-salt-minion restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Re-register the clients.  Each client now has a different "
"[path]``/etc/machine-id`` and should be correctly displayed on the "
"[guimenu]``System Overview`` page."
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່. ຕອນນີ້ແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງຈະມີ [path]``/etc/machine-id`` ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ແລະ ຄວນຈະສະແດງຜົນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໃນໜ້າ [guimenu]``System Overview``."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote root login on {sl-micro}"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າລະບົບ root ທາງໄກໃນ {sl-micro}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For enhanced security, new installations of {sl-micro} 6.2 and later do not "
"allow password-based remote root login anymore, which affects server and "
"proxy container hosts running on {sl-micro} and managed {sl-micro} clients.  "
"Also, {sle-micro} 5.5 clients with password-based remote root login which "
"will when be migrated to 6.1/6.2 will suddenly lose this access and must be "
"newly configured.  For more information, see SL Micro Release Notes 6.2 "
"(https://documentation.suse.com/releasenotes/sle-micro/html/releasenotes_sle-micro_6.2/)."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ຂອງ {sl-micro} 6.2 ແລະ ລຸ້ນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ root ຈາກໄລຍະໄກດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານອີກຕໍ່ໄປ, ເຊິ່ງມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ server ແລະ proxy container hosts ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນ {sl-micro} ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ {sl-micro} ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ລູກຂ່າຍ {sle-micro} 5.5 ທີ່ໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ root ດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ ເມື່ອຖືກຍ້າຍລະບົບ (migrated) ໄປຫາ 6.1/6.2 ຈະເສຍສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງນີ້ທັນທີ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ SL Micro Release Notes 6.2 (https://documentation.suse.com/releasenotes/sle-micro/html/releasenotes_sle-micro_6.2/)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"While deploying components of {productname} such as a {productname} Proxy, "
"by default, password-based remote root login is required.  You can enable "
"password-based remote root login with the following steps."
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອົງປະກອບຂອງ {productname} ເຊັ່ນ {productname} Proxy, ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ຈະຕ້ອງມີການເຂົ້າລະບົບ root ທາງໄກດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານມັນໄດ້ດ້ວຍຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enable SSH root login with a password on {sl-micro}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ເປີດໃຊ້ງານການເຂົ້າລະບົບ root ຜ່ານ SSH ດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານໃນ {sl-micro}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can enable SSH root login in two different ways.  Either of them will "
"work; choose the one that best fits your setup."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ SSH root ໄດ້ສອງວິທີ. ວິທີໃດກໍໄດ້ແມ່ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ຜົນ; ໃຫ້ເລືອກວິທີທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານທີ່ສຸດ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option A: Use the preconfigured package"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ A: ໃຊ້ແພັກເກັດທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Install the package [package]``openssh-server-config-rootlogin`` from the "
"UI/API on the client."
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ [package]``openssh-server-config-rootlogin`` ຈາກ UI/API ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Reboot the container host to activate the new configuration either from UI "
"or from terminal"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບ container host ໃໝ່ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຜ່ານ UI ຫຼື terminal"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option B: Edit the SSH configuration manually"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ B: ແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSH ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Add a drop-in config [path]``/etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/permit_root.conf`` file, "
"with the following content:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [path]``/etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/permit_root.conf`` ດ້ວຍເນື້ອຫາຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "PermitRootLogin yes\n"
msgstr "PermitRootLogin yes\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:12
msgid "Reload the SSH server configuration"
msgstr "ໂຫຼດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSH server ໃໝ່"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl reload sshd\n"
msgstr "systemctl reload sshd\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:14
msgid ""
"If connected using SSH, before disconnecting from the server, validate the "
"SSH server is working correctly by opening a new SSH connection."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດ້ວຍ SSH ຢູ່, ກ່ອນຈະຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກເຊີເວີ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າ SSH server ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍການລອງເປີດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For more information about [command]``transactional-update``, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/6.2/html/Micro-transactional-updates/index.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ [command]``transactional-update``, ເບິ່ງ https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/6.2/html/Micro-transactional-updates/index.html."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resizing BTRFS"
msgstr "ການປັບຂະໜາດ BTRFS"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resizing a BTRFS LVM partition on {sles}"
msgstr "ການປັບຂະໜາດພາທິຊັນ BTRFS LVM ໃນ {sles}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When managing a {sles} installation, the BTRFS root file system can become "
"full due to files, caches, or snapshots.  Because removing snapshots "
"manually is not recommended, the best approach is to resize the partition."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຈັດການການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sles}, ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ root ແບບ BTRFS ອາດຈະເຕັມຍ້ອນໄຟລ໌, caches, ຫຼື snapshots. ເນື່ອງຈາກບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ລຶບ snapshots ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ວິທີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນການປັບຂະໜາດພາທິຊັນ (partition)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To resize a BTRFS partition, the partition must remain mounted during this "
"procedure."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປັບຂະໜາດພາທິຊັນ BTRFS, ພາທິຊັນນັ້ນຕ້ອງຍັງຄົງຖືກ mount ໄວ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The following steps illustrate how to resize a BTRFS LVM partition by adding "
"a new disk (for example, [path]``/dev/sdb``) to the volume group."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວິທີປັບຂະໜາດພາທິຊັນ BTRFS LVM ໂດຍການເພີ່ມດິສກ໌ໃໝ່ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [path]``/dev/sdb``) ເຂົ້າໃນ volume group."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resizing a BTRFS LVM Partition*"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປັບຂະໜາດພາທິຊັນ BTRFS LVM*"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Check the disk information to identify the root file system device and the "
"new disk using the `lsblk` command:"
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນດິສກ໌ເພື່ອລະບຸອຸປະກອນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ root ແລະ ດິສກ໌ໃໝ່ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ `lsblk`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:8
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "lsblk\n"
msgstr "lsblk\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:9
msgid "Create a physical volume on the newly added disk:"
msgstr "ສ້າງ physical volume ໃນດິສກ໌ທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "pvcreate /dev/sdb\n"
msgstr "pvcreate /dev/sdb\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:11
msgid "Scan for the current volume group that the root file system is using:"
msgstr "ສະແກນຫາ volume group ປັດຈຸບັນທີ່ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ root ກຳລັງໃຊ້ຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "vgscan\n"
msgstr "vgscan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:13
msgid "Extend the volume group with the newly created physical volume:"
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍ volume group ດ້ວຍ physical volume ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "vgextend system /dev/sdb\n"
msgstr "vgextend system /dev/sdb\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:15
msgid "Extend the logical volume using the extended volume group:"
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍ logical volume ໂດຍໃຊ້ volume group ທີ່ຖືກຂະຫຍາຍແລ້ວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "lvextend -l +100%FREE /dev/system/root\n"
msgstr "lvextend -l +100%FREE /dev/system/root\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:17
msgid "Resize the BTRFS root file system:"
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດລະບົບໄຟລ໌ BTRFS root:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "btrfs filesystem resize max /\n"
msgstr "btrfs filesystem resize max /\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Check the result to verify that the system's root file system has been "
"successfully resized to the new capacity:"
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງຜົນເພື່ອຢືນຢັນວ່າລະບົບໄຟລ໌ root ຂອງລະບົບໄດ້ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໄປຫາຄວາມຈຸໃໝ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ:"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resizing a BTRFS root volume on {sl-micro}"
msgstr "ການປັບຂະໜາດ BTRFS root volume ໃນ {sl-micro}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:22
msgid ""
"When managing a {sle-micro} 5.5 or {sl-micro} 6 installation, the BTRFS root "
"volume may run out of disk space and require resizing."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຈັດການການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sle-micro} 5.5 ຫຼື {sl-micro} 6, BTRFS root volume ອາດຈະໝົດພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ ແລະ ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ປັບຂະໜາດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Attempting to resize the root volume using the standard command "
"[command]``btrfs fi resize max /`` will result in the following error:"
msgstr "ການພະຍາຍາມປັບຂະໜາດ root volume ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງມາດຕະຖານ [command]``btrfs fi resize max /`` ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "ERROR: unable to resize '/': Read-only file system\n"
msgstr "ERROR: unable to resize '/': Read-only file system\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:25
msgid ""
"This occurs because the root volume is mounted read-only on {sle-micro} "
"systems.  To successfully complete the operation online, you must target the "
"[path]``/.snapshots`` mount point instead, which is mounted read-write."
msgstr "ເຫດການນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນຍ້ອນວ່າ root volume ຖືກ mount ແບບອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ (read-only) ໃນລະບົບ {sle-micro}. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການດຳເນີນການອອນລາຍສຳເລັດ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ mount point [path]``/.snapshots`` ແທນ, ເຊິ່ງຖືກ mount ແບບອ່ານ-ຂຽນ (read-write)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:26
msgid "Changes to the partition table can cause damage to the system."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນແປງຕາຕະລາງພາທິຊັນ (partition table) ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມເສຍຫາຍຕໍ່ລະບົບໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Always make sure to have a complete backup before making changes to the "
"partition table."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ທຳການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ (backup) ໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນສະເໝີ ກ່ອນຈະທຳການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆກັບຕາຕະລາງພາທິຊັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:28
msgid ""
"The following procedure illustrates how to resize a single disk where the "
"root partition is the last partition on the device (for example, "
"[path]``/dev/sda3``).  If your layout contains further partitions, the "
"operation may become more complex and you may need to reach out to "
"{scclongform} for support."
msgstr "ຂະບວນການຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວິທີການປັບຂະໜາດດິສກ໌ດ່ຽວ ໂດຍທີ່ root partition ເປັນພາທິຊັນສຸດທ້າຍຂອງອຸປະກອນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [path]``/dev/sda3``). ຖ້າໂຄງສ້າງຂອງທ່ານມີພາທິຊັນອື່ນໆຕໍ່ຈາກນັ້ນ, ການດຳເນີນການອາດຈະສັບສົນຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ຕິດຕໍ່ຫາ {scclongform} ເພື່ອຂໍຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resizing the BTRFS root volume"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປັບຂະໜາດ BTRFS root volume"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Resize the existing disk to the new size using the appropriate hypervisor or "
"storage tools for your environment."
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດດິສກ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃຫ້ເປັນຂະໜາດໃໝ່ ໂດຍໃຊ້ hypervisor ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງມືຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Rescan the device to be resized.  For example, to rescan [path]``/dev/sda``, "
"run the following command as root:"
msgstr "ທຳການສະແກນອຸປະກອນທີ່ຈະປັບຂະໜາດໃໝ່. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອສະແກນ [path]``/dev/sda`` ໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ໃນນາມ root:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "echo 1 > /sys/block/sda/device/rescan\n"
msgstr "echo 1 > /sys/block/sda/device/rescan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Resize the root partition using the comamnd [command]``growpart``.  In this "
"example, we resize partition 3 on [path]``/dev/sda``:"
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດ root partition ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``growpart``. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະປັບຂະໜາດພາທິຊັນ 3 ໃນ [path]``/dev/sda``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "growpart /dev/sda 3\n"
msgstr "growpart /dev/sda 3\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Resize the BTRFS filesystem.  Be sure to use [path]``/.snapshots`` instead "
"of [path]``/`` to avoid the read-only error:"
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດລະບົບໄຟລ໌ BTRFS. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໃຊ້ [path]``/.snapshots`` ແທນທີ່ [path]``/`` ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ read-only:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "btrfs fi resize max /.snapshots\n"
msgstr "btrfs fi resize max /.snapshots\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Check the filesystem to verify that the new size has been applied "
"successfully:"
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນວ່າຂະໜາດໃໝ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "btrfs fi show /\n"
msgstr "btrfs fi show /\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Red Hat CDN Channel and Multiple Certificates"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຊ່ອງທາງ Red Hat CDN ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຫຼາຍໃບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The {redhat} content delivery network (CDN) channels sometimes provide "
"multiple certificates, but the {productname} {webui} can only import a "
"single certificate.  If CDN presents a certificate that is different to the "
"one the {productname} {webui} knows about, validation fails and permission "
"to access the repository is denied, even though the certificate is "
"accurate.  The error message received is:"
msgstr "ບາງຄັ້ງຊ່ອງທາງ Content Delivery Network (CDN) ຂອງ {redhat} ໃຫ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນມາຫຼາຍໃບ, ແຕ່ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າໄດ້ພຽງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າ CDN ສົ່ງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກໃບທີ່ {webui} ຮູ້ຈັກ, ການກວດສອບຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຄັງເກັບຊອບແວຈະຖືກປະຕິເສດ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນນັ້ນຈະຖືກຕ້ອງກໍຕາມ. ຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບແມ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[error]\n"
"Repository '<repo_name>' is invalid.\n"
"<repo.pem> Valid metadata not found at specified URL\n"
"History:\n"
" - [|] Error trying to read from '<repo.pem>'\n"
" - Permission to access '<repo.pem>' denied.\n"
"Please check if the URIs defined for this repository are pointing to a valid "
"repository.\n"
"Skipping repository '<repo_nam' because of the above error.\n"
"Could not refresh the repositories because of errors.\n"
"HH:MM:SS RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys "
"are not imported\n"
msgstr ""
"[error]\n"
"Repository '<repo_name>' is invalid.\n"
"<repo.pem> Valid metadata not found at specified URL\n"
"History:\n"
" - [|] Error trying to read from '<repo.pem>'\n"
" - Permission to access '<repo.pem>' denied.\n"
"Please check if the URIs defined for this repository are pointing to a valid repository.\n"
"Skipping repository '<repo_nam' because of the above error.\n"
"Could not refresh the repositories because of errors.\n"
"HH:MM:SS RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys are not imported\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To resolve this issue, merge all valid certificates into a single ``.pem`` "
"file, and rebuild the certificates for use by {productname}:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ລວມໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງທັງໝົດເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ ``.pem`` ດຽວ, ແລະ ສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຄືນໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນ {productname}:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Multiple {redhat} CDN Certificates"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ Red Hat CDN ທີ່ມີຫຼາຍໃບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On the {redhat} client, at the command prompt, as root, gather all current "
"certificates from ``/etc/pki/entitlement/`` in a single ``rh-cert.pem`` "
"file:"
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ {redhat}, ທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ລວມໃບຢັ້ງຢືນປັດຈຸບັນທັງໝົດຈາກ ``/etc/pki/entitlement/`` ໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ ``rh-cert.pem`` ດຽວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat 866705146090697087.pem 3539668047766796506.pem "
"redhat-entitlement-authority.pem > rh-cert.pem\n"
msgstr "cat 866705146090697087.pem 3539668047766796506.pem redhat-entitlement-authority.pem > rh-cert.pem\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Gather all current keys from ``/etc/pki/entitlement/`` in a single "
"``rh-key.pem`` file:"
msgstr "ລວມຄີ (keys) ປັດຈຸບັນທັງໝົດຈາກ ``/etc/pki/entitlement/`` ໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ ``rh-key.pem`` ດຽວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "cat 866705146090697087-key.pem 3539668047766796506-key.pem > rh-key.pem\n"
msgstr "cat 866705146090697087-key.pem 3539668047766796506-key.pem > rh-key.pem\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You can now import the new certificates to the {productname} Server, using "
"the instructions in xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-cdn.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່ໄປຍັງເຊີເວີ {productname} ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳແນະນຳໃນ xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-cdn.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting RPC Connection Timeouts"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການໝົດເວລາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ RPC"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:2
msgid ""
"RPC connections can sometimes time out due to slow networks or a network "
"link going down.  This results in package downloads or batch jobs hanging or "
"taking longer than expected.  You can adjust the maximum time that an RPC "
"connection can take by editing the configuration file.  While this does not "
"resolve networking problems, it does cause a process to fail rather than "
"hang."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ RPC ບາງຄັ້ງອາດຈະໝົດເວລາເນື່ອງຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍຊ້າ ຫຼື ສາຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍຫຼຸດ. ອັນນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ການດາວໂຫລດແພັກເກດ ຫຼື ວຽກແບບ batch ຄ້າງ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເວລາດົນກວ່າທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບເວລາກຳນົດສູງສຸດຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ RPC ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າອັນນີ້ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ແຕ່ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະບວນການແຈ້ງຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວແທນທີ່ຈະຄ້າງຢູ່."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving RPC connection timeouts"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການໝົດເວລາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ RPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:4
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, open the [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` file "
"and set a maximum timeout value (in seconds):"
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາໝົດສູງສຸດ (ເປັນວິນາທີ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "server.timeout =`number`\n"
msgstr "server.timeout =`number`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Proxy, open the "
"[filename]``/etc/uyuni/proxy/config.yaml`` file and set a maximum timeout "
"value (in seconds).  The proxy containers need to be restarted for the "
"change to be effective:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Proxy, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [filename]``/etc/uyuni/proxy/config.yaml`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາໝົດເວລາສູງສຸດ (ເປັນວິນາທີ). ຕົວບັນຈຸ (containers) ຂອງ proxy ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ເລີ່ມໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງມີຜົນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "timeout: `number`\n"
msgstr "timeout: `number`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On a {sles} client that uses zypper, open the "
"[filename]``/etc/zypp/zypp.conf`` file and set a maximum timeout value (in "
"seconds):"
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ {sles} ທີ່ໃຊ້ zypper, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [filename]``/etc/zypp/zypp.conf`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາໝົດສູງສຸດ (ເປັນວິນາທີ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"## Valid values:  [0,3600]\n"
"## Default value: 180\n"
"download.transfer_timeout = 180\n"
msgstr ""
"## Valid values:  [0,3600]\n"
"## Default value: 180\n"
"download.transfer_timeout = 180\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:10
msgid ""
"On a {rhel} client that uses yum, open the [filename]``/etc/yum.conf`` file "
"and set a maximum timeout value (in seconds):"
msgstr "ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ {rhel} ທີ່ໃຊ້ yum, ໃຫ້ເປີດໄຟລ໌ [filename]``/etc/yum.conf`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາໝົດສູງສຸດ (ເປັນວິນາທີ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "timeout =`number`\n"
msgstr "timeout =`number`\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If you limit RPC timeouts to less than `180` seconds, you risk aborting "
"perfectly normal operations."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳນົດເວລາໝົດ RPC ໄວ້ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ `180` ວິນາທີ, ທ່ານມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ປົກກະຕິຖືກຍົກເລີກ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Salt clients shown as down and DNS settings"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ທີ່ສະແດງວ່າປິດຢູ່ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DNS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Even if the Salt client is running, actions such as package refresh or apply "
"states can be marked as failed with the message:"
msgstr "ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຈະກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ແຕ່ການກະທຳບາງຢ່າງເຊັ່ນການຣີເຟຣຊແພັກເກດ ຫຼື ການໃຊ້ states ສາມາດຖືກໝາຍວ່າຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຄວາມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minion is down or could not be contacted.\n"
msgstr "Minion is down or could not be contacted.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In this case try rescheduling the action.  If rescheduling succeeds, the "
"cause of the problem can be a wrong DNS configuration."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ ໃຫ້ລອງຕັ້ງກຳນົດເວລາການກະທຳໃໝ່. ຖ້າການຕັ້ງກຳນົດເວລາໃໝ່ສຳເລັດ, ສາເຫດຂອງບັນຫາອາດມາຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DNS ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:6
msgid ""
"When the Salt client is restarted, or in case the grains are refreshed, the "
"client calculates its FQDN grains, and it is unresponsive until the grains "
"are proceeded.  When a scheduled action on {productname} Server is going to "
"be executed, {productname} Server performs a ``test.ping`` to the client "
"before the actual action to ensure the client is actually running and the "
"action can be triggered."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່, ຫຼື ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີການຣີເຟຣຊ grains, ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈະຄຳນວນ FQDN grains ຂອງມັນ, ແລະ ມັນຈະບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງຈົນກວ່າ grains ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນສຳເລັດ. ເມື່ອມີການກະທຳທີ່ຕັ້ງກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname} ຈະຖືກດຳເນີນການ, ເຊີເວີ {productname} ຈະເຮັດການ ``test.ping`` ໄປຫາເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍກ່ອນການກະທຳຕົວຈິງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ແລະ ສາມາດເລີ່ມການກະທຳໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:7
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} Server waits for 5 seconds to get the response "
"from ``test.ping`` command.  If the response is not received within 5 "
"seconds, then the action is set to fail with the message that the client is "
"down or could not be contacted."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ເຊີເວີ {productname} ຈະລໍຖ້າ 5 ວິນາທີເພື່ອຮັບການຕອບສະໜອງຈາກຄຳສັ່ງ ``test.ping``. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຕອບສະໜອງພາຍໃນ 5 ວິນາທີ, ການກະທຳນັ້ນຈະຖືກຕັ້ງວ່າຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ວ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍປິດຢູ່ ຫຼື ບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To correct this, fix the DNS resolution on the client, so the client does "
"not get stuck for 5 seconds while solving its FQDN."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂການແປງຊື່ DNS ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຄ້າງເປັນເວລາ 5 ວິນາທີໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງຫາຊື່ FQDN ຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If this is not possible, try to increase the value for "
"``java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`` in the ``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` file on the "
"{productname} Server to a value higher than 4."
msgstr "ຖ້າບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້, ໃຫ້ລອງເພີ່ມຄ່າສຳລັບ ``java.salt_presence_ping_timeout`` ໃນໄຟລ໌ ``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname} ໃຫ້ສູງກວ່າ 4."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl term\n"
"vim /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"java.salt_presence_ping_timeout = 6\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl term\n"
"vim /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"java.salt_presence_ping_timeout = 6\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:12
msgid "After that, run:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Increasing this value will cause {productname} Server to take longer to "
"check if a minion is unreachable or unresponsive, causing the {productname} "
"Server to be slower or less responsive overall."
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຊີເວີ {productname} ໃຊ້ເວລາດົນຂຶ້ນໃນການກວດສອບວ່າ minion ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ ຫຼື ບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງ, ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຊີເວີ {productname} ຊ້າລົງ ຫຼື ຕອບສະໜອງໄດ້ໜ້ອຍລົງໂດຍລວມ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Schema Upgrade Fails"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການອັບເກຣດ Schema ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ"

#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If the schema upgrade fails, the database version check and all the other "
"spacewalk services do not start.  Run [command]``mgradm start`` on the "
"container host for more information and hints how to proceed."
msgstr "ຖ້າການອັບເກຣດ schema ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ການກວດສອບເວີຊັນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ບໍລິການ spacewalk ອື່ນໆທັງໝົດຈະບໍ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm start`` ໃນ container host ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ຄຳແນະນຳວິທີການດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:4
msgid "You can also run the version check directly in the container:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລັນການກວດສອບເວີຊັນໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໃນ container:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl status uyuni-check-database.service\n"
msgstr "systemctl status uyuni-check-database.service\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "journalctl -u uyuni-check-database.service\n"
msgstr "journalctl -u uyuni-check-database.service\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:8
msgid ""
"These commands print debug information if you do not want to run the more "
"general [command]``mgradm`` command."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນ debug ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການລັນຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgradm`` ແບບທົ່ວໄປ."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Synchronization"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເຊຊັນ (Synchronization)"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Synchronization can fail for a number of reasons.  To get more information "
"about a connection problem, run this command:"
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເຊຊັນສາມາດຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວໄດ້ຍ້ອນຫຼາຍສາເຫດ. ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export URLGRABBER_DEBUG=DEBUG\n"
"spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channelname> <options> > "
"/var/log/spacewalk-repo-sync-$(date +%F-%R).log 2>&1\n"
msgstr ""
"export URLGRABBER_DEBUG=DEBUG\n"
"spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channelname> <options> > /var/log/spacewalk-repo-sync-$(date +%F-%R).log 2>&1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:4
msgid "You can also check logs created by Zypper at [path]``/var/log/zypper.log``"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກວດສອບບັນທຶກທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ Zypper ໄດ້ທີ່ [path]``/var/log/zypper.log``"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Key Mismatch"
msgstr "GPG Key ບໍ່ກົງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{productname} does not automatically trust third party GPG keys.  If package "
"synchronization fails, it could be because of an untrusted GPG key.  You can "
"find out if this is the case by opening [path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync`` and "
"looking for an error like this:"
msgstr "{productname} ຈະບໍ່ເຊື່ອຖື GPG keys ຂອງບຸກຄົນທີສາມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຖ້າການຊິງໂຄຣໄນແພັກເກດຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ມັນອາດຈະເປັນຍ້ອນ GPG key ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກເຊື່ອຖື. ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ໂດຍການເປີດ [path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync`` ແລະ ຄົ້ນຫາຂໍ້ຜິດພາດແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"['/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync', '--channel', 'sle-12-sp1-ga-desktop-\n"
"nvidia-driver-x86_64', '--type', 'yum', '--non-interactive']\n"
"RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys are not "
"imported\n"
msgstr ""
"['/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync', '--channel', 'sle-12-sp1-ga-desktop-\n"
"nvidia-driver-x86_64', '--type', 'yum', '--non-interactive']\n"
"RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys are not imported\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To resolve the problem, you need to import the GPG key to {productname}.  "
"For more on importing GPG keys, see "
"xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າ GPG key ໄປຍັງ {productname}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການນຳເຂົ້າ GPG keys, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Key Removal from [literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync``"
msgstr "ການລຶບ GPG Key ອອກຈາກ [literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:10
msgid ""
"When a GPG key for repository has been manually imported using "
"[literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync``, and this key is no longer needed (for "
"example if the key was compromised, or was used for testing purposes only), "
"it can be removed from the zypper RPM database used by "
"[literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync`` with the following command:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອ GPG key ສຳລັບຄັງເກັບຊອບແວຖືກນຳເຂົ້າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ [literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync``, ແລະ ຄີນັ້ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າຄີຖືກເຈາະຂໍ້ມູນ, ຫຼື ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການທົດສອບເທົ່ານັ້ນ), ມັນສາມາດຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ zypper RPM ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ [literal]``spacewalk-repo-sync`` ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "rpm --dbpath=/var/lib/spacewalk/reposync/root/var/lib/rpm/ -e gpg-pubkey-*\n"
msgstr "rpm --dbpath=/var/lib/spacewalk/reposync/root/var/lib/rpm/ -e gpg-pubkey-*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:12
msgid "where [literal]``gpg-pubkey-*`` is the name of the GPG key to be removed."
msgstr "ໂດຍທີ່ [literal]``gpg-pubkey-*`` ແມ່ນຊື່ຂອງ GPG key ທີ່ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Renewing GPG Key"
msgstr "ການຕໍ່ອາຍຸ GPG Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:14
msgid ""
"If you want to renew a GPG key, first remove the old key, and then generate "
"and import a new one."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕໍ່ອາຍຸ GPG key, ໃຫ້ລຶບຄີເກົ່າອອກກ່ອນ, ຈາກນັ້ນສ້າງ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າຄີໃໝ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checksum Mismatch"
msgstr "Checksum ບໍ່ກົງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:16
msgid ""
"If a checksum has failed, you might see an error like this in the "
"[path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync/*.log`` log file:"
msgstr "ຖ້າ Checksum ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ທ່ານອາດຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດແບບນີ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ [path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync/*.log``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Repo Sync Errors: (50, u'checksums did not match\n"
"326a904c2fbd7a0e20033c87fc84ebba6b24d937 vs\n"
"afd8c60d7908b2b0e2d95ad0b333920aea9892eb', 'Invalid information uploaded\n"
"to the server')\n"
"The package microcode_ctl-1.17-102.57.62.1.x86_64 which is referenced by\n"
"patch microcode_ctl-8413 was not found in the database. This patch has\n"
"been skipped.\n"
msgstr ""
"Repo Sync Errors: (50, u'checksums did not match\n"
"326a904c2fbd7a0e20033c87fc84ebba6b24d937 vs\n"
"afd8c60d7908b2b0e2d95ad0b333920aea9892eb', 'Invalid information uploaded\n"
"to the server')\n"
"The package microcode_ctl-1.17-102.57.62.1.x86_64 which is referenced by\n"
"patch microcode_ctl-8413 was not found in the database. This patch has\n"
"been skipped.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:18
msgid ""
"You can resolve this error by running the synchronization from the command "
"prompt with the [command]``-Y`` option:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການລັນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງຄຳສັ່ງດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ [command]``-Y``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-repo-sync --channel <channelname> -Y\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-repo-sync --channel <channelname> -Y\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:20
msgid ""
"This option verifies the repository data before the synchronization, rather "
"than relying on locally cached checksums."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວກ່ອນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ, ແທນທີ່ຈະໄປອາໄສ checksums ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນ cache ຂອງເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connection Timeout"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໝົດເວລາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:22
msgid "If the download times out with the following error:"
msgstr "ຖ້າການດາວໂຫລດໝົດເວລາດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຜິດພາດດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"28, 'Operation too slow. Less than 1000 bytes/sec transferred the last 300 "
"seconds\n"
msgstr "28, 'Operation too slow. Less than 1000 bytes/sec transferred the last 300 seconds\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:24
msgid ""
"You can resolve this error by specifying [literal]``reposync_timeout`` and "
"[literal]``reposync_minrate`` configuration values in "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``.  By default, when less than 1000 bytes per "
"second are transferred in 300 secs, the download is aborted.  You can adjust "
"the number of bytes per second with [literal]``reposync_minrate``, and the "
"number of seconds to wait with [literal]``reposync_timeout``."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການລະບຸຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [literal]``reposync_timeout`` ແລະ [literal]``reposync_minrate`` ໃນ [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ເມື່ອມີການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໜ້ອຍກວ່າ 1000 ໄບຕ໌ຕໍ່ວິນາທີໃນເວລາ 300 ວິນາທີ, ການດາວໂຫລດຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກ. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບຈຳນວນໄບຕ໌ຕໍ່ວິນາທີໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [literal]``reposync_minrate``, ແລະ ປັບຈຳນວນວິນາທີທີ່ຈະລໍຖ້າໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [literal]``reposync_timeout``."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manually Trusting the Key During reposync"
msgstr "ການຍອມຮັບຄີ (Key) ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນລະຫວ່າງການ reposync"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:26
msgid ""
"It is possible that in some cases when [command]``reposync`` is run, you may "
"need to accept the GPG key manually.  For example:"
msgstr "ເປັນໄປໄດ້ວ່າໃນບາງກໍລະນີເມື່ອລັນ [command]``reposync``, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງຍອມຮັບ GPG key ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# spacewalk-repo-sync -c nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"17:07:40 ======================================\n"
"17:07:40 | Channel: nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"17:07:40 ======================================\n"
"17:07:40 Sync of channel started.\n"
"New repository or package signing key received:\n"
"  Repository:       nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"  Key Fingerprint:  610C 7B14 E068 A878 070D A4E9 9CD0 A493 D42D 0685\n"
"  Key Name:         cudatools <cudatools@nvidia.com>\n"
"  Key Algorithm:    RSA 4096\n"
"  Key Created:      Thu Apr 14 16:04:01 2022\n"
"  Key Expires:      (does not expire)\n"
"  Rpm Name:         gpg-pubkey-d42d0685-62589a51\n"
"    Note: Signing data enables the recipient to verify that no modifications "
"occurred after the data\n"
"    were signed. Accepting data with no, wrong or unknown signature can lead "
"to a corrupted system\n"
"    and in extreme cases even to a system compromise.\n"
"    Note: A GPG pubkey is clearly identified by its fingerprint. Do not rely "
"on the key's name. If\n"
"    you are not sure whether the presented key is authentic, ask the "
"repository provider or check\n"
"    their web site. Many providers maintain a web page showing the "
"fingerprints of the GPG keys they\n"
"    are using.\n"
"Do you want to reject the key, trust temporarily, or trust always? [r/t/a/?] "
"(r):\n"
msgstr ""
"# spacewalk-repo-sync -c nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"17:07:40 ======================================\n"
"17:07:40 | Channel: nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"17:07:40 ======================================\n"
"17:07:40 Sync of channel started.\n"
"New repository or package signing key received:\n"
"  Repository:       nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"  Key Fingerprint:  610C 7B14 E068 A878 070D A4E9 9CD0 A493 D42D 0685\n"
"  Key Name:         cudatools <cudatools@nvidia.com>\n"
"  Key Algorithm:    RSA 4096\n"
"  Key Created:      Thu Apr 14 16:04:01 2022\n"
"  Key Expires:      (does not expire)\n"
"  Rpm Name:         gpg-pubkey-d42d0685-62589a51\n"
"    Note: Signing data enables the recipient to verify that no modifications occurred after the data\n"
"    were signed. Accepting data with no, wrong or unknown signature can lead to a corrupted system\n"
"    and in extreme cases even to a system compromise.\n"
"    Note: A GPG pubkey is clearly identified by its fingerprint. Do not rely on the key's name. If\n"
"    you are not sure whether the presented key is authentic, ask the repository provider or check\n"
"    their web site. Many providers maintain a web page showing the fingerprints of the GPG keys they\n"
"    are using.\n"
"Do you want to reject the key, trust temporarily, or trust always? [r/t/a/?] (r):\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Taskomatic"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Taskomatic"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Repository metadata regeneration is a relatively intensive process, so "
"Taskomatic can take several minutes to complete.  Additionally, if "
"Taskomatic crashes, repository metadata regeneration can be interrupted."
msgstr "ການສ້າງ metadata ຂອງຄັງເກັບຊອບແວຄືກັນໃໝ່ເປັນຂະບວນການທີ່ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ Taskomatic ອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍນາທີເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຖ້າ Taskomatic ຫຼົ້ມ, ການສ້າງ metadata ຄືນໃໝ່ກໍອາດຈະຖືກຂັດຈັງຫວະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If Taskomatic is still running, or if the process has crashed, package "
"updates can seem available in the {webui}, but do not appear on the client, "
"and attempts to update the client fail.  In this case, the [command]``zypper "
"ref`` command shows an error like this:"
msgstr "ຖ້າ Taskomatic ຍັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ຫຼື ຖ້າຂະບວນການຫຼົ້ມ, ການອັບເດດແພັກເກດອາດຈະເຫັນວ່າມີໃຫ້ໃນ {webui}, ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ປະກົດຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ຄວາມພະຍາຍາມໃນການອັບເດດເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``zypper ref`` ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Valid metadata not found at specified URL\n"
msgstr "Valid metadata not found at specified URL\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:6
msgid ""
"To correct this, determine if Taskomatic is still in the process of "
"generating repository metadata, or if a crash could have occurred.  Wait for "
"metadata regeneration to complete or restart Taskomatic after a crash in "
"order for client updates to be carried out correctly."
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າ Taskomatic ຍັງຢູ່ໃນຂະບວນການສ້າງ metadata ຫຼື ບໍ່, ຫຼື ມີການຫຼົ້ມເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ໃຫ້ລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າການສ້າງ metadata ຄືນໃໝ່ຈະສຳເລັດ ຫຼື ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ Taskomatic ໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກການຫຼົ້ມ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການອັບເດດເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດດຳເນີນການໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Taskomatic Problems"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Taskomatic"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, check the "
"[path]``/var/log/rhn/rhn_taskomatic_daemon.log`` file to determine if any "
"metadata regeneration processes are still running, or if a crash occurred."
msgstr "ໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌ [path]``/var/log/rhn/rhn_taskomatic_daemon.log`` ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າຂະບວນການສ້າງ metadata ຄືນໃໝ່ຍັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ຫຼື ບໍ່, ຫຼື ມີການຫຼົ້ມເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:9
msgid "Restart taskomatic:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ taskomatic ໃໝ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "service taskomatic restart\n"
msgstr "service taskomatic restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the Taskomatic log files, you can identify the section related to "
"metadata regeneration by looking for opening and closing lines that look "
"like this:"
msgstr "ໃນໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກຂອງ Taskomatic, ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸພາກສ່ວນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການສ້າງ metadata ຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ໂດຍການຊອກຫາແຖວເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສິ້ນສຸດທີ່ຄືກັບແບບນີ້:"

